pos/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/commits/0a834c59c233f99ac275c20fda6a544ba3af3e82"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/commits/65e5d4ac649d7c0d49c4ecb8e8fd2792dac912a9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T09:41:13Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T09:53:50Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Bump hex-service-kit to v0.0.11: trace only through the collector\n\nDecision D1: build_tracer refuses an unset OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT instead of\nexporting straight to Cloud Trace around the collector''s GenAI-content redaction, and\ntakes no project argument any more.\n\n- pyproject.toml and the locks: hex-service-kit v0.0.11 (ec2d724). The only other lock\n  movement is opentelemetry-exporter-gcp-trace and its dependencies leaving with the\n  kit''s otel extra, where this repo resolved it.\n- adapters/gcp/tracer.py: build_tracer(service=...) only.\n- tests/contract: the managed tracer''s documented refusal is now\n  CollectorEndpointRequiredError; on-prem keys off a new onprem_refuses field; a new\n  test keeps the old guarantee that with a collector configured and no SDK a span\n  degrades to a no-op.\n- settings, config, Terraform variable and adoption notes stop describing a direct\n  Cloud Trace path that no longer exists.\n\nRelocked without --upgrade: fleet-deps bump-commons'' --upgrade relock moved 0\nunrelated pins here, and those were reverted.","tree":{"sha":"3107ba5c7c246fe63d8ee2ed837859cb1f5bfcbc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/git/trees/3107ba5c7c246fe63d8ee2ed837859cb1f5bfcbc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/git/commits/65e5d4ac649d7c0d49c4ecb8e8fd2792dac912a9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/commit/65e5d4ac649d7c0d49c4ecb8e8fd2792dac912a9","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh_u9oAKDY1ZTVkNGFjNjQ5ZDdjMGQ0OWM0ZWNiOGU4ZmQyNzkyZGFjOTEyYTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/commit/76f5d67dad27e3d9ea6937bd3850891521f81c33","sha":"76f5d67dad27e3d9ea6937bd3850891521f81c33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/commits/76f5d67dad27e3d9ea6937bd3850891521f81c33"}],"sha":"65e5d4ac649d7c0d49c4ecb8e8fd2792dac912a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/commits/65e5d4ac649d7c0d49c4ecb8e8fd2792dac912a9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/commits/76f5d67dad27e3d9ea6937bd3850891521f81c33/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T04:34:19Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T04:38:18Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Screen every generation call through a fail-closed guardrail port (rule R1)\n\nPhase P3 of the guardrail/registry/observability plan for this repo,\nadopting the fixed design from hex-service-template.\n\n- ports/guardrail.py, adapters/{local,gcp,onprem}/guardrail.py: the\n  template''s fixed adapters. Model Armor allows only when\n  filter_match_state.name is NO_MATCH_FOUND and invocation_result.name\n  is SUCCESS (the earlier str() substring test never blocked), calls\n  with model_armor.timeout_seconds, and lets API errors propagate. The\n  local heuristic is word-bounded and matches DAN case-sensitively.\n- domain/dispute_service.py: all three generation calls are screened in\n  both directions. intake: the conversation reference and transcript\n  INPUT, the label OUTPUT. draft_representment: the dispute id and each\n  evidence document INPUT, then the prompt as sent, the draft OUTPUT.\n  regulator_response (previously unscreened): the id, category and\n  redacted narrative INPUT, then the request as sent, the returned\n  draft OUTPUT. Sanitized text is used exactly as given; a rewritten\n  structured prompt refuses. A block, or a guardrail that raises, is\n  audited BLOCKED under the refused action and never yields a partial\n  result. The API answers 400 on the regulator route too.\n- kernel.py: GuardrailVerdict refuses allowed-without-text and\n  blocked-with-text at construction; Decision.BLOCKED.\n- config.py, settings.yaml, controls.py: DISPUTES_GUARDRAIL three-state\n  switch, ModelArmorSettings with template, regional host and a\n  validated timeout, and a boot refusal with the guardrail on and no\n  template named.\n- infra/terraform: model_armor.tf gated on model_armor_full_capabilities\n  with template_metadata, roles/modelarmor.user, the API, the VPC-SC\n  entry, the google-beta provider and its lock entry, the mock in\n  production_edge.tftest.hcl, the DISPUTES_GUARDRAIL env on Cloud Run,\n  and tfvars.example stating the asia-southeast1 capability limit.\n- pyproject.toml, requirements-gcp.lock: google-cloud-modelarmor in the\n  gcp extra (0.7.1; no other pin moved).\n- scripts/demo.py: a guardrail row in EXIT_CALLS.\n- tests: the SDK-free verdict mirror, the real-enum mapping test (skips\n  without the SDK unless DISPUTES_REQUIRE_MODEL_ARMOR_SDK=1), and the\n  screening suite across all three calls, split injections, rewrites,\n  empty sanitized text and fail-closed errors.\n- Docs: COMPLIANCE R1, ARCHITECTURE, runbook, on-prem migration, the\n  FAQs, model card, ADOPTING and practices audit.","tree":{"sha":"8900fe1f8cf73f5ffa006a90bb7d17e422de3868","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/git/trees/8900fe1f8cf73f5ffa006a90bb7d17e422de3868"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/git/commits/76f5d67dad27e3d9ea6937bd3850891521f81c33","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"U