 removal follows from a moved\nparent no longer requiring it):\n- ruff 0.16.5->0.16.7","tree":{"sha":"4a919886a4708d16fe6e8fe84c3d89399e0bfe60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/git/trees/4a919886a4708d16fe6e8fe84c3d89399e0bfe60"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/git/commits/dc389977e0e1bf761f2af9992e2e0ad09858a52c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/commit/dc389977e0e1bf761f2af9992e2e0ad09858a52c","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh_u9oAKGRjMzg5OTc3ZTBlMWJmNzYxZjJhZjk5OTJlMmUwYWQwOTg1OGE1MmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/commit/a046c48f85940f7c5e19fb1261c950aff03c800b","sha":"a046c48f85940f7c5e19fb1261c950aff03c800b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/commits/a046c48f85940f7c5e19fb1261c950aff03c800b"}],"sha":"dc389977e0e1bf761f2af9992e2e0ad09858a52c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/commits/dc389977e0e1bf761f2af9992e2e0ad09858a52c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/commits/a046c48f85940f7c5e19fb1261c950aff03c800b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:40:48Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:44:25Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Correct docs that say the review router refuses at request time\n\nThe service now refuses to boot under the managed profile when review\nrouting is on and HUMAN_REVIEW_URL is unset, DISPUTES_REVIEW_ROUTING switches\nrouting, and a hand-off that fails at request time is reported as\nreview_routing \"failed\" and logged. Some documents still said the\nmanaged router refuses the escalation at request time rather than\nswallowing it, and .env.example named no switch. Routing off needs no console.\nDocumentation only; no practices-audit verdict changed.","tree":{"sha":"6b904ec2af07ca92b5c8f2de239a7e98aa7620a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/git/trees/6b904ec2af07ca92b5c8f2de239a7e98aa7620a4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/git/commits/a046c48f85940f7c5e19fb1261c950aff03c800b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/commit/a046c48f85940f7c5e19fb1261c950aff03c800b","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh_u9oAKGEwNDZjNDhmODU5NDBmN2M1ZTE5ZmIxMjYxYzk1MGFmZjAzYzgwMGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/commit/040d11577b3ebe7427158479bf4ae8da5616ec31","sha":"040d11577b3ebe7427158479bf4ae8da5616ec31","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/commits/040d11577b3ebe7427158479bf4ae8da5616ec31"}],"sha":"a046c48f85940f7c5e19fb1261c950aff03c800b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/commits/a046c48f85940f7c5e19fb1261c950aff03c800b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/commits/040d11577b3ebe7427158479bf4ae8da5616ec31/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:26:12Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:28:50Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Correct the review-routing comments to the boot refusal\n\nThe variables.tf header and the review_url comment in settings.yaml still\nsaid the managed review router refuses to swallow an escalation when\nHUMAN_REVIEW_URL is empty. Since the runtime control switches landed that\nis false: the service refuses at BOOT when review routing is on and no console\nis named, and DISPUTES_REVIEW_ROUTING=false switches routing off, so\nhuman_review_url is only required with review_routing_enabled on.\n\nComment-only; no behaviour changes.","tree":{"sha":"72179f0413e12116c2915399448245055896f997","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/git/trees/72179f0413e12116c2915399448245055896f997"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/git/commits/040d11577b3ebe7427158479bf4ae8da5616ec31","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/commit/040d11577b3ebe7427158479bf4ae8da5616ec31","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh_u9oAKDA0MGQxMTU3N2IzZWJlNzQyNzE1ODQ3OWJmNGFlOGRhNTYxNmVjMzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/commit/c84501d2c8232484a6c3ca4edb146c6396f20d1f","sha":"c84501d2c8232484a6c3ca4edb146c6396f20d1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/commits/c84501d2c8232484a6c3ca4edb146c6396f20d1f"}],"sha":"040d11577b3ebe7427158479bf4ae8da5616ec31","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/commits/040d11577b3ebe7427158479bf4ae8da5616ec31"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/commits/c84501d2c8232484a6c3ca4edb146c6396f20d1f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:06:42Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:18:11Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Wire the console to the real dispute routes\n\nThe console posted the template''s {subject, text} to POST /v1/triage, a route this service does\nnot serve, so every submit was a 404 and none of the dispute capabilities could be reached from\nthe console.\n\nIt now edits one fictional card-scheme dispute (DSP-DEMO-1001, reason code 10.4, filed nine days\nafter the transaction) as JSON and posts it to the route the chosen action names: POST\n/v1/disputes/open with { dispute, as_of } by default, or /v1/disputes/abuse,\n/v1/disputes/representment or /v1/disputes/regulator with { dispute }. The tenant never enters\nthe body; the server takes it from the verified principal.\n\ntests/unit/test_console_matches_api.py reads every fetch(API + ...) in ui/app/ and holds it\nagainst the live route table: path and method served, every required field sent, no field the\nmodel silently drops. It failed against the old console (POST /v1/triage is not served) and\npasses against this one.","tree":{"sha":"e0a005f8f5eebbd91b7d8a8feebb11abaeb5a6ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/git/trees/e0a005f8f5eebbd91b7d8a8feebb11abaeb5a6ca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/git/commits/c84501d2c8232484a6c3ca4edb146c6396f20d1f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/commit/c84501d2c8232484a6c3ca4edb146c6396f20d1f","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh_u9oAKGM4NDUwMWQyYzgyMzI0ODRhNmMzY2E0ZWRiMTQ2YzYzOTZmMjBkMWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/commit/f7d3b90682c0b628e9ce8df56041fd5fb0fdbdbc","sha":"f7d3b90682c0b628e9ce8df56041fd5fb0fdbdbc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/commits/f7d3b90682c0b628e9ce8df56041fd5fb0fdbdbc"}],"sha":"c84501d2c8232484a6c3ca4edb146c6396f20d1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/commits/c84501d2c8232484a6c3ca4edb146c6396f20d1f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/commits/f7d3b90682c0b628e9ce8df56041fd5fb0fdbdbc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T10:27:57Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T10:30:46Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Switch review routing, refuse at boot without a console, report hand-offs\n\nApplies the fleet''s runtime-control contract (template shape, after aml-alert-triage). Review\nrouting is the one cheap runtime control this service has, so it is the one switch.\n\n- DISPUTES_REVIEW_ROUTING is read once at settings load in three states: unset is on, a\n  boolean wins, emptied or unrecognised refuses at boot. Off binds a disabled router and logs\n  one warning per process, however many containers the agent tools build.\n- Under gcp, routing on with no HUMAN_REVIEW_URL refuses at boot. It used to surface as a 500\n  on the first ineligible dispute, abusive refund or unclassifiable intake, after the outcome\n  had already been audited and the case transitioned.\n- Routing runs inside the domain dispute service, so the open, abuse and intake paths on the\n  API, the agent tools and the CLI each pass their own recording wrapper in through\n  config.build_service and report review_routing (routed, failed, off, not_required). A\n  hand-off that fails no longer fails the request: the result carries an empty review_ref and\n  the failure is logged. Representment and regulator drafts require review but are never\n  routed, so they gain no field.\n- Terraform gains review_routing_enabled, sets the service''s switch from it, and relaxes the\n  edge''s console requirement only when routing is stated off; a new plan test holds that.\n- pii-kit masking here is minimisation, not a redaction port, so it gains no switch.\n- SPEC, COMPLIANCE, ADOPTING, the runbook and two FAQs no longer say the router refuses at\n  request time. The console prints a plain-words routing line above its raw JSON.","tree":{"sha":"144fed017722b9d18b74c67609d33ded7351470f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/git/trees/144fed017722b9d18b74c67609d33ded7351470f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/git/commits/f7d3b90682c0b628e9ce8df56041fd5fb0fdbdbc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/commit/f7d3b90682c0b628e9ce8df56041fd5fb0fdbdbc","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh_u9oAKGY3ZDNiOTA2ODJjMGI2MjhlOWNlOGRmNTYwNDFmZDVmYjBmZGJkYmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/commit/b30a30332eac0d00a98e04e3d54ba09109168105","sha":"b30a30332eac0d00a98e04e3d54ba09109168105","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/commits/b30a30332eac0d00a98e04e3d54ba09109168105"}],"sha":"f7d3b90682c0b628e9ce8df56041fd5fb0fdbdbc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/commits/f7d3b90682c0b628e9ce8df56041fd5fb0fdbdbc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/commits/b30a30332eac0d00a98e04e3d54ba09109168105/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T03:50:40Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T03:59:48Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Take the default off the audit bucket lock\n\nworm_locked defaulted to true, so the first apply of this stack in any\nproject locked its audit bucket irreversibly for the whole retention window,\nwith nothing in that deployment''s own tfvars saying so. The fleet decided on\n2026-09-12 that an irreversible control takes no default; this stack was one\nof 33 that sweep never reached.\n\nA plan now refuses until the deployment states the lock. The Terraform tests\nstate it once per file in the production form, still assert that a stated\nlock sits on the six-month floor, and gain a run proving the unlocked posture\ncreates an unlocked bucket. That run fails if the lock is ever hard-coded\nback into the bucket, which every other run would miss.","tree":{"sha":"ac4e14e3ee936e645757c1710f3d7dd57593d7c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/git/trees/ac4e14e3ee936e645757c1710f3d7dd57593d7c1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/git/commits/b30a30332eac0d00a98e04e3d54ba09109168105","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/commit/b30a30332eac0d00a98e04e3d54ba09109168105","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh_u9oAKGIzMGEzMDMzMmVhYzBkMDBhOThlMDRlM2Q1NGJhMDkxMDkxNjgxMDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/commit/a9e30341221c8a7571191b0a9c564191