":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/commits/19eceff14e765c36dd7a444d14cdb858772095bf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T00:03:17Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T00:06:52Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Align the eval harness with the model the runtime actually calls\n\nThe managed adapter already calls `gemini-3.5-flash`, but `eval/run_eval.py`\nnamed `gemini-2.5-flash` to the promotion-gate client, so the promotion record\ndescribed a different model from the deployed one.\n\nBoth are served in asia-southeast1 with a documented Singapore ML-processing\ncommitment. Verified against the publisher on 2026-09-03: 3.6, 3.7 and 3.8 Flash\nall commit ML processing to the `us` and `eu` multi-regions only, so 3.5 is the\nnewest Flash this residency boundary permits.\n\nModel card updated to match.","tree":{"sha":"19e0e2e2a66a00373319d5cd7ad3dd175f3a85cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/git/trees/19e0e2e2a66a00373319d5cd7ad3dd175f3a85cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/git/commits/19eceff14e765c36dd7a444d14cdb858772095bf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}"