819cda089cd6a6e58325d8f5e70874e58e5e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/commits/24d819cda089cd6a6e58325d8f5e70874e58e5e6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/commits/c10da7c58854f2db9d534e576c284c3e2fdb9d07/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T07:57:50Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T07:57:50Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Re-point the IAP negative matrix at the refusals the verifier actually raises (#12)\n\nThe module skipped wherever google-auth was absent, which is every SDK-free gate, so\nnothing had compared its expectations against the adapter in a long time. Run with the\nruntime lockfile installed it was 10 failed, 12 passed -- every failure a stale regex,\nnot a security hole: each cell rejected its assertion, with a more specific reason than\nthe generic \"verification failed\" the test still demanded.\n\nThe replacements are narrower than what they replace. Each cell now names the exact\nrefusal it exists to prove, so a refusal for the wrong reason fails the cell instead of\nsatisfying it: \"declares alg ''none'', which means it is UNSIGNED\" is a different property\nfrom \"unparseable\", and \"missing required claim(s): sub\" is a different property from\n\"missing required claim(s): email\".\n\n22 passed after the change, in all 31 repositories.\n\nCo-authored-by: Ashish Awasthi <72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"64a9598f55257006f10824bc31dc21c120530da8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/git/trees/64a9598f55257006f10824bc31dc21c120530da8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/disputes-chargebacks-manager/git/commits/c10da7c58854f2db9d534e576c284c3e2fdb9d07","verification":{"payload":"tree 64a9598f55257006f10824bc31dc21c120530da8\nparent b98d6a9721766015189f3d1d19b5384efc199160\nauthor Ashish <ashish.awasthi@gmail.com> 1787644670 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787644670 +0800\n\nRe-point the IAP negative matrix at the refusals the verifier actually raises (#12)\n\nThe module skipped wherever google-auth was absent, which is every SDK-free gate, so\nnothing had compared its expectations against the adapter in a long time. Run with the\nruntime lockfile installed it was 10 failed, 12 passed -- every failure a stale regex,\nnot a security hole: each cell rejected its assertion, with a more specific reason than\nthe generic \"verification failed\" the test still demanded.\n\nThe replacements are narrower than what they replace. Each cell now names the exact\nrefusal it exists to prove, so a refusal for the wrong reason fails the cell instead of\nsatisfying it: \"declares alg ''none'', which means it is UNSIGNED\" is a different property\nfrom \"unparseable\", and \"missing required claim(s): sub\" is a different property from\n\"missing required claim(s): email\".\n\n22 passed after the change, in all 31 repositories.\n\nCo-authored-by: Ashish Awasthi <72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjUr+CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA58wQAH7rNWka2hKiaN9MY5uDUwW7\n5AgdkTkuWeTZAC+ODu6/9yFoXr6awIq96xdvUCZDcIq6nh3cwOrHF2D9dpRs45BI\nbg8Rm3IwJg56jcwC9yTqcZxDrHyFFgCscxQXLLXTE6gDn80KgfID/pS/KcaWVhkZ\nEjNZTiig3ecndlv+BnOQn1ERyoLMFZ4mfamCiAL7SlslxAMIKBFQoKKWEDpX/T3j\nryeoMTHhnDXiSllO1gPhldccrYZ+kZ5qe7RGpExdAyRPorsx54Bls08I/gmoOZpS\nOlJcAQq4xzzr9/E2AZxqeLmjbUZPck6VD7HlSt1oIDYLgjlsKxBeOXzHcz8/dTzk\nWOXsxcyUhd193jyOnWR6pWhoCYItv8xEuxVqWLVoSjFuAvKB5gnA7WnFNhw29KH2\n9W+1R8CxjsZ+S1b4o42HD6xqX9ZBi8RUKqMH2egov6kg+/Um4+3Cj5wZdV5ofYXC\nULb9E0+c3GS26waOSvB4HcweZmHw6o/3hIw40IWf0mfseCCTXq7iQMex4FHfkjr5\n3E5ub0G+dZQJUxIIUMFi44Y8J0Vzm73qmhnvn5Lc38NwCHdBwtZgqYaoGAX10n/0\nEdB67yPsv9L6GqX9B7iy2lW8klti21Y2z50davn0FXdmjgV9o8HteG40kPBF80RG\nIDv+0gxooXilFgnEwNr9\n=bv5V\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-25T07:57:51Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_vie