Adopt the fixed guardrail design from hex-service-template: a GuardrailPort\nwith local heuristic, Model Armor and on-prem placeholder adapters, the\nCFP_GUARDRAIL three-state switch, and a boot refusal when the guardrail is\non under gcp with no template named.\n\nThe Model Armor adapter allows only on NO_MATCH_FOUND with invocation_result\nSUCCESS, read by enum name, with a per-call deadline; the copied adapter this\nreplaces compared str() of a proto-plus IntEnum and allowed everything.\n\nConformityService screens the system name, the retrieval query and the\nnarration prompt as sent (input), and every grounding snippet and the\nnarrated reply (output), using each screen''s text exactly as given. A block\nor an undecided screen is audited BLOCKED and refuses the assessment; the\nscreens sit outside the narration fallback, so an on-prem NotImplementedError\ncan no longer be swallowed into the deterministic narrative.\n\nTerraform adds the regional template (template_metadata, partial-invocation\nflag stated false, capabilities gated), roles/modelarmor.user, the API in the\nperimeter, the google-beta provider, lock and tftest mock. The\ngoogle-cloud-modelarmor SDK is declared in the gcp extra and locked.","tree":{"sha":"c1141291fd22bd341e1039d11d8c95586c8f4acf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/ai-act-conformity-pack/git/trees/c1141291fd22bd341e1039d11d8c95586c8f4acf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/ai-act-conformity-pack/git/commits/06dd38b376bed3b5cc97042317f344d2da79b0f6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashis