"commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T22:01:15Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T22:07:34Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Model pills replace the provenance banner; note what answered\n\n- Bump hex-service-kit to v0.0.10 and install_answer_provenance(app), so every\n  response names the model that answered (X-Answered-By) and whether it searched\n  (X-Search-Used).\n- The Gemini narrator and the Gemini retrieval adapter note the model they\n  called; the local narrator notes its stub name. No call attaches an online\n  search tool, so nothing notes search. No call sends a temperature.\n- generator_model no longer honours use_hard_reasoning.\n- ModelPills (top right) replaces ProvenanceBanner; the proxy forwards both\n  answer headers.","tree":{"sha":"0f313d759443c1b465debc59bf7251f4ee91d68e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/ai-act-conformity-pack/git/trees/0f313d759443c1b465debc59bf7251f4ee91d68e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/ai-act-conformity-pack/git/commits/815b4c9154d4159115dd9b71d863c1785d85d5cf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a