eb10630e3828d7fb3f2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/ai-act-conformity-pack/commits/2ad45544dccded59f746eb10630e3828d7fb3f2b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/ai-act-conformity-pack/commits/fcaaf1f9fa8b7f74eea2a333d025830e27b9a981/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T08:44:00Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T12:09:52Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Make customer-managed encryption optional, and off by default\n\nEvery binding to the stack''s Cloud KMS key now sits behind cmek_enabled,\ndefault false: the key ring, the key, every grant to a service agent, and\nevery store, log bucket, registry and revision that took the key. Block\nbindings became dynamic blocks; scalar bindings read the key through one(),\nwhich is null when the key does not exist and omits the attribute rather\nthan pointing it at nothing. The Terraform tests that assert on key material\nturn the gate on to keep meaning what they meant.\n\nWhy the default is off: a key ring can never be deleted, a log bucket that\nhas CMEK can never drop it, and registries and document stores take their\nkey at creation. None of that changes an answer or a screen, and everything\nis encrypted at rest with Google-managed keys regardless. A deployment with\na customer whose data it must shred, whose key access must be audited or\nwhose keys must live in an HSM sets it true in its own tfvars BEFORE the\nfirst apply. Where a stack already applied it, the key''s prevent_destroy\nrefuses a plan that omits the line, which is the right answer: the stores it\nbound stay bound.\n\nThe vendored deploy-and-residency-hardening skill says the same.","tree":{"sha":"c759c399eb28a7602ed875d8378ae194b169a238","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/ai-act-conformity-pack/git/trees/c759c399eb28a7602ed875d8378ae194b169a238"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/ai-act-conformity-pack/git/commits/fcaaf1f9fa8b7f74eea2a333d025830e27b9a981","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/u