 dependencies leaving with the\n  kit''s otel extra, where this repo resolved it.\n- adapters/gcp/tracer.py: build_tracer(service=...) only.\n- tests/contract: the managed tracer''s documented refusal is now\n  CollectorEndpointRequiredError; on-prem keys off a new onprem_refuses field; a new\n  test keeps the old guarantee that with a collector configured and no SDK a span\n  degrades to a no-op.\n- settings, config, Terraform variable and adoption notes stop describing a direct\n  Cloud Trace path that no longer exists.\n\nRelocked without --upgrade: fleet-deps bump-commons'' --upgrade relock moved 0\nunrelated pins here, and those were reverted.","tree":{"sha":"3d52546c045dd1ddb8cffcdc4b12e01caa8f8363","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conflicts-gifts-pad-register/git/trees/3d52546c045dd1ddb8cffcdc4b12e01caa8f8363"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conflicts-gifts-pad-register/git/commits/bb1b77254e2599c4611d79859b1d798d2291d4b7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/conflicts-gifts-pad-register/commit/bb1b77254e2599c4611d79859b1d798d2291d4b7","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiAs9oAKGJiMWI3NzI1NGUyNTk5YzQ2MTFkNzk4NTliMWQ3OThkMjI5MWQ0Yjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/conflicts-gifts-pad-register/commit/fcab37906e7e8f5f53a991551d86aedc7d524a83","sha":"fcab37906e7e8f5f53a991551d86aedc7d524a83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conflicts-gifts-pad-register/commits/fcab37906e7e8f5f53a991551d86aedc7d524a83"}],"sha":"bb1b77254e2599c4611d79859b1d798d2291d4b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conflicts-gifts-pad-register/commits/bb1b77254e2599c4611d79859b1d798d2291d4b7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conflicts-gifts-pad-register/commits/fcab37906e7e8f5f53a991551d86aedc7d524a83/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T04:33:30Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T04:35:58Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Screen both generation calls through the guardrail, with Model Armor on gcp\n\nRule R1, plan phase P3. GuardrailPort screens the counterparty-resolution\nand narration calls: the prompt as sent INPUT before the model, the raw\nreply OUTPUT before it is parsed or grounded, and each screen''s text is\nused exactly as given. Both calls are optional by design, so a refusal (a\nblock, or a guardrail that raised) skips the model step, uses the\ndeterministic fallback, and is audited on its own Decision.BLOCKED row\nwithout the refused text.\n\nAdapters follow the fixed template design: Model Armor allows only on\nNO_MATCH_FOUND with invocation_result SUCCESS, read by enum name, with a\nper-call deadline; local is the bounded heuristic; onprem refuses.\nCONFLICTSPAD_GUARDRAIL switches it, and gcp refuses to boot with it on and\nno template. Terraform adds the google-beta Model Armor template (full\ncapabilities gated, template_metadata stated), roles/modelarmor.user, the\nAPI in the perimeter, and a guardrail_blocks metric. The SDK is in the gcp\nextra and requirements-gcp.lock, the onprem exit tour covers the port, and\nthe mapping is proved SDK-free and against the real modelarmor_v1 enums.","tree":{"sha":"951ec3efcce677c63be79ebaefffd1ec2ded3af5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conflicts-gifts-pad-register/git/trees/951ec3efcce677c63be79ebaefffd1ec2ded3af5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conflicts-gifts-pad-register/git/commits/fcab37906e7e8f5f53a991551d86aedc7d524a83","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api