0","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiAs9oAKDM2OTgyYzgyMGVmM2E2MzU0MjEyMzU5YmUwN2NiMDdlNGE1MGFlMTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/conflicts-gifts-pad-register/commit/d1c9e7816df73d6d5e9a527df0b224b1ff61b7dc","sha":"d1c9e7816df73d6d5e9a527df0b224b1ff61b7dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conflicts-gifts-pad-register/commits/d1c9e7816df73d6d5e9a527df0b224b1ff61b7dc"}],"sha":"36982c820ef3a6354212359be07cb07e4a50ae10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conflicts-gifts-pad-register/commits/36982c820ef3a6354212359be07cb07e4a50ae10"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conflicts-gifts-pad-register/commits/d1c9e7816df73d6d5e9a527df0b224b1ff61b7dc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:25:15Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:27:49Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Correct the review-routing comments to the boot refusal\n\nThe variables.tf header and the review_url comment in settings.yaml still\nsaid the managed review router refuses to swallow an escalation when\nHUMAN_REVIEW_URL is empty. Since the runtime control switches landed that\nis false: the service refuses at BOOT when review routing is on and no console\nis named, and CONFLICTSPAD_REVIEW_ROUTING=false switches routing off, so\nhuman_review_url is only required with review_routing_enabled on.\n\nComment-only; no behaviour changes.","tree":{"sha":"62ce787c1657d160cd0b7399d7165d8a153fab5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conflicts-gifts-pad-register/git/trees/62ce787c1657d160cd0b7399d7165d8a153fab5c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conflicts-gifts-pad-register/git/commits/d1c9e7816df73d6d5e9a527df0b224b1ff61b7dc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/conflicts-gifts-pad-register/commit/d1c9e7816df73d6d5e9a527df0b224b1ff61b7dc","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiAs9oAKGQxYzllNzgxNmRmNzNkNmQ1ZTlhNTI3ZGYwYjIyNGIxZmY2MWI3ZGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/conflicts-gifts-pad-register/commit/c947b53abf2d58cf9af7b523dc6dece810553ce1","sha":"c947b53abf2d58cf9af7b523dc6dece810553ce1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conflicts-gifts-pad-register/commits/c947b53abf2d58cf9af7b523dc6dece810553ce1"}],"sha":"d1c9e7816df73d6d5e9a527df0b224b1ff61b7dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conflicts-gifts-pad-register/commits/d1c9e7816df73d6d5e9a527df0b224b1ff61b7dc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conflicts-gifts-pad-register/commits/c947b53abf2d58cf9af7b523dc6dece810553ce1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:06:02Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:09:38Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Wire the console to the real assess call\n\nThe console posted the template''s {subject, text} to POST /v1/triage, a route this service\ndoes not serve, so every submit was a 404 and the console could never screen a declaration.\nThe API''s end-user call is POST /v1/assess with an AssessRequest: id, employee, employee_role,\nmarket, kind, description and as_of, plus the optional counterparty, amount_minor, currency and\ninstrument.\n\nThe console is now a declaration form with those fields, kind a select of the five\nDeclarationKind values and the instrument fields shown for a personal-account deal. It is\nprefilled with a fictional trader''s SGD 250.00 gift in SG, which the local profile escalates on\ngift_threshold and routes for review. After a successful screen it reads the entry back from\nGET /v1/register/{id}, which is what a reviewer sees. The tenant and actor stay the verified\nprincipal''s and are never in the body.\n\ntests/unit/test_console_matches_api.py reads every fetch(API + ...) in ui/app/ and holds it\nagainst the live route table: path and method served, every required field sent, no field the\nmodel silently drops. It failed against the old console (POST /v1/triage is not served) and\npasses against this one.","tree":{"sha":"5719c3c391fa87c3b4544246aa560a8cdda4cded","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conflicts-gifts-pad-register/git/trees/5719c3c391fa87c3b4544246aa560a8cdda4cded"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conflicts-gifts-pad-register/git/commits/c947b53abf2d58cf9af7b523dc6dece810553ce1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/conflicts-gifts-pad-register/commit/c947b53abf2d58cf9af7b523dc6dece810553ce1","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiAs9oAKGM5NDdiNTNhYmYyZDU4Y2Y5YWY3YjUyM2RjNmRlY2U4MTA1NTNjZTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/conflicts-gifts-pad-register/commit/d223a4ebb80eddf5bc25c255b030b676bfbc998b","sha":"d223a4ebb80eddf5bc25c255b030b676bfbc998b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conflicts-gifts-pad-register/commits/d223a4ebb80eddf5bc25c255b030b676bfbc998b"}],"sha":"c947b53abf2d58cf9af7b523dc6dece810553ce1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conflicts-gifts-pad-register/commits/c947b53abf2d58cf9af7b523dc6dece810553ce1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conflicts-gifts-pad-register/commits/d223a4ebb80eddf5bc25c255b030b676bfbc998b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T10:28:07Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T10:30:30Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Report no hand-off on a register read, not not_required\n\nGET /v1/register/{id} shares AssessResponse with POST /v1/assess, so after the review-routing\nswitch landed a read of a stored FLAGGED declaration answered review_routing \"not_required\",\na false statement about an escalated record. The hand-off belongs to the request that produced\nthe assessment, so a read now reports review_routing as null. A test holds it; it failed\nagainst the previous schema.","tree":{"sha":"03952252606a84a20d668eabcf597e9911ddcdec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conflicts-gifts-pad-register/git/trees/03952252606a84a20d668eabcf597e9911ddcdec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conflicts-gifts-pad-register/git/commits/d223a4ebb80eddf5bc25c255b030b676bfbc998b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/conflicts-gifts-pad-register/commit/d223a4ebb80eddf5bc25c255b030b676bfbc998b","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiAs9oAKGQyMjNhNGViYjgwZWRkZjViYzI1YzI1NWIwMzBiNjc2YmZiYzk5OGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/conflicts-gifts-pad-register/commit/2b77a0b8e8a8d0fbe57d0d1af0a6ffafa0998f30","sha":"2b77a0b8e8a8d0fbe57d0d1af0a6ffafa0998f30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conflicts-gifts-pad-register/commits/2b77a0b8e8a8d0fbe57d0d1af0a6ffafa0998f30"}],"sha":"d223a4ebb80eddf5bc25c255b030b676bfbc998b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conflicts-gifts-pad-register/commits/d223a4ebb80eddf5bc25c255b030b676bfbc998b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conflicts-gifts-pad-register/commits/2b77a0b8e8a8d0fbe57d0d1af0a6ffafa0998f30/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T10:20:43Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T10:23:16Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Switch review routing, refuse at boot without a console, report hand-offs\n\nTemplate-shape application of the fleet''s runtime-control contract. Review routing is the\none cheap runtime control this service has, so it is the one switch.\n\n- CONFLICTSPAD_REVIEW_ROUTING is read once at settings load in three states: unset is on, a\n  boolean wins, emptied or unrecognised refuses at boot. Off binds a disabled router and\n  logs one warning per process, however many containers are built.\n- Under gcp, routing on with no HUMAN_REVIEW_URL refuses at boot. It used to surface as a\n  failed request on the first escalation, after the assessment had been computed and audited.\n- POST /v1/assess, the assess_declaration agent tool and the CLI''s screen command hand off through a recording wrapper, so a hand-off that fails no longer\n  fails the assessment: the result carries review_routing (routed, failed, off, not_required)\n  and an empty review_ref, and the failure is logged. The console states the outcome in\n  plain words.\n- Terraform gains review_routing_enabled, sets the service''s switch from it, and relaxes the\n  edge''s console requirement only when routing is stated off; a new plan test holds that.\n- SPEC, COMPLIANCE, the practices audit, the adoption and compliance FAQs, .env.example and the runbook no longer say the managed router refuses at request time; they describe the boot refusal, the switch and the reported outcome.\n- pii-kit masking here protects the audit trail, tool results and the review payload rather\n  than a user''s free-text question, so it is not the redaction control the contract\n  switches, and it gains no switch.","tree":{"sha":"6033692434fa7472a40ae7ee5e8e884a1c0d23d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conflicts-gifts-pad-register/git/trees/6033692434fa7472a40ae7ee5e8e884a1c0d23d2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conflicts-gifts-pad-register/git/commits/2b77a0b8e8a8d0fbe57d0d1af0a6ffafa0998f30","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/conflicts-gifts-pad-register/commit/2b77a0b8e8a8d0fbe57d0d1af0a6ffafa0998f30","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiAs9oAKDJiNzdhMGI4ZThhOGQwZmJlNTdkMGQxYWYwYTZmZmFmYTA5OThmMzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/conflicts-gifts-pad-register/commit/3fa43006b277dd75101b0dab1f7862a12c9e9c83","sha":"3fa43006b277dd75101b0dab1f7862a12c9e9c83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conflicts-gifts-pad-register/commits/3fa43006b277dd75101b0dab1f7862a12c9e9c83"}],"sha":"2b77a0b8e8a8d0fbe57d0d1af0a6ffafa0998f30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conflicts-gifts-pad-register/commits/2b77a0b8e8a8d0fbe57d0d1af0a6ffafa0998f30"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conflicts-gifts-pad-register/commits/3fa43006b277dd75101b0dab1f7862a12c9e9c83/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T03:50:25Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T03:55:05Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Take the default off the audit bucket lock\n\nworm_locked defaulted to true, so the first apply of this stack in any\nproject locked its audit bucket irreversibly for the whole retention window,\nwith nothing in that deployment''s own tfvars saying so. The fleet decided on\n2026-09-12 that an irreversible control takes no default; this stack was one\nof 33 that sweep never reached.\n\nA plan now refuses until the deployment states the lock. The Terraform tests\nstate it once per file in the production form, still assert that a stated\nlock sits on the six-month floor, and gain a run proving the unlocked posture\ncreates an unlocked bucket. That run fails if the lock is ever hard-coded\nback into the bucket, which every other run would miss.","tree":{"sha":"2b2f4967e9b3d2d0daaa437ac80376fac68d15b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conflicts-gifts-pad-register/git/trees/2b2f4967e9b3d2d0daaa437ac80376fac68d15b8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conflicts-gifts-pad-register/git/commits/3fa43006b277dd75101b0dab1f7862a12c9e9c83","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner