hub.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/consumer-duty-monitoring/commits/56cd0170d38e1b8d72ba1b0ddf72cd40e4fb9151/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T22:02:28Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T22:07:48Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Model pills replace the provenance banner; note what answered\n\n- Bump hex-service-kit to v0.0.10 and install_answer_provenance(app), so every\n  response names the model that answered (X-Answered-By) and whether it searched\n  (X-Search-Used).\n- The local narrator notes its stub name; the gcp narrator refuses rather than\n  answering, so it notes nothing. The narration request carries no sampling\n  setting.\n- generator_model no longer honours use_hard_reasoning.\n- ModelPills (top right) replaces ProvenanceBanner; the proxy forwards both\n  answer headers.","tree":{"sha":"74de0a8b7b605bd6546f502e74a83b682615aace","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/consumer-duty-monitoring/git/trees/74de0a8b7b605bd6546f502e74a83b682615aace"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/consumer-duty-monitoring/git/commits/56cd0170d38e1b8d72ba1b0ddf72cd40e4fb9151","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravat