e2c37778a2063dc2","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiBE9oAKGYyNjA2OTRhNDhiN2I2NTgwZDlmNTA1ZGUyYzM3Nzc4YTIwNjNkYzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/consumer-duty-monitoring/commit/ff53578923ad6a5215bb0d2d7129df76453ab44c","sha":"ff53578923ad6a5215bb0d2d7129df76453ab44c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/consumer-duty-monitoring/commits/ff53578923ad6a5215bb0d2d7129df76453ab44c"}],"sha":"f260694a48b7b6580d9f505de2c37778a2063dc2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/consumer-duty-monitoring/commits/f260694a48b7b6580d9f505de2c37778a2063dc2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/consumer-duty-monitoring/commits/ff53578923ad6a5215bb0d2d7129df76453ab44c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T10:01:28Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T22:35:48Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Name the systems this repo depends on, instead of their catalog ids\n\nRepository names are unique across the organization, so a reader no longer has\nto resolve a code through a table to learn which system is meant. The catalog\ndropped its ID column, and this repository follows.\n\nBeyond prose, four identifier changes:\n\n- The review payload''s source_key prefix is the repository name. It is a dedup\n  key -- human-review-console queries on it and the local store makes it a\n  PRIMARY KEY -- so producers and the console have to agree, and the branch\n  carries the migration for rows written under the old prefix.\n- Terraform''s local.render_catalog_id becomes local.render_repository. It feeds\n  display names and descriptions, which update in place.\n- scripts/demo.py''s catalog id is deleted rather than renamed: a REPOSITORY\n  constant and a \"repository\" state key were already there beside it.\n- scripts/rename_fork.py loses --catalog-id, which had nothing left to rewrite.\n\nLines that outgrew the 100-column limit because a name is longer than an id are\nrewrapped rather than shortened by dropping the name. `ruff check`,\n`ruff format --check` and the offline tests are clean.\n\nDeployed resource identifiers are deliberately NOT changed: the Terraform\nname_prefix stems and the Secret Manager secret ids still carry the old\nlowercase id. Those name resources that exist in the deployment, and renaming a\nname_prefix destroys and recreates them, so they are an infrastructure\nmigration rather than a rename.","tree":{"sha":"6c667119ab3a02bcf78a23a8ade7b7676322cfd2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/consumer-duty-monitoring/git/trees/6c667119ab3a02bcf78a23a8ade7b7676322cfd2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/consumer-duty-monitoring/git/commits/ff53578923ad6a5215bb0d2d7129df76453ab44c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/consumer-duty-monitoring/commit/ff53578923ad6a5215bb0d2d7129df76453ab44c","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiBE9oAKGZmNTM1Nzg5MjNhZDZhNTIxNWJiMGQyZDcxMjlkZjc2NDUzYWI0NGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/consumer-duty-monitoring/commit/4a3eff953e5db3d713a703723ee1df7eb434d948","sha":"4a3eff953e5db3d713a703723ee1df7eb434d948","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/consumer-duty-monitoring/commits/4a3eff953e5db3d713a703723ee1df7eb434d948"}],"sha":"ff53578923ad6a5215bb0d2d7129df76453ab44c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/consumer-duty-monitoring/commits/ff53578923ad6a5215bb0d2d7129df76453ab44c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/consumer-duty-monitoring/commits/4a3eff953e5db3d713a703723ee1df7eb434d948/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T08:51:10Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T22:35:48Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Name the systems this repo depends on, instead of their catalog ids\n\nRepository names are unique across the organization, so a reader no longer\nresolves Hrz7 or Hrz4 through a table to learn that the escalation goes to\nhuman-review-console and the promotion verdict comes from model-quality-gate.\n\nThree changes are identifier changes, not prose:\n\n- source_key is the repository name. It is a dedup key: human-review-console\n  queries on it and the local store makes it a PRIMARY KEY, so this needs the\n  migration in the branch''s final step before the producers ship.\n- Terraform''s local.render_catalog_id becomes local.render_repository, so the\n  serving identity''s display name and the WORM bucket description name the\n  repository. Display names update in place.\n- scripts/demo.py had CATALOG_ID beside an existing REPOSITORY constant, and\n  the demo state carried both keys. The id is deleted rather than renamed onto\n  the name that was already there; render_ui.py and walkthrough.py read the one\n  that remains. rename_fork.py loses --catalog-id, which had nothing left to\n  rewrite.\n\nLines that outgrew the 100-column limit because a name is longer than an id are\nrewrapped. `ruff check` and `ruff format --check` are clean and the 504 offline\ntests pass.\n\nNOT changed, deliberately: the Terraform resource stem `rgc15-svc` and the\nsecret ids `hrz7-outbound-s2s` / `hrz7-actor-signing`. Those name resources that\nexist in the deployment, and renaming a name_prefix destroys and recreates them,\nso they are an infrastructure migration rather than a rename.","tree":{"sha":"d3a9c10a58fc45492253f934afd3afaf8bacde59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/consumer-duty-monitoring/git/trees/d3a9c10a58fc45492253f934afd3afaf8bacde59"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/consumer-duty-monitoring/git/commits/4a3eff953e5db3d713a703723ee1df7eb434d948","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/consumer-duty-monitoring/commit/4a3eff953e5db3d713a703723ee1df7eb434d948","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiBE9oAKDRhM2VmZjk1M2U1ZGIzZDcxM2E3MDM3MjNlZTFkZjdlYjQzNGQ5NDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/consumer-duty-monitoring/commit/736cbe3c6999a1026ee92adc390835ff8daa59db","sha":"736cbe3c6999a1026ee92adc390835ff8daa59db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/consumer-duty-monitoring/commits/736cbe3c6999a1026ee92adc390835ff8daa59db"}],"sha":"4a3eff953e5db3d713a703723ee1df7eb434d948","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/consumer-duty-monitoring/commits/4a3eff953e5db3d713a703723ee1df7eb434d948"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/29110?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/dependabot","id":49699333,"login":"dependabot[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDk2OTkzMzM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/consumer-duty-monitoring/commits/736cbe3c6999a1026ee92adc390835ff8daa59db/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T20:14:20Z","email":"49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"dependabot[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T22:22:00Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Bump the npm-minor-patch group across 1 directory with 2 updates\n\nBumps the npm-minor-patch group with 2 updates in the /ui directory: [next](https://github.com/vercel/next.js) and [@types/node](https://github.com/DefinitelyTyped/DefinitelyTyped/tree/HEAD/types/node).\n\n\nUpdates `next` from 16.3.3 to 16.3.4\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/vercel/next.js/releases)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/vercel/next.js/compare/v16.3.3...v16.3.4)\n\nUpdates `@types/node` from 26.4.0 to 26.4.1\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/DefinitelyTyped/DefinitelyTyped/releases)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/DefinitelyTyped/DefinitelyTyped/commits/HEAD/types/node)\n\n---\nupdated-dependencies:\n- dependency-name: next\n  dependency-version: 16.3.4\n  dependency-type: direct:production\n  update-type: version-update:semver-patch\n  dependency-group: npm-minor-patch\n- dependency-name: \"@types/node\"\n  dependency-version: 26.4.1\n  dependency-type: direct:development\n  update-type: version-update:semver-patch\n  dependency-group: npm-minor-patch\n...\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>","tree":{"sha":"60dbae0158148fac01cb1e35b862c92e2931bb16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/consumer-duty-monitoring/git/trees/60dbae0158148fac01cb1e35b862c92e2931bb16"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/consumer-duty-monitoring/git/commits/736cbe3c6999a1026ee92adc390835ff8daa59db","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashisha