ed{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/continuous-controls-monitoring/commits/2c577803e1b533f74f5ef7e059a226d4fbedd921/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T15:33:39Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T15:59:10Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Bump hex-service-kit to v0.0.12: GenAI conventions on the model span\n\nv0.0.12 adds gen_ai.operation.name and gen_ai.provider.name to the span\nrecord_token_usage writes, so traces group model calls as the OpenTelemetry\nGenAI conventions intend, and lowers the otel extra''s floors to 1.42 so it\ninstalls beside google-adk. No API change.\n\nRelocked so that only the kit pin moves; the repository''s own gate is green.","tree":{"sha":"f264a49c0b580fe9367dfa187eca47ef35cf8ef5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/continuous-controls-monitoring/git/trees/f264a49c0b580fe9367dfa187eca47ef35cf8ef5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/continuous-controls-monitoring/git/commits/2c577803e1b533f74f5ef7e059a226d4fbedd921","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/continuous-controls-monitoring/commit/2c577803e1b533f74f5ef7e059a226d4fbedd921","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiBcdoAKDJjNTc3ODAzZTFiNTMzZjc0ZjVlZjdlMDU5YTIyNmQ0ZmJlZGQ5MjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/continuous-controls-monitoring/commit/c8f43778ed113db26f9171636c2dbdac575419aa","sha":"c8f43778ed113db26f9171636c2dbdac575419aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/continuous-controls-monitoring/commits/c8f43778ed113db26f9171636c2dbdac575419aa"}],"sha":"2c577803e1b533f74f5ef7e059a226d4fbedd921","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/continuous-controls-monitoring/commits/2c577803e1b533f74f5ef7e059a226d4fbedd921"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/continuous-controls-monitoring/commits/c8f43778ed113db26f9171636c2dbdac575419aa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T15:02:21Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T15:14:32Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Default model_armor_full_capabilities to false; examples state it\n\nSlice 7 of the 2026-09-23 posture rule: every compliance control that is not\nirreversible defaults off in code, and terraform.tfvars.example carries the\nproduction form. The regional Model Armor capabilities (the malicious-URI\nfilter and multi-language detection) defaulted on, which also meant a plan in\nasia-southeast1, the fleet''s default region, failed with\nCAPABILITY_NOT_SUPPORTED until a deployment knew to turn them off.\n\nThe variable now defaults to false with one canonical description, the\nexample states the line uncommented, and the comments that said \"default\ntrue\" say otherwise. A Terraform test that relied on the old default now\nstates true, and a new run pins the new default: neither capability arrives\nunless stated.\n\nVerified: terraform validate and terraform test green.","tree":{"sha":"f137d9735efe67113db94e3be2df2841221978c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/continuous-controls-monitoring/git/trees/f137d9735efe67113db94e3be2df2841221978c6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/continuous-controls-monitoring/git/commits/c8f43778ed113db26f9171636c2dbdac575419aa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/continuous-controls-monitoring/commit/c8f43778ed113db26f9171636c2dbdac575419aa","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiBcdoAKGM4ZjQzNzc4ZWQxMTNkYjI2ZjkxNzE2MzZjMmRiZGFjNTc1NDE5YWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/continuous-controls-monitoring/commit/e958d65194936fccaeb63190fb282745ac718adb","sha":"e958d65194936fccaeb63190fb282745ac718adb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/continuous-controls-monitoring/commits/e958d65194936fccaeb63190fb282745ac718adb"}],"sha":"c8f43778ed113db26f9171636c2dbdac575419aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/continuous-controls-monitoring/commits/c8f43778ed113db26f9171636c2dbdac575419aa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/continuous-controls-monitoring/commits/e958d65194936fccaeb63190fb282745ac718adb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T09:41:03Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T09:53:25Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Bump hex-service-kit to v0.0.11: trace only through the collector\n\nDecision D1: build_tracer refuses an unset OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT instead of\nexporting straight to Cloud Trace around the collector''s GenAI-content redaction, and\ntakes no project argument any more.\n\n- pyproject.toml and the locks: hex-service-kit v0.0.11 (ec2d724). The only other lock\n  movement is opentelemetry-exporter-gcp-trace and its dependencies leaving with the\n  kit''s otel extra, where this repo resolved it.\n- adapters/gcp/tracer.py: build_tracer(service=...) only.\n- tests/contract: the managed tracer''s documented refusal is now\n  CollectorEndpointRequiredError; on-prem keys off a new onprem_refuses field; a new\n  test keeps the old guarantee that with a collector configured and no SDK a span\n  degrades to a no-op.\n- settings, config, Terraform variable and adoption notes stop describing a direct\n  Cloud Trace path that no longer exists.\n\nRelocked without --upgrade: fleet-deps bump-commons'' --upgrade relock moved 0\nunrelated pins here, and those were reverted.","tree":{"sha":"04c39d72e8564afc6f577d8488bd1b7576e97859","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/continuous-controls-monitoring/git/trees/04c39d72e8564afc6f577d8488bd1b7576e97859"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/continuous-controls-monitoring/git/commits/e958d65194936fccaeb63190fb282745ac718adb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/continuous-controls-monitoring/commit/e958d65194936fccaeb63190fb282745ac718adb","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiBcdoAKGU5NThkNjUxOTQ5MzZmY2NhZWI2MzE5MGZiMjgyNzQ1YWM3MThhZGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/continuous-controls-monitoring/commit/d42498b6eb2cf7abb72df8c9c47c8e5d9b64c11f","sha":"d42498b6eb2cf7abb72df8c9c47c8e5d9b64c11f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/continuous-controls-monitoring/commits/d42498b6eb2cf7abb72df8c9c47c8e5d9b64c11f"}],"sha":"e958d65194936fccaeb63190fb282745ac718adb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/continuous-controls-monitoring/commits/e958d65194936fccaeb63190fb282745ac718adb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/continuous-controls-monitoring/commits/d42498b6eb2cf7abb72df8c9c47c8e5d9b64c11f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T04:33:30Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T04:35:56Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Screen the narration through a fail-closed guardrail port (rule R1)\n\nPhase P3 of the guardrail/registry/observability plan, on the fixed template design\n(hex-service-template origin/main). The exception narration is this repo''s one\ngeneration call, and evidence records can carry operator-written text that reaches it.\n\n- ports/guardrail.py and local/gcp/onprem adapters. The gcp ModelArmorGuardrailAdapter\n  allows only on filter_match_state NO_MATCH_FOUND with invocation_result SUCCESS, read\n  by enum .name (str() of a proto-plus IntEnum is its number, so the old substring test\n  never blocked); a match, an absent/undecided result, a PARTIAL or FAILURE screen and\n  any API error all refuse. Every sanitize call carries model_armor.timeout_seconds.\n- domain/monitoring_service.py: _narrate screens the whole prompt INPUT before the model\n  reads it and the raw answer OUTPUT before validation, using each screen''s text exactly\n  as given. The narration is optional by design, so a block is audited Decision.BLOCKED\n  and takes the empty fallback an ungrounded narration takes; a guardrail that raises is\n  audited BLOCKED and its error fails the evaluation, as a failing model call does.\n  GuardrailVerdict refuses allowed-without-text and blocked-with-text.\n- CCM_GUARDRAIL three-state switch, DisabledGuardrail when off, boot refusal under gcp\n  with no template; model_armor settings incl. timeout_seconds.\n- google-cloud-modelarmor in the gcp extra, relocked (0.7.1; dev lock unchanged).\n- Terraform: model_armor.tf gated on model_armor_full_capabilities with template_metadata\n  and ignore_partial_invocation_failures = false, roles/modelarmor.user, google-beta\n  provider + lock + tftest mock, modelarmor in apis and the VPC-SC perimeter,\n  guardrail_enabled, and a guardrail_blocks log metric on decision \"blocked\".\n- scripts/demo.py EXIT_CALLS gains guardrail, so the exit tour proves the on-prem\n  placeholder refuses.\n- Tests: domain screening (order, exact sanitized text, both blocks, both raise paths,\n  onprem), heuristic tables, the SDK-free IntEnum-mirror verdict test and the real\n  modelarmor_v1 mapping test (skips without the SDK unless\n  CCM_REQUIRE_MODEL_ARMOR_SDK=1).\n- Docs: COMPLIANCE R1, runbook, model card, ARCHITECTURE, ADOPTING and the FAQs no\n  longer say the guardrail is unbound.","tree":{"sha":"697f002f39aa8fc4d0018f032392e05785694bb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/continuous-controls-monitoring/git/trees/697f002f39aa8fc4d0018f032392e05785694bb8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/continuous-controls-monitoring/git/commits/d42498b6eb2cf7abb72df8c9c47c8e5d9b64c11f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/continuous-controls-monitoring/commit/d42498b6eb2cf7abb72df8c9c47c8e5d9b64c11f","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiBcdoAKGQ0MjQ5OGI2ZWIyY2Y3YWJiNzJkZjhjOWM0N2M4ZTVkOWI2NGMxMWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/continuous-controls-monitoring/commit/11b1f7105ca52b75b1698975f27e53af1cb2c251","sha":"11b1f7105ca52b75b1698975f27e53af1cb2c251","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/continuous-controls-monitoring/commits/11b1f7105ca52b75b1698975f27e53af1cb2c251"}],"sha":"d42498b6eb2cf7abb72df8c9c47c8e5d9b64c11f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portabl