-browser-mapping past GHSA-w5vr-8v7q-w6rv (moderate). Lock-only\nchange; npm audit reports no vulnerabilities.","tree":{"sha":"e6271dd60430266f35690916f9a8e66112ff4c27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/contract-obligation-extraction/git/trees/e6271dd60430266f35690916f9a8e66112ff4c27"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/contract-obligation-extraction/git/commits/a06bc13c8569d23fb4b434f054a18c0eb19608a1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/contract-obligation-extraction/commit/a06bc13c8569d23fb4b434f054a18c0eb19608a1","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiBvtoAKGEwNmJjMTNjODU2OWQyM2ZiNGI0MzRmMDU0YTE4YzBlYjE5NjA4YTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/contract-obligation-extraction/commit/eef0c8d74ffa74be8e185e6850d54dd6f55a5e4c","sha":"eef0c8d74ffa74be8e185e6850d54dd6f55a5e4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/contract-obligation-extraction/commits/eef0c8d74ffa74be8e185e6850d54dd6f55a5e4c"}],"sha":"a06bc13c8569d23fb4b434f054a18c0eb19608a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/contract-obligation-extraction/commits/a06bc13c8569d23fb4b434f054a18c0eb19608a1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/contract-obligation-extraction/commits/eef0c8d74ffa74be8e185e6850d54dd6f55a5e4c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T09:41:05Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T09:53:30Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Bump hex-service-kit to v0.0.11: trace only through the collector\n\nDecision D1: build_tracer refuses an unset OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT instead of\nexporting straight to Cloud Trace around the collector''s GenAI-content redaction, and\ntakes no project argument any more.\n\n- pyproject.toml and the locks: hex-service-kit v0.0.11 (ec2d724). The only other lock\n  movement is opentelemetry-exporter-gcp-trace and its dependencies leaving with the\n  kit''s otel extra, where this repo resolved it.\n- adapters/gcp/tracer.py: build_tracer(service=...) only.\n- tests/contract: the managed tracer''s documented refusal is now\n  CollectorEndpointRequiredError; on-prem keys off a new onprem_refuses field; a new\n  test keeps the old guarantee that with a collector configured and no SDK a span\n  degrades to a no-op.\n- settings, config, Terraform variable and adoption notes stop describing a direct\n  Cloud Trace path that no longer exists.\n\nRelocked without --upgrade: fleet-deps bump-commons'' --upgrade relock moved 0\nunrelated pins here, and those were reverted.","tree":{"sha":"baaba7109f71b449349ae039a0f898e94ac0bcfc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/contract-obligation-extraction/git/trees/baaba7109f71b449349ae039a0f898e94ac0bcfc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/contract-obligation-extraction/git/commits/eef0c8d74ffa74be8e185e6850d54dd6f55a5e4c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/contract-obligation-extraction/commit/eef0c8d74ffa74be8e185e6850d54dd6f55a5e4c","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiBvtoAKGVlZjBjOGQ3NGZmYTc0YmU4ZTE4NWU2ODUwZDU0ZGQ2ZjU1YTVlNGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/contract-obligation-extraction/commit/ce6944057d96570153fa8d7773faf12390d791a2","sha":"ce6944057d96570153fa8d7773faf12390d791a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/contract-obligation-extraction/commits/ce6944057d96570153fa8d7773faf12390d791a2"}],"sha":"eef0c8d74ffa74be8e185e6850d54dd6f55a5e4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/contract-obligation-extraction/commits/eef0c8d74ffa74be8e185e6850d54dd6f55a5e4c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/contract-obligation-extraction/commits/ce6944057d96570153fa8d7773faf12390d791a2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T04:36:04Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T04:38:36Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Screen every generation call through a guardrail port (rule R1)\n\nPhase P3 of the guardrail/registry/observability plan for this repo,\nadopting the fixed design from hex-service-template main.\n\n- ports/guardrail.py and adapters/{local,gcp,onprem}/guardrail.py: the\n  template''s fixed adapters. Model Armor allows only on\n  filter_match_state NO_MATCH_FOUND with invocation_result SUCCESS, read\n  by enum name (the old str() substring test allowed everything), with a\n  per-call deadline (model_armor.timeout_seconds) and an injectable\n  client. The local heuristic is word-bounded; onprem refuses.\n- The extraction read, this repo''s biggest exposure, is screened in\n  flow.py: the counterparty and every clause joined as the model reads\n  them INPUT before ExtractionPort, every proposed string OUTPUT before\n  the engine admits any of it. A block, a rewrite of the structured\n  text, or an undecided guardrail is audited BLOCKED and refuses the\n  whole register (400 / exit 1 / {\"blocked\": true}).\n- The register narration screens the prompt INPUT and the raw model\n  text OUTPUT, using each screened text exactly as given. It is\n  decorative by design, so a block or an undecided screen falls back to\n  the fixed engine-built text and is audited BLOCKED as its own record.\n- The triage service takes the template''s shape: subject, text and the\n  joined prompt INPUT, the summary OUTPUT, fail closed on a raise, no\n  severity on an unscored refusal. GuardrailVerdict refuses\n  allowed-without-text and blocked-with-text.\n- CONTRACT_GUARDRAIL switch (three states), boot refusal with no\n  template, DisabledGuardrail; google-cloud-modelarmor in the gcp extra\n  and requirements-gcp.lock; a guardrail row in demo.py EXIT_CALLS.\n- Terraform: model_armor.tf gated on model_armor_full_capabilities with\n  template_metadata and ignore_partial_invocation_failures = false,\n  roles/modelarmor.user, the API and perimeter entries, google-beta in\n  providers.tf, the lock and the tftest mock, the tfvars example, and\n  the guardrail_blocks metric monitoring.tf said to add with the port.\n- Tests: the template''s screening, SDK-free verdict-mirror and real-enum\n  mapping tests, plus extraction and narration screening cases.\n- Docs: COMPLIANCE R1, ARCHITECTURE, runbook, model card, ADOPTING and\n  the FAQs no longer say the guardrail is unbound.","tree":{"sha":"c0b3bc770f6d641fb668948a380828bc3a465ee9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/contract-obligation-extraction/git/trees/c0b3bc770f6d641fb668948a380828bc3a465ee9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/contract-obligation-extraction/git/commits/ce6944057d96570153fa8d7773faf12390d791a2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User"