 the fleet uses\n\nportfolio-status section 10 fails while the fleet pins review-kit at two\nversions. v0.0.2 only adds an optional bearer_provider parameter to\nReviewClient, so existing callers are unchanged; the lockfiles now pin\nits commit dec72b6.\n\nThe relock also moved these, because pyproject.toml on main already pins them exactly and a\npyproject-only Dependabot bump had left the lockfiles behind (a removal follows from a moved\nparent no longer requiring it):\n- ruff 0.16.5->0.16.7","tree":{"sha":"d24e1dd4c71314b22210fa19ddbc2ea50201f71c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/contract-obligation-extraction/git/trees/d24e1dd4c71314b22210fa19ddbc2ea50201f71c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/contract-obligation-extraction/git/commits/1802aaceef0d64ff8a2eeb569c09d989e1f2f59d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/contract-obligation-extr