"date":"2026-10-01T15:34:39Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T16:00:37Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Bump hex-service-kit to v0.0.12: GenAI conventions on the model span\n\nv0.0.12 adds gen_ai.operation.name and gen_ai.provider.name to the span\nrecord_token_usage writes, so traces group model calls as the OpenTelemetry\nGenAI conventions intend, and lowers the otel extra''s floors to 1.42 so it\ninstalls beside google-adk. No API change.\n\nRelocked so that only the kit pin moves; the repository''s own gate is green.","tree":{"sha":"eb6a146900db58a57da71374efaa048e824df93c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/internal-audit-lifecycle/git/trees/eb6a146900db58a57da71374efaa048e824df93c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/internal-audit-lifecycle/git/commits/f0c512bf8862aa238416c8d6757d4f2c349de483","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/internal-audit-lifecycle/commit/f0c512bf8862aa238416c8d6757d4f2c349de483","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiCHdoAKGYwYzUxMmJmODg2MmFhMjM4NDE2YzhkNjc1N2Q0ZjJjMzQ5ZGU0ODM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/internal-audit-lifecycle/commit/1c282ed66455c0e820f0530ff72d0f61f7022fdb","sha":"1c282ed66455c0e820f0530ff72d0f61f7022fdb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/internal-audit-lifecycle/commits/1c282ed66455c0e820f0530ff72d0f61f7022fdb"}],"sha":"f0c512bf8862aa238416c8d6757d4f2c349de483","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/internal-audit-lifecycle/commits/f0c512bf8862aa238416c8d6757d4f2c349de483"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/internal-audit-lifecycle/commits/1c282ed66455c0e820f0530ff72d0f61f7022fdb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T15:02:21Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T15:21:31Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Default model_armor_full_capabilities to false; examples state it\n\nSlice 7 of the 2026-09-23 posture rule: every compliance control that is not\nirreversible defaults off in code, and terraform.tfvars.example carries the\nproduction form. The regional Model Armor capabilities (the malicious-URI\nfilter and multi-language detection) defaulted on, which also meant a plan in\nasia-southeast1, the fleet''s default region, failed with\nCAPABILITY_NOT_SUPPORTED until a deployment knew to turn them off.\n\nThe variable now defaults to false with one canonical description, the\nexample states the line uncommented, and the comments that said \"default\ntrue\" say otherwise. A Terraform test that relied on the old default now\nstates true, and a new run pins the new default: neither capability arrives\nunless stated.\n\nVerified: terraform validate and terraform test green.","tree":{"sha":"3f46b82a54d1d49ba457caa9f10a731bf4f62f08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/internal-audit-lifecycle/git/trees/3f46b82a54d1d49ba457caa9f10a731bf4f62f08"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/internal-audit-lifecycle/git/commits/1c282ed66455c0e820f0530ff72d0f61f7022fdb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.gi