ttps://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/internal-audit-lifecycle/commits/7d2b0146ea9dc927eba7587feea38732b23ffcd7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T14:28:42Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T21:53:38Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Show the model that answered as two pills, not a banner, on hex-service-kit v0.0.10\n\nOwner decision 2026-09-23: the console shows two small pills at the top right,\nthe model that ANSWERED and Search when an online search tool was used, in\nplace of the full-width provenance banner that named what configuration would\ncall. Ported from hex-service-template PR #36.\n\n- hex-service-kit v0.0.9 -> v0.0.10 (0e71fc7). The relock moved no other pin.\n- api/app.py installs install_answer_provenance(app), so X-Answered-By and\n  X-Search-Used carry what the model adapters note.\n- generation adapters note what answered: the Gemini adapter notes the\n  _MODEL it passed to generate_content after the call returns; the local\n  stub notes config.LOCAL_STUB_MODEL (\"deterministic-offline-stub\") and now\n  reports that name in its response too, replacing \"local-deterministic\".\n  No adapter attaches a search tool, so none notes a search.\n- Sampling per call: GenerationRequest.temperature is float | None = None and\n  the Gemini adapter omits it when None (the hard-coded 0.2 is gone). Both\n  call sites, the plan narrative and the working-paper draft, write prose\n  and stay free; none is pinned.\n- config.py: the hard-reasoning branch is deleted from the model resolver,\n  so generator_model is the model the adapter calls.\n- ui/app/ModelPills.tsx (+ lib/answer-provenance.mjs, node-tested) replaces\n  ProvenanceBanner.tsx; the proxy route forwards both headers; the banner\n  CSS is gone.\n- tests: test_answer_provenance.py (headers on /v1/plan and /v1/workpaper,\n  none on /v1/scope, a noting stand-in yields both, the adapter notes its\n  model and omits a free temperature, every call site is free, no flag moves\n  generator_model), the pills contract in test_ui_surface.py, and the banner\n  contract renamed test_model_pill_contract.py.","tree":{"sha":"93a6e0941b0aeadef5a9930feafb03617dbd60ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/internal-audit-lifecycle/git/trees/93a6e0941b0aeadef5a9930feafb03617dbd60ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/internal-audit-lifecycle/git/commits/7d2b0146ea9dc927eba7587feea38732b23ffcd7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":