s://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/issue-remediation-capa/commits/0d6cf85f6b7432cc75c9e1c6168e12c95a887e6b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T21:59:00Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T22:02:13Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Model pills replace the provenance banner; note what answered; sample per call\n\n- Bump hex-service-kit to v0.0.10 and install_answer_provenance(app), so every\n  response names the model that answered (X-Answered-By) and whether it searched\n  (X-Search-Used).\n- The Gemini and local narrators note their model; the live one is noted by the\n  kit client. No adapter attaches a search tool, so none notes search.\n- GenerationRequest gains temperature: float | None = None; the Gemini adapter\n  omits it when None and the live adapter passes it through. The one call site\n  (the root-cause note) is drafting, so it is free (was a hard-coded 0.2).\n- generator_model no longer honours use_hard_reasoning.\n- ModelPills (top right) replaces ProvenanceBanner; the proxy forwards both\n  answer headers.","tree":{"sha":"3c7bea632da5e7ccefd8e79a99308949f2f4c1d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/issue-remediation-capa/git/trees/3c7bea632da5e7ccefd8e79a99308949f2f4c1d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/re