}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/issue-remediation-capa/commits/c57aa247d4135d02439744bbfdbbbf9e4d27a10d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:50:49Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:56:04Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Pin review-kit v0.0.2, the release the rest of the fleet uses\n\nportfolio-status section 10 fails while the fleet pins review-kit at two\nversions. v0.0.2 only adds an optional bearer_provider parameter to\nReviewClient, so existing callers are unchanged; the lockfiles now pin\nits commit dec72b6.\n\nThe relock also moved these, because pyproject.toml on main already pins them exactly and a\npyproject-only Dependabot bump had left the lockfiles behind (a removal follows from a moved\nparent no longer requiring it):\n- ruff 0.16.5->0.16.7","tree":{"sha":"293c5dc1641b2e5ac1c5bb86584e189e45b07f07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/issue-remediation-capa/git/trees/293c5dc1641b2e5ac1c5bb86584e189e45b07f07"},"url":"https://api.github.co