on-capa/commits/726fe0c660a1ccf1be20ad08003681eb9d700c70"}],"sha":"9a0ef7c6d539c4a5b2c4b1ba1edfc24089dc7e5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/issue-remediation-capa/commits/9a0ef7c6d539c4a5b2c4b1ba1edfc24089dc7e5f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/issue-remediation-capa/commits/726fe0c660a1ccf1be20ad08003681eb9d700c70/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T07:55:59Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T07:55:59Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Re-point the IAP negative matrix at the refusals the verifier actually raises (#10)\n\nThe module skipped wherever google-auth was absent, which is every SDK-free gate, so\nnothing had compared its expectations against the adapter in a long time. Run with the\nruntime lockfile installed it was 10 failed, 12 passed -- every failure a stale regex,\nnot a security hole: each cell rejected its assertion, with a more specific reason than\nthe generic \"verification failed\" the test still demanded.\n\nThe replacements are narrower than what they replace. Each cell now names the exact\nrefusal it exists to prove, so a refusal for the wrong reason fails the cell instead of\nsatisfying it: \"declares alg ''none'', which means it is UNSIGNED\" is a different property\nfrom \"unparseable\", and \"missing required claim(s): sub\" is a different property from\n\"missing required claim(s): email\".\n\n22 passed after the change, in all 31 repositories.\n\nCo-authored-by: Ashish Awasthi <72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"aea7a5f7dde4cc58865afd720b2f3a162692d983","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/issue-remediation-capa/git/trees/aea7a5f7dde4cc58865afd720b2f3a162692d983"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/issue-remediation-capa/git/commits/726fe0c660a1ccf1be20ad08003681eb9d700c70","verification":{"payload":"tree aea7a5f7dde4cc58865afd720b2f3a162692d983\nparent ffb5c246dacb67a2805763afcff34ba5d31f8aa1\nauthor Ashish <ashish.awasthi@gmail.com> 1787644559 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787644559 +0800\n\nRe-point the IAP negative matrix at the refusals the verifier actually raises (#10)\n\nThe module skipped wherever google-auth was absent, which is every SDK-free gate, so\nnothing had compared its expectations against the adapter in a long time. Run with the\nruntime lockfile installed it was 10 failed, 12 passed -- every failure a stale regex,\nnot a security hole: each cell rejected its assertion, with a more specific reason than\nthe generic \"verification failed\" the test still demanded.\n\nThe replacements are narrower than what they replace. Each cell now names the exact\nrefusal it exists to prove, so a refusal for the wrong reason fails the cell instead of\nsatisfying it: \"declares alg ''none'', which means it is UNSIGNED\" is a different property\nfrom \"unparseable\", and \"missing required claim(s): sub\" is a different property from\n\"missing required claim(s): email\".\n\n22 passed after the change, in all 31 repositories.\n\nCo-authored-by: Ashish Awasthi <72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjUqPCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAv4IQAHWCXy4G0tKVEvJyFPu/2VdR\nrPNOxpSD39lJ7v2T2by863UvC3oJhzXp8BsWWMevritqmjoJB23166pWRKw1kbc/\nLPNjYNDvpgbhvfmLWFQv2WfQaih+QQTvFlExlddfXZSrX7fRnhxsrh6i8HOg0Wiq\n2xJZq4UIe5ngAf8skLqoUfq0JOnbU0F9DM2IXDnfSZthnQTG+bvjRLMBee2AImEU\nNfEbhmYxjralwqqOPruKlYmq9paOZVdcgs8xAIxbdCvjpYbT8/AQbdQpsh8cCfp7\nP7TUy8pw7Y5t9LHkMk5odHQv2uTnUtvyvdcLseVWvvIOp3N7oSkGYHfqb8uEq0zm\npnDti/Iz/V7IM0PuqbRXb36YH8WgrGXHypx6zO0KnfE58ZCxNrgCxKb4sbtz1sDZ\nFdVyVlczA1tV4FK54uB4RWFwHqVDxYFD9DPDMes8bQ1lFw2lZuTPxz9lBObPPY9p\nnXZ/qj1xFn9ZhCYjL5AkjzlUwqVOnreYbOnpmz/xYTZ3MR/NJ/BxsZFVBZohaP43\nTvMgf+nDHDwhyNMzlXqrPhHWliV6J4t0GwgZAHDduZo68VluipRXr2xsh/q5Y1y3\nTxQkRZuXGRfa99Hom71SjPCSv6zVnqNoJpjFqqOUo4tsqdL+kxiv2JH2dPlDuqqb\n3VDqseqvydMBt42cRRnY\n=+nqe\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-25T07:56:00Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"ht