e review_url comment in settings.yaml still\nsaid the managed review router refuses to swallow an escalation when\nHUMAN_REVIEW_URL is empty. Since the runtime control switches landed that\nis false: the service refuses at BOOT when review routing is on and no console\nis named, and MRM_REVIEW_ROUTING=false switches routing off, so\nhuman_review_url is only required with review_routing_enabled on.\n\nComment-only; no behaviour changes.","tree":{"sha":"bc33208dfa49985f0d28e021dcdfa682eb0a7180","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/model-risk-validation/git/trees/bc33208dfa49985f0d28e021dcdfa682eb0a7180"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/model-risk-validation/git/commits/41b80609fddb5f4a701cc0bb8c6a5169ab58e727","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/model-risk-validation/commit/41b80609fddb5f4a701cc0bb8c6a5169ab58e727","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiCxtoAKDQxYjgwNjA5ZmRkYjVmNGE3MDFjYzBiYjhjNmE1MTY5YWI1OGU3Mjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/model-risk-validation/commit/6e7c5f3c4347dc2f9ffc6df12c745e7c965718dd","sha":"6e7c5f3c4347dc2f9ffc6df12c745e7c965718dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/model-risk-validation/commits/6e7c5f3c4347dc2f9ffc6df12c745e7c965718dd"}],"sha":"41b80609fddb5f4a701cc0bb8c6a5169ab58e727","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/model-risk-validation/commits/41b80609fddb5f4a701cc0bb8c6a5169ab58e727"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/model-risk-validation/commits/6e7c5f3c4347dc2f9ffc6df12c745e7c965718dd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:07:17Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:13:54Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Wire the console to the real validation call\n\nThe console posted {subject, text} to POST /v1/triage, a route this service does not serve\n(it serves POST /v1/validate), so every submit was a 404 and the console could never produce a\nvalidation. It now posts ValidationRequestModel to /v1/validate: model_id, name, model_class\n(a select of the seven ModelClass values) and owner as fields, and dimensions, sample and\nobserved from a prefilled JSON evidence textarea. The defaults describe a fictional\nmedium-materiality scorecard with a full validation sample, so the local profile answers 200\nwith a tier_2 result, a four-metric battery and one failing calibration test routed for review.\n\ntests/unit/test_console_matches_api.py reads every fetch(API + ...) in ui/app/ and holds it\nagainst the live route table: path and method served, every required field sent, no field\nthe model silently drops. It failed against the old console (POST /v1/triage is not served)\nand passes against this one.","tree":{"sha":"f2ac9f3b83081dbbe94581753b1c027038d115e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/model-risk-validation/git/trees/f2ac9f3b83081dbbe94581753b1c027038d115e0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/model-risk-validation/git/commits/6e7c5f3c4347dc2f9ffc6df12c745e7c965718dd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/model-risk-validation/commit/6e7c5f3c4347dc2f9ffc6df12c745e7c965718dd","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiCxtoAKDZlN2M1ZjNjNDM0N2RjMmY5ZmZjNmRmMTJjNzQ1ZTdjOTY1NzE4ZGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/model-risk-validation/commit/47f5162692644a2f6f9b90359bf088718e0637bf","sha":"47f5162692644a2f6f9b90359bf088718e0637bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/model-risk-validation/commits/47f5162692644a2f6f9b90359bf088718e0637bf"}],"sha":"6e7c5f3c4347dc2f9ffc6df12c745e7c965718dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/model-risk-validation/commits/6e7c5f3c4347dc2f9ffc6df12c745e7c965718dd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/model-risk-validation/commits/47f5162692644a2f6f9b90359bf088718e0637bf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T10:18:56Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T10:21:17Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Switch review routing, refuse at boot without a console, and report every hand-off\n\nThe fleet''s runtime-control contract, template shape (as aml-alert-triage). Review routing is\nthe one cheap runtime control this service has, so it is the one switch.\n\n- MRM_REVIEW_ROUTING is read once at settings load in three states: unset is on, a boolean\n  wins, emptied or unrecognised refuses at boot. Off binds a disabled router and logs one\n  warning per process, however many containers the agent tools build.\n- Under gcp, routing on with no HUMAN_REVIEW_URL refuses at boot. It used to surface as a 500\n  on the first escalation, after the validation had already been tiered and audited.\n- Every caller that hands off (the validate route, the validate_model agent tool and the\n  validate CLI command) goes through a recording wrapper, so a failed hand-off no longer\n  fails the request: the result carries review_routing (routed, failed, off, not_required)\n  and an empty review_ref, and the failure is logged. The console states it in plain words.\n- Terraform gains review_routing_enabled, sets the service''s switch from it, and relaxes the\n  edge''s console requirement only when routing is stated off; a new plan test holds that.\n- The docs that said the managed router refuses at request time now say the service refuses\n  at boot and reports the hand-off.\n- pii-kit masking here protects the audit trail, tool results and the review payload rather\n  than a user''s free-text question, so it is not the redaction control the contract\n  switches, and it gains no switch.","tree":{"sha":"da8f9ac684f0dde462f874e0983f21d55a822fb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/model-risk-validation/git/trees/da8f9ac684f0dde462f874e0983f21d55a822fb1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/model-risk-validation/git/commits/47f5162692644a2f6f9b90359bf088718e0637bf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/model-risk-validation/commit/47f5162692644a2f6f9b90359bf088718e0637bf","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiCxtoAKDQ3ZjUxNjI2OTI2NDRhMmY2ZjliOTAzNTliZjA4ODcxOGUwNjM3YmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/model-risk-validation/commit/68a6c12d1072fc928fb82813d269e43401662716","sha":"68a6c12d1072fc928fb82813d269e43401662716","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/model-risk-validation/commits/68a6c12d1072fc928fb82813d269e43401662716"}],"sha":"47f5162692644a2f6f9b90359bf088718e0637bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/model-risk-validation/commits/47f5162692644a2f6f9b90359bf088718e0637bf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/model-risk-validation/commits/68a6c12d1072fc928fb82813d269e43401662716/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T03:50:54Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T04:04:26Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Take the default off the audit bucket lock\n\nworm_locked defaulted to true, so the first apply of this stack in any\nproject locked its audit bucket irreversibly for the whole retention window,\nwith nothing in that deployment''s own tfvars saying so. The fleet decided on\n2026-09-12 that an irreversible control takes no default; this stack was one\nof 33 that sweep never reached.\n\nA plan now refuses until the deployment states the lock. The Terraform tests\nstate it once per file in the production form, still assert that a stated\nlock sits on the six-month floor, and gain a run proving the unlocked posture\ncreates an unlocked bucket. That run fails if the lock is ever hard-coded\nback into the bucket, which every other run would miss.","tree":{"sha":"92f00d6ef1b5d1312a57cd5ae2bda13b9527cd2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/model-risk-validation/git/trees/92f00d6ef1b5d1312a57cd5ae2bda13b9527cd2d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/model-risk-validation/git/commits/68a6c12d1072fc928fb82813d269e43401662716","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/model-risk-validation/commit/68a6c12d1072fc928fb82813d269e43401662716","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiCxtoAKDY4YTZjMTJkMTA3MmZjOTI4ZmI4MjgxM2QyNjllNDM0MDE2NjI3MTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/model-risk-validation/commit/012c8088b5210fa99c6bd033400ee840db2dca83","sha":"012c8088b5210fa99c6bd033400ee840db2