t''s otel extra, where this repo resolved it.\n- adapters/gcp/tracer.py: build_tracer(service=...) only.\n- tests/contract: the managed tracer''s documented refusal is now\n  CollectorEndpointRequiredError; on-prem keys off a new onprem_refuses field; a new\n  test keeps the old guarantee that with a collector configured and no SDK a span\n  degrades to a no-op.\n- settings, config, Terraform variable and adoption notes stop describing a direct\n  Cloud Trace path that no longer exists.\n\nRelocked without --upgrade: fleet-deps bump-commons'' --upgrade relock moved 0\nunrelated pins here, and those were reverted.","tree":{"sha":"e8e978e94d3214a310407772f0aa2d34ef25eba7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/obligations-control-mapping/git/trees/e8e978e94d3214a310407772f0aa2d34ef25eba7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/obligations-control-mapping/git/commits/94bfa33bd57feedd7f314fe908ee1ddded34dbe6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/us