hish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Screen the coverage narration through a guardrail port, input before and output after (rule R1)\n\nAdds the guardrail port with local (heuristic), gcp (Model Armor, fail-closed on anything but a\ncomplete clean screen) and onprem (refusing placeholder) bindings, the OBLIGATIONS_GUARDRAIL\nthree-state switch, the Model Armor template settings with a boot refusal when the guardrail is\non with no template, and the google-cloud-modelarmor dependency in the gcp extra and lock.\n\nThe narration screens the caller-supplied scope, then the prompt as sent, before the model is\ncalled, and the model''s raw text after. A block or an undecided screen is audited BLOCKED and\nthe fixed engine-built note is shown; the model''s note is never used.","tree":{"sha":"73dc9ba5b8c9d215e82c8b3d93dea0af61609f95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/obligations-control-mapping/git/trees/73dc9ba5b8c9d215e82c8b3d93dea0af61609f95"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/obligations-control-mapping/git/commits/598baef94ba92570b10a0aa2e9c7227616142b9f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github