es the bumps exposed\n\nA bump that edits pyproject alone leaves the exported locks pinning the\nversion being replaced, so the gate would go green against the old one.\nRegenerated through scripts/lock.py so the tag-to-commit header survives.\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Ashish Awasthi <72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"9ea9ad217a1fbe5cbe8ddf5617fa6f8de9c5d1d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/obligations-control-mapping/git/trees/9ea9ad217a1fbe5cbe8ddf5617fa6f8de9c5d1d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/obligations-control-mapping/git/commits/e2c1b9576cf29c96bcb5add57d583c92450e16ff","verification":{"payload":"tree 9ea9ad217a1fbe5cbe8ddf5617fa6f8de9c5d1d0\nparent 4255bd6d6efc3acec726a6feed9e0bb2c8714d89\nauthor Ashish <ashish.awasthi@gmail.com> 1787552412 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787552412 +0800\n\nDependency updates, 2026-08-24 (#10)\n\n* Bump ruff from 0.16.3 to 0.16.4 in the python-minor-patch group\n\nBumps the python-minor-patch group with 1 update: [ruff](https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff).\n\n\nUpdates `ruff` from 0.16.3 to 0.16.4\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff/releases)\n- [Changelog](https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff/compare/0.16.3...0.16.4)\n\n---\nupdated-dependencies:\n- dependency-name: ruff\n  dependency-version: 0.16.4\n  dependency-type: direct:development\n  update-type: version-update:semver-patch\n  dependency-group: python-minor-patch\n...\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\n\n* Regenerate the locks and clear the advisories the bumps exposed\n\nA bump that edits pyproject alone leaves the exported locks pinning the\nversion being replaced, so the gate would go green against the old one.\nRegenerated through scr