nt":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T09:54:48Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Bump hex-service-kit to v0.0.11: trace only through the collector\n\nDecision D1: build_tracer refuses an unset OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT instead of\nexporting straight to Cloud Trace around the collector''s GenAI-content redaction, and\ntakes no project argument any more.\n\n- pyproject.toml and the locks: hex-service-kit v0.0.11 (ec2d724). The only other lock\n  movement is opentelemetry-exporter-gcp-trace and its dependencies leaving with the\n  kit''s otel extra, where this repo resolved it.\n- adapters/gcp/tracer.py: build_tracer(service=...) only.\n- tests/contract: the managed tracer''s documented refusal is now\n  CollectorEndpointRequiredError; on-prem keys off a new onprem_refuses field; a new\n  test keeps the old guarantee that with a collector configured and no SDK a span\n  degrades to a no-op.\n- settings, config, Terraform variable and adoption notes stop describing a direct\n  Cloud Trace path that no longer exists.\n\nRelocked without --upgrade: fleet-deps bump-commons'' --upgrade relock moved 0\nunrelated pins here, and those were reverted.","tree":{"sha":"e314d5613504edcd1f401bfdb7f8b8fd608d7fd3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/rcsa-kri-erm/git/trees/e314d5613504edcd1f401bfdb7f8b8fd608d7fd3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/rcsa-kri-erm/git/commits/b33a48e3fa828b5ab679cdc69cd9114c324d18da","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/rcsa-kri-erm/commit/b33a48e3fa828b5ab679cdc69cd9114c324d18da","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiD5doAKGIzM2E0OGUzZmE4MjhiNWFiNjc5Y2RjNjljZDkxMTRjMzI0ZDE4ZGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/rcsa-kri-erm/commit/506b9456e2828b971f084c6bedb9c3449c27c63c","sha":"506b9456e2828b971f084c6bedb9c3449c27c63c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/rcsa-kri-erm/commits/506b9456e2828b971f084c6bedb9c3449c27c63c"}],"sha":"b33a48e3fa828b5ab679cdc69cd9114c324d18da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/rcsa-kri-erm/commits/b33a48e3fa828b5ab679cdc69cd9114c324d18da"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/rcsa-kri-erm/commits/506b9456e2828b971f084c6bedb9c3449c27c63c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T04:45:45Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T04:48:30Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Screen the narration call through a fail-closed guardrail port (rule R1)\n\nAdopt the fixed guardrail design from hex-service-template: a GuardrailPort\nwith local heuristic, regional Model Armor and on-prem placeholder adapters,\nthe ERM_GUARDRAIL three-state switch, and a boot refusal when the guardrail\nis on under gcp with no template named.\n\nThe Model Armor adapter allows only NO_MATCH_FOUND with invocation_result\nSUCCESS, read by enum name, with a per-call deadline; a match, a partial\nscreen, an empty result or an API error refuses.\n\nNarrationService, the one place this service calls a model (the RCSA and\nKRI-breach committee note), screens the caller-written scope and then the\nwhole prompt the model reads (sent exactly as screened) before generating,\nand the parsed note before the groundedness check. Narration is optional,\nso a refusal is audited BLOCKED under the outcome''s own action and the\ndeterministic note stands; the assessment or breach is still scored,\naudited and routed, and no partial model note is kept. The triage path\nmakes no generation call, so it is not screened.\n\nTerraform adds the regional template (gated on\nmodel_armor_full_capabilities, template_metadata shipped from the first\napply), roles/modelarmor.user, the API and perimeter entries, the\nERM_GUARDRAIL env switch and the google-beta provider with its lock and\ntftest mock. google-cloud-modelarmor joins the gcp extra and\nrequirements-gcp.lock, and scripts/demo.py tours the guardrail exit call.\nTests prove the mapping against SDK-free IntEnum mirrors in every gate and\nagainst the real modelarmor_v1 types where the SDK is installed.","tree":{"sha":"73a8126c4428175a47507f650a810808401eeaa9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/rcsa-kri-erm/git/trees/73a8126c4428175a47507f650a810808401eeaa9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/rcsa-kri-erm/git/commits/506b9456e2828b971f084c6bedb9c3449c27c63c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/rcsa-kri-erm/commit/506b9456e2828b971f084c6bedb9c3449c27c63c","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiD5doAKDUwNmI5NDU2ZTI4MjhiOTcxZjA4NGM2YmVkYjljMzQ0OWMyN2M2M2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/rcsa-kri-erm/commit/5ce9e3eb47cd8d94b4b4b825be9108427b645f51","sha":"5ce9e3eb47cd8d94b4b4b825be