wasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/rcsa-kri-erm/commits/12ae7361b9aa0c117b09aa39efb8b4a7d020f73a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:51:37Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:55:17Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Pin review-kit v0.0.2, the release the rest of the fleet uses\n\nportfolio-status section 10 fails while the fleet pins review-kit at two\nversions. v0.0.2 only adds an optional bearer_provider parameter to\nReviewClient, so existing callers are unchanged; the lockfiles now pin\nits commit dec72b6.\n\nThe relock also moved these, because pyproject.toml on main already pins them exactly and a\npyproject-only Dependabot bump had left the lockfiles behind (a removal follows from a moved\nparent no longer requiring it):\n- ruff 0.16.5->0.16.7","tree":{"sha":"26d0b45ee6aa3b6fabb106bd7debe1be8a910f25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/rcsa-kri-erm/git/trees/26d0b45ee6aa3b6fabb106bd7debe1be8a910f25"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/rcsa-kri-erm/git/commits/12ae7361b9aa0c117b09aa39efb8b4a7d020f73a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url"