ists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/third-party-risk-ddq/commits/d6bb23a15191e08ebd2d313cc816b0920bcc2929/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T14:49:49Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T15:18:49Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Bump hex-service-kit to v0.0.11: trace only through the collector\n\nv0.0.11 deletes the kit tracer''s direct Cloud Trace path (decision D1 of the\nguardrail/registry/observability plan): build_tracer raises when\nOTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT is unset, so spans can no longer leave around the\ncollector''s GenAI-content redaction. Its signature is service= alone, so the\ngcp tracer adapter stops passing project=, and its docstring stops promising\nthe unset-endpoint path to Cloud Trace.\n\nThe parity suite takes the template''s D1 contract with it: the managed tracer\nnow declares CollectorEndpointRequiredError as its refusal, on-prem''s no-op\ntracer is marked as never refusing, and a new test proves that with a\ncollector configured the tracer still degrades to a no-op offline.\n\nRelocked with this repository''s own `make lock`, which moves only the kit\npin; `make gate` green.","tree":{"sha":"6db18279e459a22fc9fe11bc36f2880432f6bdc6","url":"https://api.github