third-party-risk-ddq/commits/8bd9a351ef0908b87705b4fa82e7d0ee69b124aa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:51:42Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:58:21Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Pin review-kit v0.0.2, the release the rest of the fleet uses\n\nportfolio-status section 10 fails while the fleet pins review-kit at two\nversions. v0.0.2 only adds an optional bearer_provider parameter to\nReviewClient, so existing callers are unchanged; the lockfiles now pin\nits commit dec72b6.\n\nThe relock also moved these, because pyproject.toml on main already pins them exactly and a\npyproject-only Dependabot bump had left the lockfiles behind (a removal follows from a moved\nparent no longer requiring it):\n- ruff 0.16.5->0.16.7","tree":{"sha":"1ec56ed9b95ee837b14e251fb3706cf58bd1ef9e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/third-party-risk-ddq/git/trees/1ec56ed9b95ee837b14e251fb3706cf58bd1ef9e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/third-party-risk-ddq/git/commits/8bd9a351ef0908b87705b4fa82e7d0ee69b124aa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/third-party-risk-ddq/commit/8bd9a351ef0908b87705b4fa82e7d0ee69b124aa","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiENNoAKDhiZDlhMzUxZWYwOTA4Yjg3NzA1YjRmYTgyZTdkMGVlNjliMTI0YWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/third-party-risk-ddq/commit/65dd86784898de1482738a26054505cbd587b098","sha":"65dd86784898de1482738a26054505cbd587b098","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/third-party-risk-ddq/commits/65dd86784898de1482738a26054505cbd587b098"}],"sha":"8bd9a351ef0908b87705b4fa82e7d0ee69b124aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/third-party-risk-ddq/commits/8bd9a351ef0908b87705b4fa82e7d0ee69b124aa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/third-party-risk-ddq/commits/65dd86784898de1482738a26054505cbd587b098/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:41:31Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:47:02Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Correct docs that say the review router refuses at request time\n\nThe service now refuses to boot under the managed profile when review\nrouting is on and HUMAN_REVIEW_URL is unset, DDQ_REVIEW_ROUTING switches\nrouting, and a hand-off that fails at request time is reported as\nreview_routing \"failed\" and logged. Some documents still said the\nmanaged router refuses the escalation at request time rather than\nswallowing it, and .env.example named no switch. Routing off needs no console.\nDocumentation only; no practices-audit verdict changed.","tree":{"sha":"6fc8d257f2ecfb4a4f4f0511ab90b7f690790444","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/third-party-risk-ddq/git/trees/6fc8d257f2ecfb4a4f4f0511ab90b7f690790444"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/third-party-risk-ddq/git/commits/65dd86784898de1482738a26054505cbd587b098","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/third-party-risk-ddq/commit/65dd86784898de1482738a26054505cbd587b098","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiENNoAKDY1ZGQ4Njc4NDg5OGRlMTQ4MjczOGEyNjA1NDUwNWNiZDU4N2IwOTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/third-party-risk-ddq/commit/7457e83744a43bd0cc721fd84b7f93255226b3c6","sha":"7457e83744a43bd0cc721fd84b7f93255226b3c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/third-party-risk-ddq/commits/7457e83744a43bd0cc721fd84b7f93255226b3c6"}],"sha":"65dd86784898de1482738a26054505cbd587b098","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/third-party-risk-ddq/commits/65dd86784898de1482738a26054505cbd587b098"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/third-party-risk-ddq/commits/7457e83744a43bd0cc721fd84b7f93255226b3c6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:12:56Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:16:20Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Correct the review-routing comments to the boot refusal\n\nThe variables.tf header and the review_url comment in settings.yaml still\nsaid the managed review router refuses to swallow an escalation when\nHUMAN_REVIEW_URL is empty. Since the runtime control switches landed that\nis false twice over: the service refuses at BOOT when review routing is on\nand no console is named, and DDQ_REVIEW_ROUTING=false switches routing\noff, so human_review_url is only required with review_routing_enabled on.\n\nComment-only; no behaviour changes.","tree":{"sha":"3ad59ec47e0b686f3a9583c89bf75da72f7b1d58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/third-party-risk-ddq/git/trees/3ad59ec47e0b686f3a9583c89bf75da72f7b1d58"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/third-party-risk-ddq/git/commits/7457e83744a43bd0cc721fd84b7f93255226b3c6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/third-party-risk-ddq/commit/7457e83744a43bd0cc721fd84b7f93255226b3c6","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiENNoAKDc0NTdlODM3NDRhNDNiZDBjYzcyMWZkODRiN2Y5MzI1NTIyNmIzYzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/third-party-risk-ddq/commit/df0284cc463b72c0b1d36ff4f0e5cab33fd70f1f","sha":"df0284cc463b72c0b1d36ff4f0e5cab33fd70f1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/third-party-risk-ddq/commits/df0284cc463b72c0b1d36ff4f0e5cab33fd70f1f"}],"sha":"7457e83744a43bd0cc721fd84b7f93255226b3c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/third-party-risk-ddq/commits/7457e83744a43bd0cc721fd84b7f93255226b3c6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/third-party-risk-ddq/commits/df0284cc463b72c0b1d36ff4f0e5cab33fd70f1f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T10:16:30Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T10:18:47Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Switch review routing, refuse at boot without a console, and report every hand-off\n\nApplies the fleet''s runtime-control contract (template shape). Review routing is the one cheap\nruntime control this service has, so it is the one switch.\n\n- DDQ_REVIEW_ROUTING is read once at settings load in three states: unset is on, a boolean\n  wins, emptied or unrecognised refuses at boot. Off binds a disabled router and logs one\n  warning per process, however many containers the agent tools build.\n- Under gcp, routing on with no HUMAN_REVIEW_URL refuses at boot. It used to surface as a 500\n  on the first escalation, after the triage had already been scored and audited.\n- The API, the triage agent tool and the CLI hand off through a recording wrapper, so a\n  hand-off that fails no longer fails the triage: the response carries review_routing (routed,\n  failed, off, not_required) and an empty review_ref, and the failure is logged. The console\n  states the outcome in plain words.\n- Terraform gains review_routing_enabled, sets the service''s switch from it, and relaxes the\n  edge''s console requirement only when routing is stated off; a new plan test holds that.\n- SPEC, COMPLIANCE, the practices audit and two FAQs said the router refuses at request time;\n  corrected.\n- pii-kit masking here minimises the audit trail, tool results and the review payload rather\n  than a user''s free-text question, so it gains no switch. AssessmentService also routes, but\n  only the offline eval constructs it; no served entrypoint does.","tree":{"sha":"7c220ca8e7ebfdc98afcc000a494cf57ee96e445","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/third-party-risk-ddq/git/trees/7c220ca8e7ebfdc98afcc000a494cf57ee96e445"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/third-party-risk-ddq/git/commits/df0284cc463b72c0b1d36ff4f0e5cab33fd70f1f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/third-party-risk-ddq/commit/df0284cc463b72c0b1d36ff4f0e5cab33fd70f1f","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiENNoAKGRmMDI4NGNjNDYzYjcyYzBiMWQzNmZmNGYwZTVjYWIzM2ZkNzBmMWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/third-party-risk-ddq/commit/6036a404b27eded4b422c5772f4d12785655937d","sha":"6036a404b27eded4b422c5772f4d12785655937d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/third-party-risk-ddq/commits/6036a404b27eded4b422c5772f4d12785655937d"}],"sha":"df0284cc463b72c0b1d36ff4f0e5cab33fd70f1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/third-party-risk-ddq/commits/df0284cc463b72c0b1d36ff4f0e5cab33fd70f1f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/third-party-risk-ddq/commits/6036a404b27eded4b422c5772f4d12785655937d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T03:51:04Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T04:08:45Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Take the default off the audit bucket lock\n\nworm_locked defaulted to true, so the first apply of this stack in any\nproject locked its audit bucket irreversibly for the whole retention window,\nwith nothing in that deployment''s own tfvars saying so. The fleet decided on\n2026-09-12 that an irreversible control takes no default; this stack was one\nof 33 that sweep never reached.\n\nA plan now refuses until the deployment states the lock. The Terraform tests\nstate it once per file in the production form, still assert that a stated\nlock sits on the six-month floor, and gain a run proving the unlocked posture\ncreates an unlocked bucket. That run fails if the lock is ever hard-coded\nback into the bucket, which every other run would miss.","tree":{"sha":"47837fc1770000a9ce9042255d4c2262046dc9c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/third-party-risk-ddq/git/trees/47837fc1770000a9ce9042255d4c2262046dc9c8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/third-party-risk-ddq/git/commits/6036a404b27eded4b422c5772f4d12785655937d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/third-party-risk-ddq/commit/6036a404b27eded4b422c5772f4d12785655937d","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiENNoAKDYwMzZhNDA0YjI3ZWRlZDRiNDIyYzU3NzJmNGQxMjc4NTY1NTkzN2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/third-party-risk-ddq/commit/bcb9cdeda70528c8977c619a99a0568fddbb1f85","sha":"bcb9cdeda70528c8977c619a99a0568fddbb1f85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/third-party-risk-