a8"}],"sha":"826b4358c9619817eef83c863c65469b1ae6460f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/third-party-risk-ddq/commits/826b4358c9619817eef83c863c65469b1ae6460f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/third-party-risk-ddq/commits/98f1409ccc8217d8fcdacd987a3387bffd907aa8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T21:01:42Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T21:01:42Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Say which CI actually runs (#8)\n\nThe D2 row described a supply-chain job and a ui-gate job in the present\ntense. GitHub Actions have been disabled organization-wide by portfolio\ndecision, so neither has run on a push: the workflow is the reviewed contract\nCloud Build is digest-bound to, not the thing that executes.\n\nThe row now says that, and says what does run: Cloud Build has run this\nrepository''s gate on every push and pull request since 2026-08-23, with the\nPR check required before a merge. It also names what is still absent, a\ndependency audit on a schedule rather than on a push, instead of leaving the\nreader to infer it from a job name.\n\nCo-authored-by: Ashish Awasthi <72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"c402c48e8b7811841af782c90f04422256231374","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/third-party-risk-ddq/git/trees/c402c48e8b7811841af782c90f04422256231374"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/third-party-risk-ddq/git/commits/98f1409ccc8217d8fcdacd987a3387bffd907aa8","verification":{"payload":"tree c402c48e8b7811841af782c90f04422256231374\nparent 1f4068d441c1e543f5177b1d31b303a9b8258831\nauthor Ashish <ashish.awasthi@gmail.com> 1787518902 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787518902 +0800\n\nSay which CI actually runs (#8)\n\nThe D2 row described a supply-chain job and a ui-gate job in the present\ntense. GitHub Actions have been disabled organization-wide by portfolio\ndecision, so neither has run on a push: the workflow is the reviewed contract\nCloud Build is digest-bound to, not the thing that executes.\n\nThe row now says that, and says what does run: Cloud Build has run this\nrepository''s gate on every push and pull request since 2026-08-23, with the\nPR check required before a merge. It also names what is still absent, a\ndependency audit on a schedule rather than on a push, instead of leaving the\nreader to infer it from a job name.\n\nCo-authored-by: Ashish Awasthi <72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqi1+2CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAY2EQAAxghsMCvsuNbgCk3J/L/bC8\nuWsJcKDDhyW2wIvSfrAQWPWEO5xhp1Cr7I5s3M71jtYj40hnpXtHI+Af8aN6vMSa\nBei78p91B2SaKH8gA9yya0WZsy4IrGfLx4X99IntyAN9iwVtpbDYXuy9dU9fyGX1\nEBSLVqwVpthfFB9bXsHYeFPwIqiHgWx2OJp8qaD5OsnLxnefgsTMcHqlhJ6Xvquf\n8dWe+RCTx6MxbZruVInA7P1YlyF9Q8QiYJdx0PJFZFogQQjMnRskC5gx1tEPZMPw\nN6/9sXtVIC6XqbkFZXEnTrzYukYFBlTfTtjVO