ms-surveillance/commits/fa5309a5ced2222cf761ee7edfe3c6f8efb2293c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T12:07:40Z","email":"49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"dependabot[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T12:32:46Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Bump ruff in the python-minor-patch group across 1 directory\n\nBumps the python-minor-patch group with 1 update in the / directory: [ruff](https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff).\n\n\nUpdates `ruff` from 0.16.5 to 0.16.7\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff/releases)\n- [Changelog](https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff/compare/0.16.5...0.16.7)\n\n---\nupdated-dependencies:\n- dependency-name: ruff\n  dependency-version: 0.16.6\n  dependency-type: direct:development\n  update-type: version-update:semver-patch\n  dependency-group: python-minor-patch\n...\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>","tree":{"sha":"33d803327ea86c69bd74c307a1da3a807feea249","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/trade-comms-surveillance/git/trees/33d803327ea86c69bd74c307a1da3a807feea249"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/trade-comms-surveillance/git/commits/fa5309a5ced2222cf761ee7edfe3c6f8efb2293c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/trade-comms-surveillance/commit/fa5309a5ced2222cf761ee7edfe3c6f8efb2293c","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiEhtoAKGZhNTMwOWE1Y2VkMjIyMmNmNzYxZWU3ZWRmZTNjNmY4ZWZiMjI5M2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/trade-comms-surveillance/commit/9114387a8b1a5f76e843e93a9f59fecb0644c139","sha":"9114387a8b1a5f76e843e93a9f59fecb0644c139","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/trade-comms-surveillance/commits/9114387a8b1a5f76e843e93a9f59fecb0644c139"}],"sha":"fa5309a5ced2222cf761ee7edfe3c6f8efb2293c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/trade-comms-surveillance/commits/fa5309a5ced2222cf761ee7edfe3c6f8efb2293c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/trade-comms-surveillance/commits/9114387a8b1a5f76e843e93a9f59fecb0644c139/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T08:44:55Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T12:13:49Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Make customer-managed encryption optional, and off by default\n\nEvery binding to the stack''s Cloud KMS key now sits behind cmek_enabled,\ndefault false: the key ring, the key, every grant to a service agent, and\nevery store, log bucket, registry and revision that took the key. Block\nbindings became dynamic blocks; scalar bindings read the key through one(),\nwhich is null when the key does not exist and omits the attribute rather\nthan pointing it at nothing. The Terraform tests that assert on key material\nturn the gate on to keep meaning what they meant.\n\nWhy the default is off: a key ring can never be deleted, a log bucket that\nhas CMEK can never drop it, and registries and document stores take their\nkey at creation. None of that changes an answer or a screen, and everything\nis encrypted at rest with Google-managed keys regardless. A deployment with\na customer whose data it must shred, whose key access must be audited or\nwhose keys must live in an HSM sets it true in its own tfvars BEFORE the\nfirst apply. Where a stack already applied it, the key''s prevent_destroy\nrefuses a plan that omits the line, which is the right answer: the stores it\nbound stay bound.\n\nThe vendored deploy-and-residency-hardening skill says the same.","tree":{"sha":"579d62434e6d645d19c872762be301442fffeb01","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/trade-comms-surveillance/git/trees/579d62434e6d645d19c872762be301442fffeb01"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/trade-comms-surveillance/git/commits/9114387a8b1a5f76e843e93a9f59fecb0644c139","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/trade-comms-surveillance/commit/9114387a8b1a5f76e843e93a9f59fecb0644c139","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiEhtoAKDkxMTQzODdhOGIxYTVmNzZlODQzZTkzYTlmNTlmZWNiMDY0NGMxMzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/trade-comms-surveillance/commit/969d43cb4c9859883f253e787f4fca2aa744a8c9","sha":"969d43cb4c9859883f253e787f4fca2aa744a8c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/trade-comms-surveillance/commits/969d43cb4c9859883f253e787f4fca2aa744a8c9"}],"sha":"9114387a8b1a5f76e843e93a9f59fecb0644c139","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/trade-comms-surveillance/commits/9114387a8b1a5f76e843e93a9f59fecb0644c139"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/trade-comms-surveillance/commits/969d43cb4c9859883f253e787f4fca2aa744a8c9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T14:18:38Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T14:32:06Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Resync the embeddable-UI skill: both assertion header names\n\nThe canonical skill told the next repository to verify \"the injected\n`x-goog-iap-jwt-assertion`\" and nothing else, which is the instruction that\nproduced the defect this branch fixes. Fixed at the source in org-metadata and\nvendored here.\n\nOnly this one skill is resynced rather than the whole set, because\ndeploy-and-residency-hardening is in flight on another branch and a blanket\n`sync-skills.sh` would pull that unmerged work in with it.","tree":{"sha":"b571cd68e5ac487f6ea8bc005de203748ccb4422","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/trade-comms-surveillance/git/trees/b571cd68e5ac487f6ea8bc005de203748ccb4422"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/trade-comms-surveillance/git/commits/969d43cb4c9859883f253e787f4fca2aa744a8c9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/trade-comms-surveillance/commit/969d43cb4c9859883f253e787f4fca2aa744a8c9","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiEhtoAKDk2OWQ0M2NiNGM5ODU5ODgzZjI1M2U3ODdmNGZjYTJhYTc0NGE4Yzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/trade-comms-surveillance/commit/40df7d1387568e6bfc15dcb2bd415cb85c904f30","sha":"40df7d1387568e6bfc15dcb2bd415cb85c904f30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/trade-comms-surveillance/commits/40df7d1387568e6bfc15dcb2bd415cb85c904f30"}],"sha":"969d43cb4c9859883f253e787f4fca2aa744a8c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/trade-comms-surveillance/commits/969d43cb4c9859883f253e787f4fca2aa744a8c9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/trade-comms-surveillance/commits/40df7d1387568e6bfc15dcb2bd415cb85c904f30/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T14:04:26Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T14:32:06Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Read the IAP assertion under both names a request can carry it\n\n`x-goog-*` is Google''s reserved namespace and the serverless frontend strips\nthat whole namespace from a request entering a service, so an embedding host\nbehind IAP cannot forward the assertion its own edge was handed under the\nstandard name. It sends the same value as `x-portal-iap-assertion` as well,\nand this adapter read only the reserved one.\n\nSo this service would have answered 401 to EVERY authenticated caller the day\nit was embedded, and said \"request did not pass through IAP\" about a request\nthat passed through IAP one hop earlier. Nothing would have reported it: the\ngate is green, a console''s first calls need no identity at all, and the unit\nsuite builds its own request, so it could only ever choose the header the\nauthor had in mind.\n\nThe read is now the commons selection function, which examines both names,\nprefers the edge-injected one for diagnosis rather than for trust, strips so a\nheader a proxy rendered blank is absent rather than malformed, and names both\nheaders in its refusal so an operator reads which hop dropped one.\n\ntests/unit/test_embedded_assertion_transport.py is the standing proof, and it\nwas falsified first: with only the header read reverted, five of its cases\nfail, including the one that resolves the contradiction between a passing\nclaim suite and a live 401.","tree":{"sha":"1f0479d6e352057149d8e0e2fdea69ed51222e00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/trade-comms-surveillance/git/trees/1f0479d6e352057149d8e0e2fdea69ed51222e00"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/trade-comms-surveillance/git/commits/40df7d1387568e6bfc15dcb2bd415cb85c904f30","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/trade-comms-surveillance/commit/40df7d1387568e6bfc15dcb2bd415cb85c904f30","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiEhtoAKDQwZGY3ZDEzODc1NjhlNmJmYzE1ZGNiMmJkNDE1Y2I4NWM5MDRmMzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/trade-comms-surveillance/commit/c0648fd8aed9ac08150a7b49a61ecf2e3ff229ae","sha":"c0648fd8aed9ac08150a7b49a61ecf2e3ff229ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/trade-comms-surveillance/commits/c0648fd8aed9ac08150a7b49a61ecf2e3ff229ae"}],"sha":"40df7d1387568e6bfc15dcb2bd415cb85c904f30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/trade-comms-surveillance/commits/40df7d1387568e6bfc15dcb2bd415cb85c904f30"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/trade-comms-surveillance/commits/c0648fd8aed9ac08150a7b49a61ecf2e3ff229ae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T23:41:08Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T23:54:59Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Gate the posture alerts, and stop copying every audit log into this bucket\n\nTwo changes the deployed stacks already carry, brought to the rest of the\nfleet so a fork does not inherit either on its first apply.\n\nThe posture alert policies and the log-based metrics behind them now sit\nbehind posture_alerts_enabled, default false. Cloud Monitoring bills every\nmetric-based alert condition, and a deployment with nobody on call buys\nnothing with them; the signals still land in Cloud Logging, where an operator\ncan read them.\n\nThe audit sink routes only this application''s own ledger into its bucket. It\nused to copy every Cloud Audit Log entry as well, which is a second\nCMEK-encrypted ingestion of what _Default already keeps for thirty days.\n\nNothing here is applied anywhere, so neither change moves a live resource.\nWhat they remove is the trap a fork inherits the day it applies.","tree":{"sha":"85cf546f4b790dc15931bb06988f4b764af50f16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/trade-comms-surveillance/git/trees/85cf546f4b790dc15931bb06988f4b764af50f16"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/trade-comms-surveillance/git/commits/c0648fd8aed9ac08150a7b49a61ecf2e3ff229ae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/trade-comms-surveillance/commit/c0648fd8aed9ac08150a7b49a61ecf2e3ff229ae","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiEhtoAKGMwNjQ4ZmQ4YWVkOWFjMDgxNTBhN2I0OWE2MWVjZjJlM2ZmMjI5YWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/trade-comms-surveillance/commit/8df3036741618b59ef1c23946dfcbff5e7f63751","sha":"8df3036741618b59ef1c23946dfcbff5e7f63751","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/trade-comms-surveillance/commits/8df3036741618b59ef1c23946dfcbff5e7f63751"}],"sha":"c0648fd8aed9ac08150a7b49a61ecf2e3ff229ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/trade-comms-surveillance/commits/c0648fd8aed9ac08150a7b49a61ecf2e3ff229ae"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/trade-comms-surveillance/commits/8df3036741618b59ef1c23946dfcbff5e7f63751/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T10:07:27Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T10:17:19Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Vendor the reduced required-artifact set\n\nThe portfolio gate stopped requiring `docs/practices-audit.md`,\n`docs/onprem-migration.md` and a fleet-wide `COMPLIANCE.md` on 2026-09-13, and the\ncanonical skills README was updated to match. This is the vendored copy following, so\nthe convention this repository carries is the one actually in force.\n\nThe scorecard shipped PRE-FILLED from a template render, so requiring it fleet-wide\nmeant every repository asserting a per-check verdict nobody had reached. The exit guide\ndocumented a migration for a profile that is a deliberate fail-fast placeholder. The\nprinciple-to-control mapping is now a launch-set expectation, because it is what a\nbuyer is shown.\n\nRetiring a requirement does not delete a file this repository already has. Nothing is\nremoved here; only the statement of what is required changes.\n\nVendored by `sync-skills.sh` from the canonical copy in org-metadata, never edited in\nplace, so the drift check stays green.","tree":{"sha":"2e1e649af65a691dfe9fcf752b2c699244a44478","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/trade-comms-surveillance/git/trees/2e1e649af65a691dfe9fcf752b2c699244a44478"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/trade-comms-surveillance/git/commits/8df3036741618b59ef1c23946dfcbff5e7f63751","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/trade-comms-surveillance/commit/8df3036741618b59ef1c23946dfcbff5e7f63751","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiEhtoAKDhkZjMwMzY3NDE2MThiNTllZjFjMjM5NDZkZmNiZmY1ZTdmNjM3NTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/trade-comms-surveillance/commit/d9de9bc0cc1c7677322487db65046aba2f08f94d","sha":"d9de9bc0cc1c7677322487db65046aba2f08f94d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/trade-comms-surveillance/commits/d9de9bc0cc1c7677322487db65046aba2f08f94d"}],"sha":"8df3036741618b59ef1c23946dfcbff5e7f63751","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/trade-comms-surveillance/commits/8df3036741618b59ef1c23946dfcbff5e7f63751"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/trade-comms-surveillance/commits/d9de9bc0cc1c7677322487db65046aba2f08f94d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T09:29:41Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T09:51:45Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Gate the project audit config, and default it off\n\n`google_project_iam_audit_config` is AUTHORITATIVE for the service it names, so a\nstack declaring `allServices` does not add to the project''s audit configuration,\nit REPLACES it. Forty-eight stacks in this fleet declared it unconditionally and\nfour gated it, which is the collision the posture record already documents as the\nreason those four decline: a stack asking for DATA_READ and DATA_WRITE removes an\nADMIN_READ a sibling enabled, and Terraform reports it as a create rather than a\nchange, because the stack holds no prior state for a resource that is already live.\n\nThis stack now carries `manage_audit_config`, defaulted false. A deployment that\nwants data-access logging names it in its own tfvars, in exactly one stack per\nproject. Data-access logs are also the highest-volume class Cloud Logging ingests,\nand nothing in the reference deployment reads them.\n\nVerified: terraform fmt is clean and terraform validate passes on every touched\ntree; the three Terraform test suites asserting plan-level refusals pass.","tree":{"sha":"9a97f3020ede2a3b6bc706be8b39996b45919d6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/trade-comms-surveillance/git/trees/9a97f3020ede2a3b6bc706be8b39996b45919d6c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/trade-comms-surveillance/git/commits/d9de9bc0cc1c7677322487db65046aba2f08f94d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/trade-comms-surveillance/commit/d9de9bc0cc1c7677322487db65046aba2f08f94d","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiEhtoAKGQ5ZGU5YmMwY2MxYzc2NzczMjI0ODdkYjY1MDQ2YWJhMmYwOGY5NGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/trade-comms-surveillance/commit/2f1625416a4a1f70f0b8ef123ac5b47adb6ca380","sha":"2f1625416a4a1f70f0b8ef123ac5b47adb6ca380","url":"https://api.