W_URL is empty. Since the runtime control switches landed that\nis false: the service refuses at BOOT when review routing is on and no console\nis named, and CONTACT_REVIEW_ROUTING=false switches routing off, so\nhuman_review_url is only required with review_routing_enabled on.\n\nComment-only; no behaviour changes.","tree":{"sha":"99577331b4fdb2e0bbce53cedb5c0343b7d87975","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/contact-centre-conversations/git/trees/99577331b4fdb2e0bbce53cedb5c0343b7d87975"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/contact-centre-conversations/git/commits/cc867864f90164b8b91225ba8dd32a8a4832b724","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/contact-centre-conversations/commit/cc867864f90164b8b91225ba8dd32a8a4832b724","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiF4toAKGNjODY3ODY0ZjkwMTY0YjhiOTEyMjViYThkZDMyYThhNDgzMmI3MjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/contact-centre-conversations/commit/8387118c8d1cc8340f3a77e81095afdd2796ce93","sha":"8387118c8d1cc8340f3a77e81095afdd2796ce93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/contact-centre-conversations/commits/8387118c8d1cc8340f3a77e81095afdd2796ce93"}],"sha":"cc867864f90164b8b91225ba8dd32a8a4832b724","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/contact-centre-conversations/commits/cc867864f90164b8b91225ba8dd32a8a4832b724"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/contact-centre-conversations/commits/8387118c8d1cc8340f3a77e81095afdd2796ce93/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:06:10Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:15:18Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Send the required vertical on every console turn\n\nThe console already called the right routes, POST /v1/agent-assist/turn and\nPOST /v1/self-service/turn, but neither body carried `vertical`, which TurnRequest\nrequires: it selects which reviewed packs apply and the service will not guess it.\nSo every turn from the console was a 422 in both modes and neither panel could render.\n\nBoth branches of the body now send `vertical`, chosen from a select of the two lines of\nbusiness the shipped packs under config/packs/ are keyed by (retail_banking, the default,\nand general_insurance). Nothing else in the request or the page changes.\n\ntests/unit/test_console_matches_api.py reads every fetch(API + ...) in ui/app/ and holds it\nagainst the live route table: path and method served, every required field sent, no field\nthe model silently drops. It failed against the old console (four findings: both routes,\nboth body branches, each omitting required [''vertical'']) and passes against this one.","tree":{"sha":"e390d8a993aace8941b2807d2ffce0ad7432c7ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/contact-centre-conversations/git/trees/e390d8a993aace8941b2807d2ffce0ad7432c7ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/contact-centre-conversations/git/commits/8387118c8d1cc8340f3a77e81095afdd2796ce93","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/contact-centre-conversations/commit/8387118c8d1cc8340f3a77e81095afdd2796ce93","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiF4toAKDgzODcxMThjOGQxY2M4MzQwZjNhNzdlODEwOTVhZmRkMjc5NmNlOTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/contact-centre-conversations/commit/5e8cedbc8f6383bcfc58972448bb12c2696f6a70","sha":"5e8cedbc8f6383bcfc58972448bb12c2696f6a70","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/contact-centre-conversations/commits/5e8cedbc8f6383bcfc58972448bb12c2696f6a70"}],"sha":"8387118c8d1cc8340f3a77e81095afdd2796ce93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/contact-centre-conversations/commits/8387118c8d1cc8340f3a77e81095afdd2796ce93"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/contact-centre-conversations/commits/5e8cedbc8f6383bcfc58972448bb12c2696f6a70/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T10:38:46Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T10:41:44Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Switch the guardrail and review routing, and report every hand-off\n\nSlice 3 of the rebuild entry, template shape plus a guardrail port: the fleet''s\nruntime-control contract for the two cheap controls this service has. pii-kit masking in\ndomain/pii.py protects the audit trail, tool results and review payload rather than a\nrequest-path redaction port, so it gains no switch.\n\n- CONTACT_REVIEW_ROUTING and CONTACT_GUARDRAIL are read once at settings load in three\n  states: unset is on, a boolean wins, emptied or unrecognised refuses at boot. Off binds a\n  disabled adapter from adapters/controls.py and logs one warning per process. The disabled\n  guardrail passes a turn with the detail \"guardrail off\", the one stated exception to the\n  port''s no-fabricated-CLEAN rule.\n- Under gcp, routing on with no HUMAN_REVIEW_URL refuses at boot, where the first escalation\n  used to fail its request, and the guardrail on with no GUARDRAIL_GATEWAY_URL refuses at\n  boot, where the first turn used to fail closed.\n- The two API routes, the two agent tools and the CLI hand off through RecordingReviewRouter\n  and report review_routing (routed, failed, off, not_required); a failed hand-off is logged\n  by exception type and no longer fails a decided, audited turn. The voice gateway hands off\n  through it too. The console states the outcome instead of \"Routed to human review: no\n  reference\".\n- Terraform gains review_routing_enabled and guardrail_enabled, states both on the service,\n  relaxes each URL requirement only when its control is stated off, and leaves an empty URL\n  off the service because an emptied variable refuses at boot; a new plan test holds that.\n- The runbook, SPEC, COMPLIANCE R1/R8 rows and .env.example describe the switches and the new\n  boot refusals. The promotion gate''s tests state both controls off, as that entrypoint\n  routes and screens nothing.","tree":{"sha":"e33ac205f669c056fed0c7b2584fed928200e87c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/contact-centre-conversations/git/trees/e33ac205f669c056fed0c7b2584fed928200e87c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/contact-centre-conversations/git/commits/5e8cedbc8f6383bcfc58972448bb12c2696f6a70","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/contact-centre-conversations/commit/5e8cedbc8f6383bcfc58972448bb12c2696f6a70","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiF4toAKDVlOGNlZGJjOGY2MzgzYmNmYzU4OTcyNDQ4YmIxMmMyNjk2ZjZhNzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/contact-centre-conversations/commit/25845de475923fb6e2806bb8948af6d18f478718","sha":"25845de475923fb6e2806bb8948af6d18f478718","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/contact-centre-conversations/commits/25845de475923fb6e2806bb8948af6d18f478718"}],"sha":"5e8cedbc8f6383bcfc58972448bb12c2696f6a70","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/contact-centre-conversations/commits/5e8cedbc8f6383bcfc58972448bb12c2696f6a70"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/contact-centre-conversations/commits/25845de475923fb6e2806bb8948af6d18f478718/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T03:49:40Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T03:55:16Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Take the default off the audit bucket lock\n\nworm_locked defaulted to true, so the first apply of this stack in any\nproject locked its audit bucket irreversibly for the whole retention window,\nwith nothing in that deployment''s own tfvars saying so. The fleet decided on\n2026-09-12 that an irreversible control takes no default; this stack was one\nof 33 that sweep never reached.\n\nA plan now refuses until the deployment states the lock. The Terraform tests\nstate it once per file in the production form, still assert that a stated\nlock sits on the six-month floor, and gain a run proving the unlocked posture\ncreates an unlocked bucket. That run fails if the lock is ever hard-coded\nback into the bucket, which every other run would miss.","tree":{"sha":"a8ff1e5e6db22e699ae30a1544879390e62b7e1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/contact-centre-conversations/git/trees/a8ff1e5e6db22e699ae30a1544879390e62b7e1f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/contact-centre-conversations/git/commits/25845de475923fb6e2806bb8948af6d18f478718","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"htt