ner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/contact-centre-conversations/commits/dcf03c23b5a8d9e02b4231d2918f0144b55039e7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T05:14:08Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T05:16:47Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Name the agent-assist coverage gap in the evals page\n\nThe whisper panel''s scenarios exercise one vertical in one market, and the\nwhat-is-not-measured list did not say so. JP and insurance are exercised only\non the customer-facing mode; the packs and corpus for those combinations\nexist, so closing it is authoring work rather than product work.","tree":{"sha":"d496189fa62cce98eefaa487968d2acc2c4f2242","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/contact-centre-conversations/git/trees/d496189fa62cce98eefaa487968d2acc2c4f2242"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/contact-centre-conversations/git/commits/dcf03c23b5a8d9e02b4231d2918f0144b55039e7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as