abilities (the malicious-URI\nfilter and multi-language detection) defaulted on, which also meant a plan in\nasia-southeast1, the fleet''s default region, failed with\nCAPABILITY_NOT_SUPPORTED until a deployment knew to turn them off.\n\nThe variable now defaults to false with one canonical description, the\nexample states the line uncommented, and the comments that said \"default\ntrue\" say otherwise. A Terraform test that relied on the old default now\nstates true, and a new run pins the new default: neither capability arrives\nunless stated.\n\nVerified: terraform validate and terraform test green.","tree":{"sha":"e64cae6fdf4f4d518309003516915c560afa3d82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conversation-qa-scorecard/git/trees/e64cae6fdf4f4d518309003516915c560afa3d82"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conversation-qa-scorecard/git/commits/4f52c98e2d9141998d2a492d7d09b58f46e2f1a6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawast