d as\nreview_routing \"failed\" and logged. Some documents still said the\nmanaged router refuses the escalation at request time rather than\nswallowing it, and .env.example named no switch. Routing off needs no console.\nDocumentation only; no practices-audit verdict changed.","tree":{"sha":"283afd9c832e66565188ce472e5b86441fb36faf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conversation-qa-scorecard/git/trees/283afd9c832e66565188ce472e5b86441fb36faf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conversation-qa-scorecard/git/commits/745d0b666c59a10000b8d8ab583eccf00fb07680","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/conversation-qa-scorecard/commit/745d0b666c59a10000b8d8ab583eccf00fb07680","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiGM9oAKDc0NWQwYjY2NmM1OWExMDAwMGI4ZDhhYjU4M2VjY2YwMGZiMDc2ODA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/conversation-qa-scorecard/commit/eba419d9704ae3efdcf95ce7b6170204078ee632","sha":"eba419d9704ae3efdcf95ce7b6170204078ee632","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conversation-qa-scorecard/commits/eba419d9704ae3efdcf95ce7b6170204078ee632"}],"sha":"745d0b666c59a10000b8d8ab583eccf00fb07680","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conversation-qa-scorecard/commits/745d0b666c59a10000b8d8ab583eccf00fb07680"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conversation-qa-scorecard/commits/eba419d9704ae3efdcf95ce7b6170204078ee632/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:09:12Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:13:16Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Correct the review-routing comments to the boot refusal\n\nThe variables.tf header and the review_url comment in settings.yaml still\nsaid the managed review router refuses to swallow an escalation when\nHUMAN_REVIEW_URL is empty. Since the runtime control switches landed that\nis false twice over: the service refuses at BOOT when review routing is on\nand no console is named, and CONVQA_REVIEW_ROUTING=false switches routing\noff, so human_review_url is only required with review_routing_enabled on.\n\nComment-only; no behaviour changes.","tree":{"sha":"5fc719a32b53d3f616e26ea9f4ca4ac44a6e5caa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conversation-qa-scorecard/git/trees/5fc719a32b53d3f616e26ea9f4ca4ac44a6e5caa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conversation-qa-scorecard/git/commits/eba419d9704ae3efdcf95ce7b6170204078ee632","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/conversation-qa-scorecard/commit/eba419d9704ae3efdcf95ce7b6170204078ee632","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiGM9oAKGViYTQxOWQ5NzA0YWUzZWZkY2Y5NWNlN2I2MTcwMjA0MDc4ZWU2MzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/conversation-qa-scorecard/commit/fb79dcb37e83636cbb4ec32245ded141544ca30e","sha":"fb79dcb37e83636cbb4ec32245ded141544ca30e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conversation-qa-scorecard/commits/fb79dcb37e83636cbb4ec32245ded141544ca30e"}],"sha":"eba419d9704ae3efdcf95ce7b6170204078ee632","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conversation-qa-scorecard/commits/eba419d9704ae3efdcf95ce7b6170204078ee632"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conversation-qa-scorecard/commits/fb79dcb37e83636cbb4ec32245ded141544ca30e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T10:11:06Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T10:13:27Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Switch review routing, refuse at boot without a console, report hand-offs\n\nApplies the fleet''s runtime-control contract (template shape, after aml-alert-triage). Review\nrouting is the one cheap runtime control this service has, so it is the one switch.\n\n- CONVQA_REVIEW_ROUTING is read once at settings load in three states: unset is on, a boolean\n  wins, emptied or unrecognised refuses at boot. Off binds a disabled router and logs one\n  warning per process, however many containers the agent tool builds.\n- Under gcp, routing on with no HUMAN_REVIEW_URL refuses at boot. It used to surface as a 500\n  on the first failing contact, before the scorecard was audited or stored.\n- Routing runs inside the domain scoring service, so the API, the agent tool and the CLI each\n  pass their own recording wrapper in through service.build_service and report\n  review_routing (routed, failed, off, not_required). A hand-off that fails no longer fails\n  the scoring run: the scorecard is still audited and stored with an empty review_ref, and the\n  failure is logged. A stored scorecard read back carries no routing outcome (null), because\n  a read routes nothing. The console states the outcome in plain words instead of \"NOT\n  ROUTED\".\n- Terraform gains review_routing_enabled, sets the service''s switch from it, reserves the\n  name, and relaxes the edge''s console requirement only when routing is stated off; a new plan\n  test holds that.\n- pii-kit masking here is the scoring path''s minimisation, not a redaction port, so it gains\n  no switch.\n- SPEC, COMPLIANCE, the runbook and the compliance FAQ no longer say the router refuses at\n  request time.","tree":{"sha":"72d6f1fc30ba408a3352c3e7c87783f8610b5ba0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conversation-qa-scorecard/git/trees/72d6f1fc30ba408a3352c3e7c87783f8610b5ba0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conversation-qa-scorecard/git/commits/fb79dcb37e83636cbb4ec32245ded141544ca30e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/conversation-qa-scorecard/commit/fb79dcb37e83636cbb4ec32245ded141544ca30e","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiGM9oAKGZiNzlkY2IzN2U4MzYzNmNiYjRlYzMyMjQ1ZGVkMTQxNTQ0Y2EzMGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/conversation-qa-scorecard/commit/314520ed65832fd4b33df78aff6b44f5dc68bf97","sha":"314520ed65832fd4b33df78aff6b44f5dc68bf97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conversation-qa-scorecard/commits/314520ed65832fd4b33df78aff6b44f5dc68bf97"}],"sha":"fb79dcb37e83636cbb4ec32245ded141544ca30e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conversation-qa-scorecard/commits/fb79dcb37e83636cbb4ec32245ded141544ca30e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conversation-qa-scorecard/commits/314520ed65832fd4b33df78aff6b44f5dc68bf97/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T03:50:36Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T03:59:33Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Take the default off the audit bucket lock\n\nworm_locked defaulted to true, so the first apply of this stack in any\nproject locked its audit bucket irreversibly for the whole retention window,\nwith nothing in that deployment''s own tfvars saying so. The fleet decided on\n2026-09-12 that an irreversible control takes no default; this stack was one\nof 33 that sweep never reached.\n\nA plan now refuses until the deployment states the lock. The Terraform tests\nstate it once per file in the production form, still assert that a stated\nlock sits on the six-month floor, and gain a run proving the unlocked posture\ncreates an unlocked bucket. That run fails if the lock is ever hard-coded\nback into the bucket, which every other run would miss.","tree":{"sha":"be0cc5b56c142a561b1585ae07c6c4c1aa78bb17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conversation-qa-scorecard/git/trees/be0cc5b56c142a561b1585ae07c6c4c1aa78bb17"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai