9-04T21:16:21Z","email":"49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"dependabot[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T22:22:09Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Bump the npm-minor-patch group across 1 directory with 2 updates\n\nBumps the npm-minor-patch group with 2 updates in the /ui directory: [next](https://github.com/vercel/next.js) and [@types/node](https://github.com/DefinitelyTyped/DefinitelyTyped/tree/HEAD/types/node).\n\n\nUpdates `next` from 16.3.3 to 16.3.4\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/vercel/next.js/releases)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/vercel/next.js/compare/v16.3.3...v16.3.4)\n\nUpdates `@types/node` from 26.4.0 to 26.4.1\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/DefinitelyTyped/DefinitelyTyped/releases)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/DefinitelyTyped/DefinitelyTyped/commits/HEAD/types/node)\n\n---\nupdated-dependencies:\n- dependency-name: next\n  dependency-version: 16.3.4\n  dependency-type: direct:production\n  update-type: version-update:semver-patch\n  dependency-group: npm-minor-patch\n- dependency-name: \"@types/node\"\n  dependency-version: 26.4.1\n  dependency-type: direct:development\n  update-type: version-update:semver-patch\n  dependency-group: npm-minor-patch\n...\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>","tree":{"sha":"33ed3c5e87d7bde3ff9e74f1abe7635c909fa033","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conversation-qa-scorecard/git/trees/33ed3c5e87d7bde3ff9e74f1abe7635c909fa033"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/conversation-qa-scorecard/git/commits/4c7dc71bf761d20717c9607c9399fb39bb669a4c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","followin