llowing{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/proactive-service-outreach/commits/bbea59869dd69559dfc9f88d8be04cf73e191896/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T09:41:35Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T09:54:43Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Bump hex-service-kit to v0.0.11: trace only through the collector\n\nDecision D1: build_tracer refuses an unset OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT instead of\nexporting straight to Cloud Trace around the collector''s GenAI-content redaction, and\ntakes no project argument any more.\n\n- pyproject.toml and the locks: hex-service-kit v0.0.11 (ec2d724). The only other lock\n  movement is opentelemetry-exporter-gcp-trace and its dependencies leaving with the\n  kit''s otel extra, where this repo resolved it.\n- adapters/gcp/tracer.py: build_tracer(service=...) only.\n- tests/contract: the managed tracer''s documented refusal is now\n  CollectorEndpointRequiredError; on-prem keys off a new onprem_refuses field; a new\n  test keeps the old guarantee that with a collector configured and no SDK a span\n  degrades to a no-op.\n- settings, config, Terraform variable and adoption notes stop describing a direct\n  Cloud Trace path that no longer exists.\n\nRelocked without --upgrade: fleet-deps bump-commons'' --upgrade relock moved 0\nunrelated pins here, and those were reverted.","tree":{"sha":"c728f81e7bdd505a51c47333c0b545801e2f5fec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/proactive-service-outreach/git/trees/c728f81e7bdd505a51c47333c0b545801e2f5fec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/proactive-service-outreach/git/commits/bbea59869dd69559dfc9f88d8be04cf73e191896","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/proactive-service-outreach/commit/bbea59869dd69559dfc9f88d8be04cf73e191896","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiGh9oAKGJiZWE1OTg2OWRkNjk1NTlkZmM5Zjg4ZDhiZTA0Y2Y3M2UxOTE4OTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/proactive-service-outreach/commit/836e266973063a1924f9e5a8ddb957266df12b4f","sha":"836e266973063a1924f9e5a8ddb957266df12b4f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/proactive-service-outreach/commits/836e266973063a1924f9e5a8ddb957266df12b4f"}],"sha":"bbea59869dd69559dfc9f88d8be04cf73e191896","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/proactive-service-outreach/commits/bbea59869dd69559dfc9f88d8be04cf73e191896"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/proactive-service-outreach/commits/836e266973063a1924f9e5a8ddb957266df12b4f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T04:47:16Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T04:49:53Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Screen the drafting call through a fail-closed guardrail port (rule R1)\n\nAdopt the fixed guardrail design from hex-service-template: a GuardrailPort\nwith local heuristic, regional Model Armor and on-prem placeholder adapters,\nthe OUTREACH_GUARDRAIL three-state switch, and a boot refusal when the\nguardrail is on under gcp with the Model Armor adapter bound and no\ntemplate named.\n\nThe Model Armor adapter allows only NO_MATCH_FOUND with invocation_result\nSUCCESS, read by enum name, under a per-call deadline; a match, a partial\nscreen, an empty result or an API error refuses.\n\nThe drafter is this service''s one generation call. The domain now renders\nthe prompt (domain/drafting.drafting_prompt, moved out of the gcp adapter),\nscreens it whole before any model is called (every fact value, the locale,\nthe channel and the template id are in it), and hands the drafter the\nscreened text exactly as returned; the gcp drafter sends that string and\nrefuses an empty one. The drafter''s raw answer is screened before the\nvalidator reads it. Drafting is optional by design, so a refusal in either\ndirection, or a guardrail that cannot decide, is audited decision=blocked\nwithout the refused text and the draft is discarded: deterministic body,\nhuman review, nothing delivered. The demo''s drafting step goes through the\nsame screened service path instead of calling the drafter directly.\n\nTerraform adds the regional template (gated on\nmodel_armor_full_capabilities, template_metadata shipped from the first\napply, ignore_partial_invocation_failures false), roles/modelarmor.user,\nthe API and perimeter entries, the google-beta provider with its lock and\ntftest mock, a tftest run for the template, the guardrail_blocks alert the\nrunbook said to add with the port, and the serving edge''s OUTREACH_GUARDRAIL,\ntemplate and regional host env. google-cloud-modelarmor joins the gcp extra\nand requirements-gcp.lock. Tests prove the mapping against SDK-free IntEnum\nmirrors in every gate and against the real modelarmor_v1 types where the\nSDK is installed, plus the switch, the boot refusal and each domain path.","tree":{"sha":"62e9fd5bc4a7b8f566d623c347656a774dcb4347","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/proactive-service-outreach/git/trees/62e9fd5bc4a7b8f566d623c347656a774dcb4347"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/proactive-service-outreach/git/commits/836e266973063a1924f9e5a8ddb957266df12b4f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/proactive-service-outreach/commit/836e266973063a1924f9e5a8ddb957266df12b4f","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiGh9oAKDgzNmUyNjY5NzMwNjNhMTkyNGY5ZTVhOGRkYjk1NzI2NmRmMTJiNGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/proactive-service-outreach/commit/0720465276933ef23a4b7bad662af1d42407a20c","sha":"0720465276933ef23a4b7bad662af1d42407a20c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/proactive-service-outreach/commits/0720465276933ef23a4b7bad662af1d42407a20c"}],"sha":"836e266973063a1924f9e5a8ddb957266df12b4f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/proactive-service-outreach/commits/836e266973063a1924f9e5a8ddb957266df12b4f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.gi