eived_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/proactive-service-outreach/commits/51d81d75a0c736f87d3d909122943885edbec4e6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T14:27:36Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T21:53:59Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Show the model that answered as two pills, not a banner, on hex-service-kit v0.0.10\n\nOwner decision 2026-09-23: every console shows two small pills at the top\nright, the model that ANSWERED and Search when an online search tool was\nused, in place of the full-width provenance banner that named what\nconfiguration would call.\n\n- pyproject: hex-service-kit v0.0.10 (0e71fc7) in both pins ([fastapi] and\n  [otel]); relocked, no unrelated pin moved.\n- api/app.py installs install_answer_provenance(app), so X-Answered-By and\n  X-Search-Used carry whatever the drafting adapters note.\n- Drafting adapters note what answered: the managed Vertex drafter notes the\n  model it passed to generate_content; the offline template drafter notes\n  config.OFFLINE_STUB_MODEL, the one constant generator_model also reports\n  under local. No search tool is attached anywhere, so nothing notes search.\n  Drafting stays free: the managed call sends no temperature, now proved by a\n  faked-genai test.\n- config.py: the hard-reasoning branch is deleted from the model resolver.\n  generator_model names the setting the managed adapter reads.\n- ui/app/ModelPills.tsx replaces ProvenanceBanner.tsx in layout.tsx: the\n  configured generator_model from /healthz, dimmed, until an answer names\n  the model that answered; Search only while that answer searched. One\n  window.fetch wrapper (lib/answer-provenance.mjs, node-tested) reads both\n  headers; the proxy route now forwards them. The banner CSS is deleted.\n- CONTRIBUTING row 5c: a model port notes its model and any search it\n  attached, and keeps temperature optional, omitted when free.\n- tests: test_answer_provenance.py (the local route names the stub and no\n  search; an ineligible contact names nothing; a searching drafter yields\n  both headers and the next request neither; the managed drafter notes its\n  model and sends no temperature; no flag moves generator_model), the pills\n  contract in test_ui_surface.py, test_provenance_banner_contract.py renamed\n  to test_model_pills_contract.py.","tree":{"sha":"8e3ec779701ccc9b97da6db958381dc596df7ab5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/proactive-service-outreach/git/trees/8e3ec779701ccc9b97da6db958381dc596df7ab5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/proactive-service-outreach/git/commits/51d81d75a0c736f87d3d909122943885edbec4e6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/us