wasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/code-api-migration/commit/ba11cbce55d7cc4d60b7a200c55d2d809bc691d6","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiG4doAKGJhMTFjYmNlNTVkN2NjNGQ2MGI3YTIwMGM1NWQyZDgwOWJjNjkxZDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/code-api-migration/commit/99d2673438e19c8900fba4235da364819ffb2759","sha":"99d2673438e19c8900fba4235da364819ffb2759","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/code-api-migration/commits/99d2673438e19c8900fba4235da364819ffb2759"}],"sha":"ba11cbce55d7cc4d60b7a200c55d2d809bc691d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/code-api-migration/commits/ba11cbce55d7cc4d60b7a200c55d2d809bc691d6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/code-api-migration/commits/99d2673438e19c8900fba4235da364819ffb2759/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T10:01:14Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T22:40:36Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Name the systems this repo depends on, instead of their catalog ids\n\nRepository names are unique across the organization, so a reader no longer has\nto resolve a code through a table to learn which system is meant. The catalog\ndropped its ID column, and this repository follows.\n\nBeyond prose, four identifier changes:\n\n- The review payload''s source_key prefix is the repository name. It is a dedup\n  key -- human-review-console queries on it and the local store makes it a\n  PRIMARY KEY -- so producers and the console have to agree, and the branch\n  carries the migration for rows written under the old prefix.\n- Terraform''s local.render_catalog_id becomes local.render_repository. It feeds\n  display names and descriptions, which update in place.\n- scripts/demo.py''s catalog id is deleted rather than renamed: a REPOSITORY\n  constant and a \"repository\" state key were already there beside it.\n- scripts/rename_fork.py loses --catalog-id, which had nothing left to rewrite.\n\nLines that outgrew the 100-column limit because a name is longer than an id are\nrewrapped rather than shortened by dropping the name. `ruff check`,\n`ruff format --check` and the offline tests are clean.\n\nDeployed resource identifiers are deliberately NOT changed: the Terraform\nname_prefix stems and the Secret Manager secret ids still carry the old\nlowercase id. Those name resources that exist in the deployment, and renaming a\nname_prefix destroys and recreates them, so they are an infrastructure\nmigration rather than a rename.","tree":{"sha":"606c7c0e75edfba47367abbc044010b3b31881be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/code-api-migration/git/trees/606c7c0e75edfba47367abbc044010b3b31881be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/code-api-migration/git/commits/99d2673438e19c8900fba4235da364819ffb2759","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/code-api-migration/commit/99d2673438e19c8900fba4235da364819ffb2759","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiG4doAKDk5ZDI2NzM0MzhlMTljODkwMGZiYTQyMzVkYTM2NDgxOWZmYjI3NTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/code-api-migration/commit/3af718a0eea09ebab258c60d8274c50116bbd9c0","sha":"3af718a0eea09ebab258c60d8274c50116bbd9c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/code-api-migration/commits/3af718a0eea09ebab258c60d8274c50116bbd9c0"}],"sha":"99d2673438e19c8900fba4235da364819ffb2759","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/code-api-migration/commits/99d2673438e19c8900fba4235da364819ffb2759"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercont