g_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/code-api-migration/commits/a2b90e4dba630e69bcf32f7d9e93e136f748b8f3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T15:46:45Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T15:46:45Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Pin hex-service-kit v0.0.4 (#14)\n\nv0.0.4 closes a silent widening at a tenancy boundary in the federation module.\n_hosted_domain fell back to the email domain before the policy was consulted, so\ntenant_from_hosted_domain meant \"the hd claim OR the mail domain is the tenant\": a\ntoken carrying no hd went from no tenant to a tenant named after its mail domain.\n\nThis repository does not call principal_from_iap_claims, so it was never exposed to\nthat widening; the bump is for one pin across the fleet, and so the fixed function\nis the one available when the claim half is adopted. It also carries the assurance\nand subject-principal knobs that adoption needs.\n\nLockfiles regenerated by fleet-deps.py, never hand-edited. Gate run against the\nnewly installed pin rather than against whatever was already in the venv.","tree":{"sha":"11e05451c4deb083a09d172b4a5c45b3c95d25ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/code-api-migration/git/trees/11e05451c4deb083a09d172b4a5c45b3c95d25ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/code-api-migration/git/commits/a2b90e4dba630e69bcf32f7d9e93e136f748b8f3","verification":{"payload":"tree 11e05451c4deb083a09d172b4a5c45b3c95d25ed\nparent b1076be62daaf4e67738ea4cea1e9a52cda87f26\nauthor Ashish <ashish.awasthi@gmail.com> 1787672805 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787672805 +0800\n\nPin hex-service-kit v0.0.4 (#14)\n\nv0.0.4 closes a silent widening at a tenancy boundary in the federation module.\n_hosted_domain fell back to the email domain before the policy was consulted, so\ntenant_from_hosted_domain meant \"the hd claim OR the mail domain is the tenant\": a\ntoken carrying no hd went from no tenant to a tenant named after its mail domain.\n\nThis repository does not call principal_from_iap_claims, so it was never exposed to\nthat widening; the bump is for one pin across the fleet, and so the fixed function\nis the one available when the claim half is adopted. It also carries the assurance\nand subject-principal knobs that adoption needs.\n\nLockfiles regenerated by fleet-deps.py, never hand-edited. Gate run against the\nnewly installed pin rather than against whatever was already in the venv.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjbjlCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAngMQAGKI8C33JihjNOjZzv3KRrxl\nkxc6e7Saw3PPe3o/zeGgNNoaQDiZf+VJ+5CSroB2JJHnfs15HTzZwyd0UU9TKddc\nbFBY+drQB3jSuNQerlw8m0bEs6UkLOWSjGWHQWZ4O+3fbtFcNoUxdZQjL/2gIdBE\nvaYzqFvaK4n0eNw9wMYHd2A1mwrLm62bLaRTdZeiCoeMUsUz6cioc/m8TjrJ5Ugi\nGcCn6TzeonmBOYNb+7Pe6EiZG4veYDKPwXl8KzvKlDLRXggRpT3PqvYyOsgP1kf6\nW7lMd9vli0iepdSg36T+idbfgtKN5l6Eynk1+5APos5dJXHS7iI+So0pcovUngwx\n5SHKidvxYm+RT9kLNr41gqVqaB0m4JWJgJn8L+MygQfDn8jffyE0QqdBLpIjKhdC\nQgs1LZN7g6N5rgix1bY4E5dsa91SBsCD0sE7tBmSMA4PS34wQfnn3+foJuJUUDXQ\nB7QTWIAjdcY35BLdeWVF71S2qkNcdrYyqSMGJulVxO0s6erNL5R90YIYUeB5jP6u\nLz64x+jOwWD86WVo