/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/commits/a77dbd0d7bdb3b8c807b55960a722f4c00f8b62b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T14:30:22Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T21:58:33Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Show the model that answered as two pills, not a banner, on hex-service-kit v0.0.10\n\nCleanup slice 5 (quality caps), following hex-service-template#36.\n\n- hex-service-kit v0.0.10 (0e71fc7). The relock moved no other pin.\n- api/app.py installs install_answer_provenance(app), so X-Answered-By and\n  X-Search-Used carry whatever a model adapter notes. This service binds no\n  model port (the certification verdict and every scorecard figure are\n  deterministic), so it notes nothing and sends neither header; the pill\n  shows no-model.\n- ui/app/ModelPills.tsx replaces ProvenanceBanner.tsx in layout.tsx: the\n  configured generator_model from /healthz, dashed, until an answer names the\n  model that answered; Search only while that answer searched. One\n  window.fetch wrapper (lib/answer-provenance.mjs, node-tested) reads both\n  headers, and the proxy route forwards them. The banner and its CSS are gone.\n  Unlike the template, the pills carry no dark-scheme override: this page\n  renders light in both schemes, and the override inverted the pills there.\n- config.py: the hard-reasoning branch is deleted from the model resolver, so\n  no flag can name a model no adapter calls.\n- CONTRIBUTING row 5c: a new model port notes what answered and samples per\n  call.\n- tests: test_answer_provenance.py, the pills contract in test_ui_surface.py,\n  and the service-half banner test renamed to test_model_pill_contract.py.","tree":{"sha":"02412c492c4c0369220821e2a4d1d708b9fedd92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/git/trees/02412c492c4c0369220821e2a4d1d708b9fedd92"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/git/commits/a77dbd0d7bdb3b8c807b55960a722f4c00f8b62b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/commit/a77dbd0d7bdb3b8c807b55960a722f4c00f8b62b","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiHQtoAKGE3N2RiZDBkN2JkYjNiOGM4MDdiNTU5NjBhNzIyZjRjMDBmOGI2MmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/commit/2554c83d955f0287061542d00bd472e557218bef","sha":"2554c83d955f0287061542d00bd472e557218bef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/commits/2554c83d955f0287061542d00bd472e557218bef"}],"sha":"a77dbd0d7bdb3b8c807b55960a722f4c00f8b