er}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/commits/9bf34d3d4767273965c8ddbae4fdfe1baaaddb6b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:40:24Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:43:16Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Correct docs that say the review router refuses at request time\n\nThe service now refuses to boot under the managed profile when review\nrouting is on and HUMAN_REVIEW_URL is unset, DATAQUALITY_REVIEW_ROUTING switches\nrouting, and a hand-off that fails at request time is reported as\nreview_routing \"failed\" and logged. Some documents still said the\nmanaged router refuses the escalation at request time rather than\nswallowing it, and .env.example named no switch. Routing off needs no console.\nDocumentation only; no practices-audit verdict changed.","tree":{"sha":"277dca986ad04607b97a3ccf68a17efc61bf0b07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/git/trees/277dca986ad04607b97a3ccf68a17efc61bf0b07"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/git/commits/9bf34d3d4767273965c8ddbae4fdfe1baaaddb6b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/commit/9bf34d3d4767273965c8ddbae4fdfe1baaaddb6b","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiHQtoAKDliZjM0ZDNkNDc2NzI3Mzk2NWM4ZGRiYWU0ZmRmZTFiYWFhZGRiNmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/commit/768fe8e862b3058030d28a248c3b3231d67c1764","sha":"768fe8e862b3058030d28a248c3b3231d67c1764","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/commits/768fe8e862b3058030d28a248c3b3231d67c1764"}],"sha":"9bf34d3d4767273965c8ddbae4fdfe1baaaddb6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/commits/9bf34d3d4767273965c8ddbae4fdfe1baaaddb6b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/commits/768fe8e862b3058030d28a248c3b3231d67c1764/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:26:01Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:28:19Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Correct the review-routing comments to the boot refusal\n\nThe variables.tf header and the review_url comment in settings.yaml still\nsaid the managed review router refuses to swallow an escalation when\nHUMAN_REVIEW_URL is empty. Since the runtime control switches landed that\nis false: the service refuses at BOOT when review routing is on and no console\nis named, and DATAQUALITY_REVIEW_ROUTING=false switches routing off, so\nhuman_review_url is only required with review_routing_enabled on.\n\nComment-only; no behaviour changes.","tree":{"sha":"65c27e5821a02991a9361f47b45a865fa4d53e9a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/git/trees/65c27e5821a02991a9361f47b45a865fa4d53e9a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/git/commits/768fe8e862b3058030d28a248c3b3231d67c1764","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/commit/768fe8e862b3058030d28a248c3b3231d67c1764","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiHQtoAKDc2OGZlOGU4NjJiMzA1ODAzMGQyOGEyNDhjM2IzMjMxZDY3YzE3NjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/commit/43222d490fa64de472854a5ad51848ba41194fa7","sha":"43222d490fa64de472854a5ad51848ba41194fa7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/commits/43222d490fa64de472854a5ad51848ba41194fa7"}],"sha":"768fe8e862b3058030d28a248c3b3231d67c1764","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/commits/768fe8e862b3058030d28a248c3b3231d67c1764"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/commits/43222d490fa64de472854a5ad51848ba41194fa7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:05:52Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:11:07Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Wire the console to the real certify call\n\nThe console posted {subject, text} to POST /v1/triage, a route this service does not serve, so\nevery submit was a 404 and the console could never produce a scorecard. The API certifies a\ndataset through POST /v1/certify, whose CertifyRequest takes only dataset_id, and answers the\nstatus wire from GET /v1/certification/{dataset_id}.\n\nThe console now certifies a dataset by id with { dataset_id } and can read the result back from\nthe status route. There is no list route, so the field is free text with the three fictional\ndatasets the local profile seeds offered as suggestions, defaulting to transactions_daily.\n\ntests/unit/test_console_matches_api.py reads every fetch(API + ...) in ui/app/ and holds it\nagainst the live route table: path and method served, every required field sent, no field the\nmodel silently drops. It failed against the old console (POST /v1/triage is not served) and\npasses against this one.","tree":{"sha":"a23af8775236f12e93845f6269a94086f26c28e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/git/trees/a23af8775236f12e93845f6269a94086f26c28e3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/git/commits/43222d490fa64de472854a5ad51848ba41194fa7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/commit/43222d490fa64de472854a5ad51848ba41194fa7","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiHQtoAKDQzMjIyZDQ5MGZhNjRkZTQ3Mjg1NGE1YWQ1MTg0OGJhNDExOTRmYTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/commit/5185abca998a8b13da2dcf15671f4decf8855aac","sha":"5185abca998a8b13da2dcf15671f4decf8855aac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/commits/5185abca998a8b13da2dcf15671f4decf8855aac"}],"sha":"43222d490fa64de472854a5ad51848ba41194fa7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/commits/43222d490fa64de472854a5ad51848ba41194fa7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/commits/5185abca998a8b13da2dcf15671f4decf8855aac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T10:22:45Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T10:25:06Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Switch review routing, refuse at boot without a console, report hand-offs\n\nApplies the fleet''s runtime-control contract (template shape, after aml-alert-triage). Review\nrouting is the one cheap runtime control this service has, so it is the one switch.\n\n- DATAQUALITY_REVIEW_ROUTING is read once at settings load in three states: unset is on, a\n  boolean wins, emptied or unrecognised refuses at boot. Off binds a disabled router and logs\n  one warning per process, however many containers the agent tool builds.\n- Under gcp, routing on with no HUMAN_REVIEW_URL refuses at boot. It used to surface as a 500\n  on the first escalating certification, after the scorecard had already been audited.\n- The certify route, the agent tool and the CLI hand off through a recording wrapper, so a\n  hand-off that fails no longer fails the request: the result carries review_routing (routed,\n  failed, off, not_required) and an empty review_ref, and the failure is logged. The console\n  states the outcome in plain words.\n- Terraform gains review_routing_enabled, sets the service''s switch from it, and relaxes the\n  edge''s console requirement only when routing is stated off; a new plan test holds that.\n- pii-kit masking here is minimisation of the audit record, tool results and review payload,\n  not a redaction port, so it gains no switch.\n- SPEC, COMPLIANCE, ADOPTING, the runbook and two FAQs no longer say the router refuses at\n  request time.","tree":{"sha":"0401a13635a5a240e28e5e62981abed0d8c281b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/git/trees/0401a13635a5a240e28e5e62981abed0d8c281b0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/git/commits/5185abca998a8b13da2dcf15671f4decf8855aac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","nod