 Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T12:27:07Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Correct the hosted check''s name: GitHub Actions, not Cloud Build","tree":{"sha":"f8cc786a2c7c8907b93af71997b7157defd9695e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/git/trees/f8cc786a2c7c8907b93af71997b7157defd9695e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/git/commits/f6a698ac964d7bdaf1853079c49488c73ea145d9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/commit/f6a698ac964d7bdaf1853079c49488c73ea145d9","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiHQtoAKGY2YTY5OGFjOTY0ZDdiZGFmMTg1MzA3OWM0OTQ4OGM3M2VhMTQ1ZDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/commit/94a1f9c38d4f4d837e670050202184a330235aa8","sha":"94a1f9c38d4f4d837e670050202184a330235aa8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/commits/94a1f9c38d4f4d837e670050202184a330235aa8"}],"sha":"f6a698ac964d7bdaf1853079c49488c73ea145d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/commits/f6a698ac964d7bdaf1853079c49488c73ea145d9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/commits/94a1f9c38d4f4d837e670050202184a330235aa8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T15:20:54Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T15:43:51Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Adopt the fleet''s GitHub Actions gate, alongside the Cloud Build one\n\nPart of the fleet''s move off paid Cloud Build, which bills SGD ~3.94/day for work that calls no\nGoogle Cloud API, reads no secret and holds no deploy authority. Actions runs the same work free\non a public repository. Proved on account-takeover-investigator first: both jobs green, 138s of\nwall clock against Cloud Build''s 266s, running the same run-grc-ci in the same reviewed image.\n\nNothing about branch protection changes here. `pr-<repo> (portable-genai-ci-sg)` remains the\nonly REQUIRED check, so this reports alongside it and cannot block a merge while it is proved.\n\nGENERATED, not written: org-metadata/scripts/render-actions-callers.py emits this from the same\nci/gcp/repository-policy.json entry the Cloud Build trigger is built from, and its --check mode\nfails on drift. The 196 workflow files retired on 2026-09-01 rotted because each was maintained\nby hand; this one has no hand to rot by.","tree":{"sha":"5269fdf9ae65e43129f0b8bc52bdb250269ae41b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/git/trees/5269fdf9ae65e43129f0b8bc52bdb250269ae41b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/git/commits/94a1f9c38d4f4d837e670050202184a330235aa8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/commit/94a1f9c38d4f4d837e670050202184a330235aa8","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiHQtoAKDk0YTFmOWMzOGQ0ZjRkODM3ZTY3MDA1MDIwMjE4NGEzMzAyMzVhYTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/commit/9f41c3a22b2b0adeb93b7c758ffc17771d1eb3c3","sha":"9f41c3a22b2b0adeb93b7c758ffc17771d1eb3c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/commits/9f41c3a22b2b0adeb93b7c758ffc17771d1eb3c3"}],"sha":"94a1f9c38d4f4d837e670050202184a330235aa8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/commits/94a1f9c38d4f4d837e670050202184a330235aa8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/commits/9f41c3a22b2b0adeb93b7c758ffc17771d1eb3c3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T10:07:12Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T10:16:39Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Name what actually runs the demo surface, not a deleted workflow\n\nThe demo surface claimed a `demo-gate` workflow ran it on every push. That\nworkflow was deleted with the rest when GitHub Actions were retired as\nunrunnable, so the claim named a runner that could not run and nothing said so.\n\n`scripts/README.md` went further and said `make demo-selftest` and\n`make portability` \"run in CI on every push\". They ran nowhere. The headless arc\nsurvived only because `tests/unit/test_demo_surface.py` drives the same code\ninside `make gate`; the portability tour had no automated runner at all, and\nonly its existence was asserted.\n\nBoth now run in the hosted Cloud Build check: they are named in this\nrepository''s job contract in `org-metadata/ci/gcp/repository-policy.json`, so\nthe sentence is true again rather than deleted. They cost well under a second\neach.\n\nAlso corrected in the same pass: \"No stub service\" overstated the offline\nclaim. The engine has no stub, but the generation port is bound to an offline\nmodel stub that carries the word in its own model id. The demo shows that on\nscreen, so the prose should not contradict it.","tree":{"sha":"3681b1382c22c448f060f4bc8357d34df280c245","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/git/trees/3681b1382c22c448f060f4bc8357d34df280c245"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/git/commits/9f41c3a22b2b0adeb93b7c758ffc17771d1eb3c3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/u