arents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/commit/6626858808706ebfee48dd5a459912c311eedaa1","sha":"6626858808706ebfee48dd5a459912c311eedaa1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/commits/6626858808706ebfee48dd5a459912c311eedaa1"}],"sha":"1b1e22525a44825e355847c7f2f265f7578164a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/commits/1b1e22525a44825e355847c7f2f265f7578164a1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/commits/6626858808706ebfee48dd5a459912c311eedaa1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T07:55:48Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T07:55:48Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Re-point the IAP negative matrix at the refusals the verifier actually raises (#11)\n\nThe module skipped wherever google-auth was absent, which is every SDK-free gate, so\nnothing had compared its expectations against the adapter in a long time. Run with the\nruntime lockfile installed it was 10 failed, 12 passed -- every failure a stale regex,\nnot a security hole: each cell rejected its assertion, with a more specific reason than\nthe generic \"verification failed\" the test still demanded.\n\nThe replacements are narrower than what they replace. Each cell now names the exact\nrefusal it exists to prove, so a refusal for the wrong reason fails the cell instead of\nsatisfying it: \"declares alg ''none'', which means it is UNSIGNED\" is a different property\nfrom \"unparseable\", and \"missing required claim(s): sub\" is a different property from\n\"missing required claim(s): email\".\n\n22 passed after the change, in all 31 repositories.\n\nCo-authored-by: Ashish Awasthi <72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"04af007903148648e5d325327ed3d38790b691bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/git/trees/04af007903148648e5d325327ed3d38790b691bc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/data-quality-governance/git/commits/6626858808706ebfee48dd5a459912c311eedaa1","verification":{"payload":"tree 04af007903148648e5d325327ed3d38790b691bc\nparent f1f6d592cf2e84ae93d9d4dc7a926be79c4eb23f\nauthor Ashish <ashish.awasthi@gmail.com> 1787644548 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787644548 +0800\n\nRe-point the IAP negative matrix at the refusals the verifier actually raises (#11)\n\nThe module skipped wherever google-auth was absent, which is every SDK-free gate, so\nnothing had compared its expectations against the adapter in a long time. Run with the\nruntime lockfile installed it was 10 failed, 12 passed -- every failure a stale regex,\nnot a security hole: each cell rejected its assertion, with a more specific reason than\nthe generic \"verification failed\" the test still demanded.\n\nThe replacements are narrower than what they replace. Each cell now names the exact\nrefusal it exists to prove, so a refusal for the wrong reason fails the cell instead of\nsatisfying it: \"declares alg ''none'', which means it is UNSIGNED\" is a different property\nfrom \"unparseable\", and \"missing required claim(s): sub\" is a different property from\n\"missing required claim(s): email\".\n\n22 passed after the change, in all 31 repositories.\n\nCo-authored-by: Ashish Awasthi <72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjUqECRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAATVcQAIm4X7DGWTx3m1UBjVGAggvg\nipbOi1sxLYbHA3G2xiHEulDWEKnbvEeEGMM6rXTNDziq0BGLTjzTjrAgyXK4Hqhq\nPa1A0pblLo9SvkFBA7pHY1Ow8lMCEH3cUdlidRZDSmuUVGXgX2j5nRvb7+PgGabE\nKNAik/wOvvIlTAK609HoSIGl/umCrReY7R7LZFeNEEWBLUDtZ0aWgJ37X7VRMk73\nPPiUc4clzWSAjxpyZX+pY7qVebAbqR/DgmJzYfNMzJCUzlYZErrHuD8si2TlKPKk\n+zb0WQf5CsQ8ITsDaaKjO8bd7njBSqihvVCkKgb+b+JqdBHvLPgidqk5z8gKljyU\nmhK+eT9tW866j2I4mSjbjxA7JK0GSF2fzV1/dF4Hp7cdZN/6B/fLvkgXHhxG3UK7\nLn3lIJwAfqBM1QDlYvMmzBj+TJuAUueCXkaKHRFzeqewbA6ZRKVHgb0uhlX15WKx\nSrOv5Ntqv7RLT9xzxlJwnuwBFAquo1aFsbTLxcw5rhYp+BY/KIcqonUNeNxJ8Jwm\nIjqEIkY3Kb5ZxGvKuwnS5kWp0RqSBOOpptj8Bp0wJiHrDnd60Hjw5sHhNXdyWLkr\n9obBvMJVLGV7mX4euOEhjE31QhprTmhgaJQS06rbwOvhX+WNHBX8uKMqzcIuUhAr\n6v8ur24DcjKUAbPhiJCH\n=XJuK\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-25T07:55:48Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","r