i"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T22:00:41Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Replace the provenance banner with answer pills; bump hex-service-kit to v0.0.10\n\nThe console now shows two small pills at the top right: the model that answered\n(X-Answered-By, falling back to generator_model from /healthz) and Search when the\nanswer used an online search tool. The API installs install_answer_provenance, the\nNext.js proxy forwards both headers, and the old banner component and CSS are gone.\n\nThis service binds no model port: its triage engine is deterministic and notes\nnothing, so it sends neither header and the pill shows the configured no-model.\nuse_hard_reasoning is removed from the generator_model resolver.","tree":{"sha":"5b21064765d0a41859d5a6eab8537588006d66d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/itsm-servicedesk-triage/git/trees/5b21064765d0a41859d5a6eab8537588006d66d6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/itsm-servicedesk-triage/git/commits/876277a8bfc2d829be4185675058abacb976dbbe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/star