_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/commits/b3be9c0f0235110bd93439459d35d5d17a6a98cf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T15:11:53Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T15:26:12Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Default model_armor_full_capabilities to false\n\nSlice 7 of the 2026-09-23 posture rule, applied to the variable nl2sql-analytics#59\nintroduced: a control that is not irreversible defaults off in code, and\nterraform.tfvars.example carries the production form (it already states\nfalse for asia-southeast1). Matches the fleet-wide change landed the same day.\n\nThe plan tests now pin the default (both regional capabilities declined) and\nprove that stating true asks for the whole guardrail.\n\nVerified: terraform test 20/20.","tree":{"sha":"aea08b3bea46ac1ea5f5367975e938d1f5fcbb00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/git/trees/aea08b3bea46ac1ea5f5367975e938d1f5fcbb00"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/git/commits/b3be9c0f0235110bd93439459d35d5d17a6a98cf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/commit/b3be9c0f0235110bd93439459d35d5d17a6a98cf","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiIN9oAKGIzYmU5YzBmMDIzNTExMGJkOTM0Mzk0NTlkMzVkNWQxN2E2YTk4Y2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/commit/80bd25cfacbf15a7ad3400ea5387e0df4949b285","sha":"80bd25cfacbf15a7ad3400ea5387e0df4949b285","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/commits/80bd25cfacbf15a7ad3400ea5387e0df4949b285"}],"sha":"b3be9c0f0235110bd93439459d35d5d17a6a98cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/commits/b3be9c0f0235110bd93439459d35d5d17a6a98cf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/commits/80bd25cfacbf15a7ad3400ea5387e0df4949b285/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T14:49:38Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T15:18:35Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Bump hex-service-kit to v0.0.11: trace only through the collector\n\nv0.0.11 deletes the kit tracer''s direct Cloud Trace path (decision D1 of the\nguardrail/registry/observability plan): build_tracer raises when\nOTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT is unset, so spans can no longer leave around the\ncollector''s GenAI-content redaction. Its signature is service= alone, so the\ngcp tracer adapter stops passing project=, and its docstring stops promising\nthe unset-endpoint path to Cloud Trace.\n\nThe parity suite takes the template''s D1 contract with it: the managed tracer\nnow declares CollectorEndpointRequiredError as its refusal, on-prem''s no-op\ntracer is marked as never refusing, and a new test proves that with a\ncollector configured the tracer still degrades to a no-op offline.\n\nRelocked with this repository''s own `make lock`, which moves only the kit\npin; `make gate` green.","tree":{"sha":"5b00fddb0535928d0a5d48f0303b4b5177ac08a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/git/trees/5b00fddb0535928d0a5d48f0303b4b5177ac08a5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/git/commits/80bd25cfacbf15a7ad3400ea5387e0df4949b285","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/commit/80bd25cfacbf15a7ad3400ea5387e0df4949b285","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiIN9oAKDgwYmQyNWNmYWNiZjE1YTdhZDM0MDBlYTUzODdlMGRmNDk0OWIyODU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/commit/049ce480cd5adb22e10f2235c9b8d5b1c82588f4","sha":"049ce480cd5adb22e10f2235c9b8d5b1c82588f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/commits/049ce480cd5adb22e10f2235c9b8d5b1c82588f4"}],"sha":"80bd25cfacbf15a7ad3400ea5387e0df4949b285","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/commits/80bd25cfacbf15a7ad3400ea5387e0df4949b285"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/commits/049ce480cd5adb22e10f2235c9b8d5b1c82588f4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T14:29:52Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T15:09:43Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Create the Model Armor template the guardrail screens through\n\nThe service refuses to boot with the guardrail on and no template named, and\nthe serving edge passed it one from model_armor_template, a free-text input\nthat defaulted to empty while nothing in this stack created a template. An\napply had to name a template made by hand, outside Terraform, or set the\nguardrail off.\n\nmodel_armor.tf now creates it from the fleet''s template body (prompt-injection\nand jailbreak at LOW_AND_ABOVE, the RAI filters, partial invocations never\nreported complete, sanitize operations unlogged), in local.region, on the\ngoogle-beta provider declared for that one resource. The edge names this\nresource''s template_id whenever the guardrail is on, so the variable and its\nvalidation go. model_armor_full_capabilities (default true) declines the\nmalicious-URI filter and multi-language detection where the region refuses\nthem; the example states false for asia-southeast1.\n\nVerified: make tf-check (20 runs, two new) and make gate green.","tree":{"sha":"47d36218da3ce783cbec2a3bfb8c8d42931c6460","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/git/trees/47d36218da3ce783cbec2a3bfb8c8d42931c6460"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/git/commits/049ce480cd5adb22e10f2235c9b8d5b1c82588f4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/commit/049ce480cd5adb22e10f2235c9b8d5b1c82588f4","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiIN9oAKDA0OWNlNDgwY2Q1YWRiMjJlMTBmMjIzNWM5YjhkNWIxYzgyNTg4ZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/commit/75319027f16f545c5b040a77d7dee1e042a402d4","sha":"75319027f16f545c5b040a77d7dee1e042a402d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/commits/75319027f16f545c5b040a77d7dee1e042a402d4"}],"sha":"049ce480cd5adb22e10f2235c9b8d5b1c82588f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/commits/049ce480cd5adb22e10f2235c9b8d5b1c82588f4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/commits/75319027f16f545c5b040a77d7dee1e042a402d4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T14:33:54Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T14:45:47Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Bump next to 16.3.8: critical RCE in next/og (GHSA-vcvr-r3jv-pc5j)\n\nnext 16.2.0 to 16.3.5 carries a critical remote code execution in\nnext/og ImageResponse, and the gate''s npm audit (--audit-level=high) now\nfails every pull request on it. The pin moves to 16.3.8, the first release\npast the advisory''s range on this line, and `npm audit fix` takes\nbaseline-browser-mapping past GHSA-w5vr-8v7q-w6rv (moderate). Lock-only\nchange; npm audit reports no vulnerabilities.","tree":{"sha":"57a0f3ff0c231e9e53797f774f405735c74b9aa9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/git/trees/57a0f3ff0c231e9e53797f774f405735c74b9aa9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/git/commits/75319027f16f545c5b040a77d7dee1e042a402d4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/commit/75319027f16f545c5b040a77d7dee1e042a402d4","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiIN9oAKDc1MzE5MDI3ZjE2ZjU0NWM1YjA0MGE3N2Q3ZGVlMWUwNDJhNDAyZDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/commit/b65712fefc6fb496ee196739e02e03df38c929eb","sha":"b65712fefc6fb496ee196739e02e03df38c929eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/commits/b65712fefc6fb496ee196739e02e03df38c929eb"}],"sha":"75319027f16f545c5b040a77d7dee1e042a402d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/commits/75319027f16f545c5b040a77d7dee1e042a402d4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/commits/b65712fefc6fb496ee196739e02e03df38c929eb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T12:21:06Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T12:24:43Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Fail the Model Armor verdict closed: allow only NO_MATCH_FOUND with SUCCESS\n\nparse_sanitize_response allowed whenever filterMatchState was not MATCH_FOUND\nand, with the aggregate absent, whenever no filter reported a match. So\nFILTER_MATCH_STATE_UNSPECIFIED, an empty or missing sanitizationResult, and an\nincomplete screen (invocationResult PARTIAL or FAILURE, which arrive with\nNO_MATCH_FOUND because a skipped filter reports no match) were all allowed, and\ninvocationResult was never read. Padding a question past the prompt-injection\nfilter''s token limit would have been answered unscreened.\n\nThe verdict now allows only when filterMatchState is exactly NO_MATCH_FOUND,\ninvocationResult is exactly SUCCESS and no filter reports MATCH_FOUND. A match\nblocks however many filters ran; an incomplete screen, an unspecified or\nmissing decision, and any non-object body block with a reason that names what\nwas missing. The 30s deadline and raise_for_status are kept; the orchestrator\nalready refuses on any exception.\n\ntests/unit/test_model_armor_verdict_mapping.py proves it at two levels: an\nSDK-free half (IntEnum mirrors, REST JSON by name, a real httpx client over\nMockTransport for HTTP errors, timeouts and the deadline) that runs in the\noffline gate, and a real-SDK half that serialises modelarmor_v1 responses with\nthe SDK''s own to_json and pins the mirrors to the real enums, skipping where\ngoogle-cloud-modelarmor is absent. Against the old mapping 25 tests fail (24\nnew plus the updated empty-result assertion, which had pinned the fail-open\nbehaviour); with the fix all 75 pass with the SDK installed.","tree":{"sha":"d2ca93af0391edd6634b38c302b00e3cedcb56e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/git/trees/d2ca93af0391edd6634b38c302b00e3cedcb56e6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/git/commits/b65712fefc6fb496ee196739e02e03df38c929eb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","