in":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/commits/4016031ce284573e14026b80aa2f4b9b89992f18/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:40:57Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:44:40Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Correct docs that say the review router refuses at request time\n\nThe service now refuses to boot under the managed profile when review\nrouting is on and HUMAN_REVIEW_URL is unset, NL2SQL_REVIEW_ROUTING switches\nrouting, and a hand-off that fails at request time is reported as\nreview_routing \"failed\" and logged. Some documents still said the\nmanaged router refuses the escalation at request time rather than\nswallowing it, and .env.example named no switch. Routing off needs no console.\nDocumentation only; no practices-audit verdict changed.","tree":{"sha":"5f8dba6c0bc568bc1523c9857d69a278da20e08b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/git/trees/5f8dba6c0bc568bc1523c9857d69a278da20e08b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/git/commits/4016031ce284573e14026b80aa2f4b9b89992f18","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/commit/4016031ce284573e14026b80aa2f4b9b89992f18","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiIN9oAKDQwMTYwMzFjZTI4NDU3M2UxNDAyNmI4MGFhMmY0YjliODk5OTJmMTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/commit/a8c997b01ba3f91cb5e263a50a443bb4e4cdc306","sha":"a8c997b01ba3f91cb5e263a50a443bb4e4cdc306","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/commits/a8c997b01ba3f91cb5e263a50a443bb4e4cdc306"}],"sha":"4016031ce284573e14026b80aa2f4b9b89992f18","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/commits/4016031ce284573e14026b80aa2f4b9b89992f18"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/commits/a8c997b01ba3f91cb5e263a50a443bb4e4cdc306/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:26:34Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:28:50Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Correct the review-routing comments to the boot refusal\n\nThe variables.tf header and the review_url comment in settings.yaml still\nsaid the managed review router refuses to swallow an escalation when\nHUMAN_REVIEW_URL is empty. Since the runtime control switches landed that\nis false: the service refuses at BOOT when review routing is on and no console\nis named, and NL2SQL_REVIEW_ROUTING=false switches routing off, so\nhuman_review_url is only required with review_routing_enabled on.\n\nComment-only; no behaviour changes.","tree":{"sha":"9cabe554d6945211829517a6984a2cc8539ad2e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/git/trees/9cabe554d6945211829517a6984a2cc8539ad2e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/git/commits/a8c997b01ba3f91cb5e263a50a443bb4e4cdc306","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/commit/a8c997b01ba3f91cb5e263a50a443bb4e4cdc306","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiIN9oAKGE4Yzk5N2IwMWJhM2Y5MWNiNWUyNjNhNTBhNDQzYmI0ZTRjZGMzMDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/commit/29f378011d81a974d1177bab0e0ee74b4d602001","sha":"29f378011d81a974d1177bab0e0ee74b4d602001","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/commits/29f378011d81a974d1177bab0e0ee74b4d602001"}],"sha":"a8c997b01ba3f91cb5e263a50a443bb4e4cdc306","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/commits/a8c997b01ba3f91cb5e263a50a443bb4e4cdc306"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/commits/29f378011d81a974d1177bab0e0ee74b4d602001/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:06:11Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:12:28Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Wire the console to the real ask call\n\nThe console was the template''s generic case form: it posted {subject, text} to POST /v1/triage\n(ui/app/page.tsx:65). This service serves no /v1/triage; its one end-user action is POST /v1/ask\nwith AskRequest{question}, so every submit was a 404 and the console could never produce an\nanswer. It now posts {question} to /v1/ask with the seeded persona header, from a question box\nprefilled with \"What was total revenue by region?\", and offers the eval set''s certified,\nescalating and refused questions as examples. All three answer 200 on the local profile against\nits fictional warehouse. The tenant that scopes the rows still comes from the resolved\nprincipal, never from the body.\n\ntests/unit/test_console_matches_api.py reads every fetch(API + ...) in ui/app/ and holds it\nagainst the live route table: path and method served, every required field sent, no field the\nmodel silently drops. It failed against the old console (\"POST /v1/triage is not served\") and\npasses against this one.","tree":{"sha":"7ea4238f1f4da1fa7a171cde2715517b98b2d9dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/git/trees/7ea4238f1f4da1fa7a171cde2715517b98b2d9dd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/git/commits/29f378011d81a974d1177bab0e0ee74b4d602001","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/commit/29f378011d81a974d1177bab0e0ee74b4d602001","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiIN9oAKDI5ZjM3ODAxMWQ4MWE5NzRkMTE3N2JhYjBlMGVlNzRiNGQ2MDIwMDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/commit/c8d705ac5ceef191ca4d012bf377a96630a3c101","sha":"c8d705ac5ceef191ca4d012bf377a96630a3c101","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/commits/c8d705ac5ceef191ca4d012bf377a96630a3c101"}],"sha":"29f378011d81a974d1177bab0e0ee74b4d602001","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/commits/29f378011d81a974d1177bab0e0ee74b4d602001"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/commits/c8d705ac5ceef191ca4d012bf377a96630a3c101/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T10:39:32Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T10:41:55Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Type the Model Armor bearer token so the gcp type check passes\n\nlint-gcp, which sees google-auth''s types, flagged the token source: credentials.token is\nOptional there. A missing token now raises, which the orchestrator reads as an unavailable\nscreen and refuses, rather than sending an empty bearer.","tree":{"sha":"3685258687bd40663cc938a9f1b1bd5ab54604f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/git/trees/3685258687bd40663cc938a9f1b1bd5ab54604f8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/git/commits/c8d705ac5ceef191ca4d012bf377a96630a3c101","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/commit/c8d705ac5ceef191ca4d012bf377a96630a3c101","node_id":"C_kwDOUAiIN9oAKGM4ZDcwNWFjNWNlZWYxOTFjYTRkMDEyYmYzNzdhOTY2MzBhM2MxMDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/commit/fc0d6d4b39ec4cb84fb25731b2e0772e9bdfe3ca","sha":"fc0d6d4b39ec4cb84fb25731b2e0772e9bdfe3ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/commits/fc0d6d4b39ec4cb84fb25731b2e0772e9bdfe3ca"}],"sha":"c8d705ac5ceef191ca4d012bf377a96630a3c101","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/commits/c8d705ac5ceef191ca4d012bf377a96630a3c101"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/commits/fc0d6d4b39ec4cb84fb25731b2e0772e9bdfe3ca/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T10:36:41Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T10:41:55Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Make the managed guardrail a real Model Armor screen, and switch both controls\n\nApplies the fleet''s runtime-control contract (template shape). This service has two cheap\nruntime controls: the guardrail port and review routing.\n\n- The gcp guardrail was a stub that always raised. The orchestrator reads a raise as \"screen\n  unavailable\" and refuses, so under gcp every question would have been refused while the\n  control looked on. CloudGuardrailAdapter now screens each question through Model Armor''s\n  regional :sanitizeUserPrompt, over the REST API with httpx and google-auth (both already in\n  the gcp lock, as in compliance-advisory''s adapter; no lockfile change), and blocks on a match.\n  Matches are compared exactly: NO_MATCH_FOUND contains MATCH_FOUND as a substring. Unit tests\n  drive it through a fake client; a live-template integration test is added and skips without\n  configuration, so the operation stays in INCOMPLETE_MANAGED_OPERATIONS until it runs green.\n- NL2SQL_GUARDRAIL and NL2SQL_REVIEW_ROUTING are read once at settings load in three states.\n  Off binds an allow-all guardrail (reason \"guardrail off\") or a router that submits nothing,\n  and one warning per process names what is off.\n- Under gcp, the guardrail on with no NL2SQL_MODEL_ARMOR_TEMPLATE or GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT, or\n  routing on with no HUMAN_REVIEW_URL, refuses at boot.\n- The API, the ask_question agent tool and the CLI hand off through a recording wrapper, so a\n  failed hand-off no longer fails an answered, audited question: the result carries\n  review_routing (routed, failed, off, not_required) and the failure is logged. The console\n  states it in plain words.\n- Terraform gains guardrail_enabled, model_armor_template and review_routing_enabled, states\n  both switches and the template to the service, requires a template while the guardrail is on\n  and a console while routing is on, grants roles/modelarmor.user only while the guardrail is\n  on, and enables the Model Armor API. Plan tests hold it.\n- The model card, security, features, portability and compliance FAQs, ADOPTING, SPEC,\n  COMPLIANCE and the practices audit no longer describe the guardrail as a gateway stub or the\n  router as refusing at request time; the runbook gains both switches. Rule R1''s\n  agent-guardrail-gateway binding is still recorded as outstanding.","tree":{"sha":"69785990abc637bad4c542663933a30461d44e24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/git/trees/69785990abc637bad4c542663933a30461d44e24"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/nl2sql-analytics/git/commits/fc0d6d4b39ec4cb84fb25731b2e0772e9bdfe3ca","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url