replaces ProvenanceBanner.tsx in layout.tsx: the\n  configured generator_model from /healthz, dashed, until an answer names the\n  model that answered; Search only while that answer searched. One\n  window.fetch wrapper (lib/answer-provenance.mjs, node-tested) reads both\n  headers, and the proxy route forwards them. The banner and its CSS are gone.\n  Unlike the template, the pills carry no dark-scheme override: this page\n  renders light in both schemes, and the override inverted the pills there.\n- config.py: the hard-reasoning branch is deleted from the model resolver, so\n  no flag can name a model no adapter calls.\n- CONTRIBUTING row 5c: a new model port notes what answered and samples per\n  call.\n- tests: test_answer_provenance.py, the pills contract in test_ui_surface.py,\n  and the service-half banner test renamed to test_model_pill_contract.py.","tree":{"sha":"a1bedc108ffb7ddc343cd69faa29b2eeb7c23040","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hr-policy-answers/git/trees/a1bedc108ffb7ddc343cd69faa29b2eeb7c23040"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hr-policy-answers/git/commits/65c4ea9688af73f1bd58bdada3780ed888eb8621","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repo