{"author":{"account":{"login":"claudioed","providerType":"User"},"email":"claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira"},"authoredDate":"2026-09-27T00:32:12Z","committedDate":"2026-09-27T00:32:12Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"web-flow","providerType":"User"},"email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:20:16.948Z","repositoryId":1342751044,"sha":"db4c023344f653b3508643de30ba2ab978b961b9"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"claudioed","providerType":"User"},"email":"claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira"},"authoredDate":"2026-09-26T23:23:45Z","committedDate":"2026-09-26T23:23:45Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"web-flow","providerType":"User"},"email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:20:16.948Z","repositoryId":1342751044,"sha":"43c6ce673406002173bbea05962b7314430d6709"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:20:16.948Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4073304?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claudioed","id":4073304,"login":"claudioed","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzMzMDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/wes-work-planning/commits/f3d86d1452cfc7c37dcc9367710f23c5e72e6947/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T09:28:51Z","email":"claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T09:28:51Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: bound lineNo / line_no to 1..2147483647 (REST, domain, OpenAPI, AsyncAPI) (#161)\n\nEvery line_no column is a 32-bit INTEGER but only the lower bound (>= 1)\nwas enforced, so 2147483648 was accepted at the edge and failed at the\ndatabase (\"integer out of range\" -> 500, or retry + DLQ on the consumer).\n\n- domain: workunit.MaxLineNo + ValidateLineNo (0 unknown, 1..MaxInt32).\n- REST: POST /paths/{pathId}/work-units rejects lineNo > 2147483647 with\n  the existing 400 invalid-line-no; the problem detail states the range.\n- EnqueueWorkUnit uses ValidateLineNo.\n- ApplyOrderAllocated: like a negative line_no today, an out-of-range\n  line_no is stored as unknown (0); the id is still built from the number\n  as sent; the event is never rejected or dead-lettered.\n- postgres: lineNoToColumn writes NULL for an out-of-range value\n  (backstop; never binds a value the INTEGER column cannot hold).\n- openapi.yaml lineNo and asyncapi.yaml WorkReleased line_no (integration\n  + analytics): format int32, maximum 2147483647.","tree":{"sha":"2f83f775310481f41ed2132608e163349c4fa52d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/wes-work-planning/git/trees/2f83f775310481f41ed2132608e163349c4fa52d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/wes-work-planning/git/commits/f3d86d1452cfc7c37dcc9367710f23c5e72e6947","verification":{"payload":"tree 2f83f775310481f41ed2132608e163349c4fa52d\nparent c1aaee55a9cd2337a502f94e4d78ca28fdb2191c\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1791451731 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791451731 -0300\n\nfix: bound lineNo / line_no to 1..2147483647 (REST, domain, OpenAPI, AsyncAPI) (#161)\n\nEvery line_no column is a 32-bit INTEGER but only the lower bound (>= 1)\nwas enforced, so 2147483648 was accepted at the edge and failed at the\ndatabase (\"integer out of range\" -> 500, or retry + DLQ on the consumer).\n\n- domain: workunit.MaxLineNo + ValidateLineNo (0 unknown, 1..MaxInt32).\n- REST: POST /paths/{pathId}/work-units rejects lineNo > 2147483647 with\n  the existing 400 invalid-line-no; the problem detail states the range.\n- EnqueueWorkUnit uses ValidateLineNo.\n- ApplyOrderAllocated: like a negative line_no today, an out-of-range\n  line_no is stored as unknown (0); the id is still built from the number\n  as sent; the event is never rejected or dead-lettered.\n- postgres: lineNoToColumn writes NULL for an out-of-range value\n  (backstop; never binds a value the INTEGER column cannot hold).\n- openapi.yaml lineNo and asyncapi.yaml WorkReleased line_no (integration\n  + analytics): format int32, maximum 2147483647.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqx2JTCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAetUQALIgIW0KEkp1KN5g6wXfM/LW\ndn/Qydj2fSNcMrwRmzO9EYT3K7qiaPi3Mc1SEEjJ2hawR/kk2AJaA/D2vypcX6Tm\nID0LYQd49IMK+41O98YTNIw9kbw1VOtFZDRbXhirX6x4bD8eTH40BZyyqgJz4utl\nWvT0l6bwyay2aSNVsyacGFXLUgw1vH9OOgpJPaovYXWRHzwZoQsgO9jpFHg1GOxY\n0tt+iQCBw/UxY6NR6Ozfvj38bFFs1Z0mODdECxxMIfoNFT2IWfUlmrF4hJp3vhmA\nAJqhGZrPwkvpMtEE0UMBa4Nv5uU/Vc2CPnyHDvpyneExhJDp5De1AqYTDZKGXmq+\noOJBTIpZe/UI7aSDawpvR2M4FI/6uV4SCvW/6UFfuAj26eJ1pr+paWOP8KBBZlwL\niIUyx4cgLURF1Cr87uTP7N1TP2UI41d9IojtzH6EEQfIQrn8NLhofhiVkHtKthIx\nLwDGpbu3XCaFY3hR5XVicDOrGG8VEvWSQ/ZsW/r80VB5uShbWzCAYscv0JyBmgey\naSSJuPPhgzbr2BXVdwA3XaXhn+ynL+gwjHzYo1sFOrFnnHyRfBgAZegM7qhv85/V\nYRpqaRtCBLDGkdny+kr0F86e58XbdV8chezrwkGbVeAO4bSJpCjjsgFFpfa/pqRE\nr68VRkzGN/9hf+YMZQfM\n=IulA\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-08T09:28:52Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow