e2b6846bad175493b7d35158d438d3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T00:48:13Z","email":"claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T00:48:13Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: WorkUnit stores line_no; WorkReleased carries it (per-line confirm-pick, decision 18) (#157)\n\n* feat: WorkUnit stores line_no; WorkReleased carries it (decision 18)\n\nPer-line confirm-pick, hops 3-4. All additive and optional.\n\n- WorkUnit gets an optional line_no (0 = unknown); EnqueueWorkUnitRequest\n  gets LineNo and ApplyOrderAllocated passes OrderAllocatedLine.LineNo.\n  The \"<order>-line-<n>\" id is unchanged.\n- Migration 0013: nullable work_units.line_no; unknown is stored as NULL.\n  Postgres and memory repos round-trip it.\n- REST POST /paths/{pathId}/work-units accepts an optional lineNo (>= 1,\n  400 invalid-line-no otherwise) and the work-unit response echoes it.\n- WorkReleased v1 data (integration AND analytics topics) gains an\n  optional line_no read off the work unit at encode time, omitted when\n  unknown. The analytics publisher gets WithWorkUnits for that read.\n- New goldens for a unit with a line; the existing goldens are untouched.\n\n* docs: ADR-0036, openapi/asyncapi line_no, docs pack (decision 18)\n\n- ADR-0036 (+ index, sidebar): WorkUnit stores line_no; WorkReleased v1\n  carries it on both topics.\n- apis/openapi.yaml: optional lineNo on EnqueueWorkUnitRequest and\n  WorkUnitResponse; regenerated docs/docs/api/rest exactly like the\n  docs-api-drift job.\n- apis/asyncapi.yaml: optional line_no on both WorkReleased schemas, with\n  examples; validated with the asyncapi CLI (0 errors) and spectral.\n- docs/docs/ddd/*, api/events, api/errors (invalid-line-no), ecosystem and\n  ubiquitous language updated; Mermaid validated.","tree":{"sha":"110c434c5b1ad067ff2b449bfa5a7e82b914d172","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/wes-work-planning/git/trees/110c434c5b1ad067ff2b449bfa5a7e82b914d172"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/wes-work-planning/git/commits/f78d2663f4e2b6846bad175493b7d35158d438d3","verification":{"payload":"tree 110c434c5b1ad067ff2b449bfa5a7e82b914d172\nparent 933ecfdb8859a4411430810d7f8abfdc4f71403a\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1791420493 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791420493 -0300\n\nfeat: WorkUnit stores line_no; WorkReleased carries it (per-line confirm-pick, decision 18) (#157)\n\n* feat: WorkUnit stores line_no; WorkReleased carries it (decision 18)\n\nPer-line confirm-pick, hops 3-4. All additive and optional.\n\n- WorkUnit gets an optional line_no (0 = unknown); EnqueueWorkUnitRequest\n  gets LineNo and ApplyOrderAllocated passes OrderAllocatedLine.LineNo.\n  The \"<order>-line-<n>\" id is unchanged.\n- Migration 0013: nullable work_units.line_no; unknown is stored as NULL.\n  Postgres and memory repos round-trip it.\n- REST POST /paths/{pathId}/work-units accepts an optional lineNo (>= 1,\n  400 invalid-line-no otherwise) and the work-unit response echoes it.\n- WorkReleased v1 data (integration AND analytics topics) gains an\n  optional line_no read off the work unit at encode time, omitted when\n  unknown. The analytics publisher gets WithWorkUnits for that read.\n- New goldens for a unit with a line; the existing goldens are untouched.\n\n* docs: ADR-0036, openapi/asyncapi line_no, docs pack (decision 18)\n\n- ADR-0036 (+ index, sidebar): WorkUnit stores line_no; WorkReleased v1\n  carries it on both topics.\n- apis/openapi.yaml: optional lineNo on EnqueueWorkUnitRequest and\n  WorkUnitResponse; regenerated docs/docs/api/rest exactly like the\n  docs-api-drift job.\n- apis/asyncapi.yaml: optional line_no on both WorkReleased schemas, with\n  examples; validated with the asyncapi CLI (0 errors) and spectral.\n- docs/docs/ddd/*, api/events, api/errors (invalid-line-no), ecosystem and\n  ubiquitous language updated; Mermaid validated.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxuhNCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAABr4QAJJaRrdTHwO6Whp5HywfB/KR\nrPWDpjVD73Z1JLDVZqQiTQV/sFx4sp+Q7pNegjV/7qUvX0p7xcROyDry/es+dCS0\nuhDw6XE15Q3UefDXCJj+83O6JswpDaUr+ke+3GuPdksCTZMqOTCTWm2StCsnDI6J\nvCMRE5O89SIPtvh5AijAErW2+2GnCbwL0vDTAt9KGGUOuVU5ZbznPfZ9yeOHbC59\nUXisGGoeuoS1BQXeeOpYwRZl8eVtkjLCdVW7KJ/Fh6vrHuFo8Ou0XJriPYHWisDe\nPUfC2zPQnCvFS82l6S2AXfVEdesX8zYEUTmZSnNVKfEoTaZ7xuN2nsLZ0py+MXWc\nIN+X4LWqkIJ1VOx6AvHjxQAeamSNDZyB58GOuTdDRfwmO+CISDUQOqVcHBv2cBHC\n6QUdBGwb5KXxgn5IOnVbopsfjBGn/pJHga33AeguCY40qzuJCDoiFM27Z5sorTgY\nImLiKh/7CjPLlIrhZvMpLL20TO5+8NippPxLb+3NHHu58UYAwywsCfpdry68EmWy\ncjszj0Gaehew0fdPXw9SVseFmCL7rWaPj7clwEBbD7IZQfI5bVGygAlBOZ9U9Xcm\nZdb/zfdsGI7pAJMDdk6j/R+W7eY5vt3bARVE/dOkRG/X/TRoanbdLRSAnWCAlzgi\ndO1hquvKQCXpkwzprhwk\n=pwjD\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-08T00:48:14Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/IQVO/wes-work-planning/commit/f78d2663f4e2b6846bad175493b7d35158d438d3","node_id":"C_kwDOUAjBRNoAKGY3OGQyN