claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"claudioed"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T03:00:14Z","email":"claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"claudioed"},"message":"docs: asyncapi, rules and docs for the product-master classification copy (ADR-0035)\n\n- apis/asyncapi.yaml: consumed channel warehouse.product-master.events,\n  operation consumeProductClassified, ProductClassified message and\n  ProductClassifiedEvent schema mirrored read-only from product-master''s\n  contract; WorkReleased hint descriptions now name the local copy.\n- README, .claude/rules (architecture, domain-model, integration-events)\n  and the Docusaurus pages (context map, ecosystem, canvases, ER, read\n  models, sequence/message-flow diagrams, events, running locally) drop\n  the inventory-storage REST lookup and INVENTORY_STORAGE_BASE_URL and\n  describe PRODUCT_CLASSIFICATION_MODE=kafka|permissive plus\n  PRODUCT_CLASSIFICATION_CONSUMER_GROUP.\n- ADR-0023 / ADR-0027: status/consumer-list notes pointing at ADR-0035.\n- chart values: comment on the second stable consumer group; no env\n  change (the chart keeps the permissive default).","tree":{"sha":"efe39b3d21af441b515635006cae2e770cc0b86a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/wes-work-planning/git/trees/efe39b3d21af441b515635006cae2e770cc0b86a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/wes-work-planning/git/commits/272ab6e794cca7848b4e998e3c56a0c6e4e4a605","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4073304?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claudioed","id":4073304,"login":"claudioed","node_id"