ioed/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claudioed","id":4073304,"login":"claudioed","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzMzMDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/wes-work-planning/commits/3f346f6dcf24321943a00a2d9fda6ece39b5d674/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T01:58:45Z","email":"claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"claudioed"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T01:58:45Z","email":"claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"claudioed"},"message":"feat(kafka): ProductClassified consumer feeding the local copy (ADR-0035)\n\nDedicated inbound consumer of warehouse.product-master.events under a\ncaller-supplied stable group (cmd reads PRODUCT_CLASSIFICATION_CONSUMER_GROUP).\nDispatches on the full type com.warehouse.wms.product-master.product.\nProductClassified only; invalid CloudEvents and invalid payloads (no sku,\nversion < 1, DOT class outside 1..9, undecodable data) are WARN-skipped and\ncommitted; transient failures retry the same message with capped backoff and\nthe offset is committed only after success (FetchMessage + CommitMessages).\n\nUnit tests with a fake reader: apply, stale version ignored, unknown and\nsuffix-matching types ignored, poison skipped with WARN, transient retry\ncommits exactly once after the effect, stop mid-retry commits nothing.","tree":{"sha":"8e5b8ceb57f22af93163d6aa77c3d20846063f07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/wes-work-planning/g