O/wes-work-planning/commits/4aa085df56c70d400bbb9e051775213a51659ea6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4073304?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claudioed","id":4073304,"login":"claudioed","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzMzMDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/wes-work-planning/commits/8c79c520bb9a444d023ee89488e3fdf44efdbe75/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T12:17:09Z","email":"claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T12:17:09Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: resolve findings from the 2026-10-05 docs audit (#148)\n\n* fix: persist PathPlan travel-distance hint (ADR-0017)\n\nshift_plans had no column for the hint stamped on PathPlan at commit time\nand postgres.PlanRepo dropped it, so a reloaded plan always reported\nTravelDistanceKnown()==false. Add nullable travel_distance_m /\ntravel_distance_estimated columns (migration 0010, additive) and round-trip\nthem in PlanRepo; NULL travel_distance_m means \"no hint\" so 0 m stays valid.\nDocs: ER diagram, eventstorming hotspot, bounded-context canvas, overview.\n\n* docs: document GET /readyz in openapi and fix contact URL\n\nGET /readyz was routed (router.go, 200 ready / 503 not_ready on shutdown)\nbut missing from apis/openapi.yaml; info.contact.url pointed at the old\ngithub.com/claudioed org. Add the operation (tag Health), point contact at\nIQVO, correct the README claim that /readyz is not in the spec, add a\nhandler test pinning both response shapes, and regenerate the docs API\nreference (clean-api-docs + gen-api-docs, as the docs-api-drift job does).","tree":{"sha":"306d1c5e17e53ee1fdac9be7c30636b69533f517","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/wes-work-planning/git/trees/306d1c5e17e53ee1fdac9be7c30636b69533f517"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/wes-work-planning/git/commits/8c79c520bb9a444d023ee89488e3fdf44efdbe75","verification":{"payload":"tree 306d1c5e17e53ee1fdac9be7c30636b69533f517\nparent 697edc79266d1cb11ebb25b980cca0089dcba320\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1791289029 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791289029 -0300\n\nfix: resolve findings from the 2026-10-05 docs audit (#148)\n\n* fix: persist PathPlan travel-distance hint (ADR-0017)\n\nshift_plans had no column for the hint stamped on PathPlan at commit time\nand postgres.PlanRepo dropped it, so a reloaded plan always reported\nTravelDistanceKnown()==false. Add nullable travel_distance_m /\ntravel_distance_estimated columns (migration 0010, additive) and round-trip\nthem in PlanRepo; NULL travel_distance_m means \"no hint\" so 0 m stays valid.\nDocs: ER diagram, eventstorming hotspot, bounded-context canvas, overview.\n\n* docs: document GET /readyz in openapi and fix contact URL\n\nGET /readyz was routed (router.go, 200 ready / 503 not_ready on shutdown)\nbut missing from apis/openapi.yaml; info.contact.url pointed at the old\ngithub.com/claudioed org. Add the operation (tag Health), point contact at\nIQVO, correct the README claim that /readyz is not in the spec, add a\nhandler test pinning both response shapes, and regenerate th