now returns a wrapped ''rehydrate work unit'' error for an unknown stored state instead of silently loading it as Pending.\n\n* fix(release): validate persisted work pool mode and entry state on rehydrate\n\nAdd release.ParseFeedMode / ParseEntryState (+ FeedMode.String, ErrUnknownFeedMode, ErrUnknownEntryState). FindByPathId no longer defaults an unknown mode to ReleaseFed or an unknown entry state to pending; both return a wrapped rehydrate error. Integration tests insert corrupt rows and prove every legitimate persisted value still loads.","tree":{"sha":"f6f90cd5563c3cfcac0f11a2ecc143c3ae4eaae0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/wes-work-planning/git/trees/f6f90cd5563c3cfcac0f11a2ecc143c3ae4eaae0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/wes-work-planning/git/commits/12d75dc8af6e8206ae91b6a9d8aa8451d52fec64","verification":{"payload":"tree f6f90cd5563c3cfcac0f11a2ecc143c3ae4eaae0\nparent 69739fc5758a7697feb1149af24b0494fb555597\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1791283560 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791283560 -0300\n\nfix: validate persisted status/state strings on rehydrate (#146)\n\n* fix(workunit): validate persisted work unit state on rehydrate\n\nAdd workunit.ParseState + ErrUnknownState; scanWorkUnit now returns a wrapped ''rehydrate work unit'' error for an unknown stored state instead of silently loading it as Pending.\n\n* fix(release): validate persisted work pool mode and entry state on rehydrate\n\nAdd release.ParseFeedMode / ParseEntryState (+ FeedMode.String, ErrUnknownFeedMode, ErrUnknownEntryState). FindByPathId no longer defaults an unknown mode to ReleaseFed or an unknown entry state to pending; both return a wrapped rehydrate error. Integration tests insert corrupt rows and prove every legitimate persisted value still loads.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxNFoCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAZcAQAB0EU1i/AyCU55vxDPmKmoKN\naqIlQnsPno+FhUbA1e5h9bLhGCc5CH9n2h