28ddf6d48/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T02:51:56Z","email":"claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T02:51:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: refresh product docs and add ddd-crew DDD artifact pack (#143)\n\n* docs: refresh README and .claude rules against develop\n\n- README: IQVO docs-site URL, eleven domain events, 32 ADRs,\n  MIGRATIONS_DATABASE_URL, GET /readyz, WorkReleased gift_wrap,\n  PathPlanDriftDetected, network-fulfillment as a PathCapacityChanged\n  consumer, ADR-0028 idempotency via the inbound-event use cases,\n  path.id metric attribute, BDD feature list.\n- .claude/rules: ADR index 0001-0032 with 0030-0032 and status notes,\n  PathPlanDriftDetected and its triggers, network-fulfillment consumer,\n  11 AsyncAPI messages, /readyz, full use-case list.\n\n* docs: refresh overview, API, ecosystem and ADR index pages\n\n- overview: 32 ADRs, inbound-event use cases, CommitShiftPlan travel\n  hint and ADR-0019 drift reconciliation, completion frees the WIP slot,\n  ports table (ReleaseMetrics, ProcessedEventReleaser), full CI job list,\n  Idempotency-Key note for Postgres mode, bracket-form admonition.\n- api: IQVO links, /readyz is routed but not in openapi.yaml, eleven\n  events incl. pathplan.PathPlanDriftDetected, WorkReleased gift_wrap,\n  ApplyTaskCompleted/ApplyOrderAllocated effects, DLQ after 3 handler\n  attempts, missing problem types (reference-required, unknown-path-id,\n  planned-throughput-not-finite, concurrent-modification).\n- ecosystem: network-fulfillment consumes PathCapacityChanged; drift\n  reconciliation on ShiftPlanCommitted; OrderAllocated catalogue check;\n  no HTML entities in Mermaid.\n- adr/index: 0012 amended by 0030. analytics: two more ignored types.\n\n* docs(ddd): add ddd-crew artifact pack and UML/ER/sequence diagrams\n\nNew pages under docs/docs/ddd, wired into sidebars.ts under a\n\"DDD artifacts (ddd-crew)\" category:\n- ddd-artifacts (pack index + sources of truth)\n- core-domain-chart (quadrantChart, evidence, evolution)\n- bounded-context-canvas (v5, every inbound/outbound message)\n- aggregate-design-canvas (v1.1, four roots; replaces\n  aggregates-and-invariants, which is removed and its links fixed)\n- domain-message-flow (4 scenarios), eventstorming (3 processes)\n- class-diagram, entity-relationship, sequence-diagrams (9 use cases)\n\nRefreshed in place: ddd/index, ddd/domain-events (full CE types, keys,\nconsumers, consumed events), ddd/read-models (drift columns),\nddd/context-relationships (network-fulfillment, CloudEvents package),\nddd/subdomain-classification, ecosystem/context-map (ddd-crew format\nwith U/D, patterns, evidence, live vs absent), business-context/\nubiquitous-language (code identifier per term), and the homepage\nfeature link. Mermaid: no HTML entities.\n\n* docs: fix broken order-management anchor in sibling-services\n\nLink the real heading anchor of the warehouse.order-management.events\nsection in integration-events; it was the only broken-anchor warning\nin npm run build.\n\n* docs: fix pre-existing broken Mermaid diagram and stale Pages link\n\nReview follow-up on the DDD artifact pack PR:\n- inventory-storage: ecosystem/integration.md sequence diagram used '';''\n  inside a message, which Mermaid parses as a statement separator (the\n  diagram rendered as an error box on the published page).\n- wes-work-planning: docs/README.md pointed at the old claudioed.github.io\n  Pages URL; the site lives at iqvo.github.io since the org move.\n\n* docs(claude): refresh stale counts in CLAUDE.md\n\nADR count 29 -> 32, domain events ten -> eleven, use-case description,\nanalytics topic name warehouse.wes.analytics. AGENTS.md stays a symlink.","tree":{"sha":"9b7ef3ddc531051723af08256527f7aaec8c6241","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/wes-work-planning/git/trees/9b7ef3ddc531051723af08256527f7aaec8c6241"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/wes-work-planning/git/commits/4afb030b664f155c3835c0de6594f1228ddf6d48","verification":{"payload":"tree 9b7ef3ddc531051723af08256527f7aaec8c6241\nparent 7b2a29bd3d91cd54ee9970a3c78656d85a5d85a7\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1791255116 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791255116 -0300\n\ndocs: refresh product docs and add ddd-crew DDD artifact pack (#143)\n\n* docs: refresh README and .claude rules against develop\n\n- README: IQVO docs-site URL, eleven domain events, 32 ADRs,\n  MIGRATIONS_DATABASE_URL, GET /readyz, WorkReleased gift_wrap,\n  PathPlanDriftDetected, network-fulfillment as a PathCapacityChanged\n  consumer, ADR-0028 idempotency via the inbound-event use cases,\n  path.id metric attribute, BDD feature list.\n- .claude/rules: ADR index 0001-0032 with 0030-0032 and status notes,\n  PathPlanDriftDetected and its triggers, network-fulfillment consumer,\n  11 AsyncAPI messages, /readyz, full use-case list.\n\n* docs: refresh overview, API, ecosystem and ADR index pages\n\n- overview: 32 ADRs, inbound-event use cases, CommitShiftPlan travel\n  hint and ADR-0019 drift reconciliation, completion frees the WIP slot,\n  ports table (ReleaseMetrics, ProcessedEventReleaser), full CI job list,\n  Idempotency-Key note for Postgres mode, bracket-form admonition.\n- api: IQVO links, /readyz is routed but not in openapi.yaml, eleven\n  events incl. pathplan.PathPlanDriftDetected, WorkReleased gift_wrap,\n  ApplyTaskCompleted/ApplyOrderAllocated effects, DLQ after 3 handler\n  attempts, missing problem types (reference-required, unknown-path-id,\n  planned-throughput-not-finite, concurrent-modification).\n- ecosystem: network-fulfillment consumes PathCapacityChanged; drift\n  reconciliation on ShiftPlanCommitted; OrderAllocated catalogue check;\n  no HTML entities in Mermaid.\n- adr/index: 0012 amended by 0030. analytics: two more ignored types.\n\n* docs(ddd): add ddd-crew artifact pack and UML/ER/sequence diagrams\n\nNew pages under docs/docs/ddd, wired into sidebars.ts under a\n\"DDD artifacts (ddd-crew)\" category:\n- ddd-artifacts (pack index + sources of truth)\n- core-domain-chart (quadrantChart, evidence, evolution)\n- bounded-context-canvas (v5, every inbound/outbound message)\n- aggregate-design-canvas (v1.1, four roots; replaces\n  aggregates-and-invariants, which is removed and its links fixed)\n- domain-message-flow (4 scenarios), eventstorming (3 processes)\n- class-diagram, entity-relationship, sequence-diagrams (9 use cases)\n\nRefreshed in place: ddd/index, ddd/domain-events (full CE types, keys,\nconsumers, consumed events), ddd/read-models (drift columns),\nddd/context-relationships (network-fulfillment, CloudEvents package),\nddd/subdomain-classification, ecosystem/context-map (ddd-crew format\nwith U/D, patterns, evidence, live vs absent), business-context/\nubiquitous-language (code identifier per term), and the homepage\nfeature link. Mermaid: no HTML entities.\n\n* docs: fix broken order-management anchor in sibling-services\n\nLink the real heading anchor of the warehouse.order-management.events\nsection in integration-events; it was the only broken-anchor warning\nin npm run build.\n\n* docs: fix pre-existing broken Mermaid diagram and stale Pages link\n\nReview follow-up on the DDD artifact pack PR:\n- inventory-storage: ecosystem/integration.md sequence diagram used '';''\n  inside a message, which Mermaid parses as a statement separator (the\n  diagram rendered as an error box on the published page).\n- wes-work-planning: docs/README.md pointed at the old claudioed.github.io\n  Pages URL; the site lives at iqvo.github.io since the org move.\n\n* docs(claude): refresh stale counts in CLAUDE.md\n\nADR count 29 -> 32, domain events ten -> eleven, use-case description,\nanalytics topic name warehouse.wes.analytics. AGENTS.md stays a symlink.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxGJMCRC1aQ7uu5Uhl