es.\nDrop the CI integration job''s Postgres service + migrate step (job name\nkept for the required status check) and the Makefile DATABASE_URL warning.\n\n* test(arch): sensor requiring Postgres integration tests to use testcontainers\n\nTestPostgresIntegrationTestsUseTestcontainers mirrors the Kafka rule and a\nbad-fixture test proves it fails on env gates, DB-env t.Skip, and pgx use\nwithout a testcontainers postgres import.\n\n* docs: integration tests need only Docker (no DATABASE_URL)","tree":{"sha":"f1d4a7a48ad551e99e5722d5e5beb4ade10c856a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/wes-work-planning/git/trees/f1d4a7a48ad551e99e5722d5e5beb4ade10c856a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/wes-work-planning/git/commits/7b2a29bd3d91cd54ee9970a3c78656d85a5d85a7","verification":{"payload":"tree f1d4a7a48ad551e99e5722d5e5beb4ade10c856a\nparent c4f38eea709fbc8aeabcdcd0e46e590c02087e64\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1791248981 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791248981 -0300\n\ntest: Postgres integration tests on testcontainers + sensor (Tier-1 audit) (#141)\n\n* test: boot Postgres via testcontainers in env-gated integration tests\n\nConvert integration_test, work_pool_version, tracing and analyticsstore\nintegration tests off DATABASE_URL/ANALYTICS_DATABASE_URL t.Skip gates.\nDrop the CI integration job''s Postgres service + migrate step (job name\nkept for the required status check) and the Makefile DATABASE_URL warning.\n\n* test(arch): sensor requiring Postgres integration tests to use testcontainers\n\nTestPostgresIntegrationTestsUseTestcontainers mirrors the Kafka rule and a\nbad-fixture test proves it fails on env gates, DB-env t.Skip, and pgx use\nwithout a testcontainers postgres import.\n\n* docs: integration tests need only Docker (no DATABASE_URL)","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxEpVCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAugUQAGbcO2QMJz4uWw4a4msumfUa\n1W064Ivr6uRoIHkj2Xm6Ari9oet