eira@gmail.com","name":"Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T01:40:34Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ci(complexity): enforce gocyclo/gocognit/cyclop/funlen/nestif gate, refactor all violations (#108)\n\nEnable the five complexity linters in .golangci.yml (gocyclo 15, gocognit 20,\ncyclop 15 / package-average 10, funlen 80 lines/50 statements, nestif 5;\n_test.go exempt from funlen/gocyclo, web/ exempt from all five) and add a\ndedicated `complexity` CI job (golangci-lint --enable-only + gocyclo report\nin the step summary, gated into docker-publish). Refactor every\npre-existing violation with zero behavior change: table-driven problem\ncatalogs, split wiring/relay/policy functions, named test helpers instead\nof t.Run closures. golangci-lint, go build/vet, go test ./... all green.","tree":{"sha":"c04d91fa07f847ea0a6873129090c7275eec3221","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/wes-work-planning/git/trees/c04d91fa07f847ea0a6873129090c7275eec3221"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/wes-work-planning/git/commits/04e11aad7bb013b473e87609749740ac7189dca1","verification":{"payload":"tree c04d91fa07f847ea0a6873129090c7275eec3221\nparent af8044390200ffe860d1a1186ee0e646dd3579c5\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1790559634 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790559634 -0300\n\nci(complexity): enforce gocyclo/gocognit/cyclop/funlen/nestif gate, refactor all violations (#108)\n\nEnable the five complexity linters in .golangci.yml (gocyclo 15, gocognit 20,\ncyclop 15 / package-average 10, funlen 80 lines/50 statements, nestif 5;\n_test.go exempt from funlen/gocyclo, web/ exempt from all five) and add a\ndedicated `complexity` CI job (golangci-lint --enable-only + gocyclo report\nin the step summary, gated into docker-publish). Refactor every\npre-existing violation with zero behavior change: table-driven problem\ncatalogs, split wiring/relay/policy function