eLFg\np97RdNd4HFTLpJH7z5zd\n=sRkP\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T02:48:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/IQVO/inventory-storage/commit/9759217f62ae585d997cf8c8600b046695054c0f","node_id":"C_kwDOUAjBuNoAKDk3NTkyMTdmNjJhZTU4NWQ5OTdjZjhjODYwMGIwNDY2OTUwNTRjMGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/IQVO/inventory-storage/commit/0b825332ff2bfb9a915d42b86d23dcd00fca452b","sha":"0b825332ff2bfb9a915d42b86d23dcd00fca452b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/inventory-storage/commits/0b825332ff2bfb9a915d42b86d23dcd00fca452b"}],"sha":"9759217f62ae585d997cf8c8600b046695054c0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/inventory-storage/commits/9759217f62ae585d997cf8c8600b046695054c0f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4073304?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claudioed","id":4073304,"login":"claudioed","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzMzMDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/inventory-storage/commits/0b825332ff2bfb9a915d42b86d23dcd00fca452b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T02:40:46Z","email":"claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T02:40:46Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test: share one cold-broker-safe Kafka testcontainer helper across all integration tests (#153)\n\n* test: share one cold-broker-safe Kafka testcontainer helper across all integration tests\n\nAdd internal/testsupport/kafkatc (integration-tagged, test-only): Start boots\nconfluentinc/confluent-local:7.6.1 via testcontainers and returns only once\nthe group coordinator answers FindCoordinator, so a cold broker''s [15]\nGroupCoordinatorNotAvailable (kafka-go then sleeps a fixed 5 s JoinGroupBackoff\nper attempt) can no longer eat a test''s wait window.\n\nUse it from facilitycache, outbound/kafka (publisher + analytics partition)\nand usecases (transfer allocation/receipt); delete the local\nwaitForGroupCoordinator copy from PR #146 and the blank tckafka imports that\nonly existed to satisfy the fitness rule.\n\nFitness rule TestKafkaIntegrationTestsUseTestcontainers now requires the\nshared helper (file or sibling) and forbids starting the testcontainers Kafka\nmodule directly; detector test added.\n\n* test: make the transfer receipt tests -count-safe and the helper''s warm-up hermetic\n\ntransfer_receipt_integration_test.go seeded fixed ids (tl-recv-1, SKU-RECV,\nBIN-RB2, ...) into the Postgres/Kafka shared by the whole test binary and\nasserted GLOBAL outbox counts, so the second -count iteration failed with\n\"seed allocation save: transfer line already decided\". Every test now suffixes\nits transfer/line/SKU/site/bin ids per invocation, outbox \"exactly one\"\nassertions are scoped to the test''s own transfer line (the outbox key), and the\nKafka read filters on the same line id. Assertions are unchanged in strength.\n\nkafkatc: poll FindCoordinator through a dedicated kafka-go Transport instead\nof the process-global DefaultTransport, whose ~6 s metadata cache would\notherwise hand later writers a stale view lacking just-created topics.\nAdd the helper''s own integration test (fresh FindCoordinator right after Start\n+ a real consumer-group read).\n\n* test: move the product-master hand-over test onto the shared Kafka helper\n\ndevelop gained product_master_handover_integration_test.go (ADR 0034) after\nthis branch was cut. It started its own confluent-local container directly and\ncalled the local waitForGroupCoordinator this PR deletes. Use kafkatc.Start\n(waits for the group coordinator) so it gets the same cold-broker protection\nand the strengthened fitness rule passes.","tree":{"sha":"006ecf3808f4755c2a41dcc67559827697248170","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/inventory-storage/git/trees/006ecf3808f4755c2a41dcc67559827697248170"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/inventory-storage/git/commits/0b825332ff2bfb9a915d42b86d23dcd00fca452b","verification":{"payload":"tree 006ecf3808f4755c2a41dcc67559827697248170\nparent 0145e63ed1ba7e0f9b698f74ba70493977612a86\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1791340846 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791340846 -0300\n\ntest: share one cold-broker-safe Kafka testcontainer helper across all integration tests (#153)\n\n* test: share one cold-broker-safe Kafka testcontainer helper across all integration tests\n\nAdd internal/testsupport/kafkatc (integration-tagged, test-only): Start boots\nconfluentinc/confluent-local:7.6.1 via testcontainers and returns only once\nthe group coordinator answers FindCoordinator, so a cold broker''s [15]\nGroupCoordinatorNotAvailable (kafka-go then sleeps a fixed 5 s JoinGroupBackoff\nper attempt) can no longer eat a test''s wait window.\n\nUse it from facilitycache, outbound/kafka (publisher + analytics partition)\nand usecases (transfer allocation/receipt); delete the local\nwaitForGroupCoordinator copy from PR #146 and the blank tckafka imports that\nonly existed to satisfy the fitness rule.\n\nFitness rule TestKafkaIntegrationTestsUseTestcontainers now requires the\nshared helper (file or sibling) and forbids starting the testcontainers Kafka\nmodule directly; detector test added.\n\n* test: make the transfer receipt tests -count-safe and the helper''s warm-up hermetic\n\ntransfer_receipt_integration_test.go seeded fixed ids (tl-recv-1, SKU-RECV,\nBIN-RB2, ...) into the Postgres/Kafka shared by the whole test binary and\nasserted GLOBAL outbox counts, so the second -count iteration failed with\n\"seed allocation save: transfer line already decided\". Every test now suffixes\nits transfer/line/SKU/site/bin ids per invocation, outbox \"exactly one\"\nassertions are scoped to the test''s own transfer line (the outbox key), and the\nKafka read filters on the same line id. Assertions are unchanged in strength.\n\nkafkatc: poll FindCoordinator through a dedicated kafka-go Transport instead\nof the process-global DefaultTransport, whose ~6 s metadata cache would\notherwise hand later writers a stale view lacking just-created topics.\nAdd the helper''s own integration test (fresh FindCoordinator right after Start\n+ a real consumer-group read).\n\n* test: move the product-master hand-over test onto the shared Kafka helper\n\ndevelop gained product_master_handover_integration_test.go (ADR 0034) after\nthis branch was cut. It started its own confluent-local container directly and\ncalled the local waitForGroupCoordinator this PR deletes. Use kafkatc.Start\n(waits for the group coordinator) so it gets the same cold-broker protection\nand the strengthened fitness rule passes.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxbEuCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAXn0QAJeFzoTIWPwlMhwDTRMxMqHb\nuhObdpipbJFNBhPC4JALHOKObADRfJsRflrfmqysT2o7sdL5CliewHWpzl/Pu5Q/\nqgX6MYLNaDQ9qRG/rZaBEf5ypmulEHDzCFch9tuK1s/dltEKJGmUyEdR6XjDQvvr\nY1sw7ofkHS1871VbvLXbJLgJ7aMCgvAPuLx3oIJ8ObeInKtIuYsyVMBUt9GSbgsm\nO3wmgkaq2DVIOokOMZ+RaK/fVIn9yAJaCw3ygs0hWrJddxDap5zuEH+TefNjGnD+\n+AgkVQ1GssiscfL3YJV42mZEt0qvjSZ/JcRD38upS/hr2m7EgnCHiQpJ/zxvNQnJ\n3dsuQAIPJQcwhUceYTYYAjzmiiy9gyG3b8dohavGlgBTeeqYa0M2RuEGN/okBAJR\n4rzOpIrlTpffg1jMZzf6v0QDSEpAdTslEi9ipxDj9d95jj86Ud5JuPqSSLCQLGSV\n6c2utU52C8ODgQc5059YGBqwC8c3spDUAoXUPwHhyS/BXOgcq6QR7Un+bPQdrIP1\ncCpEJo3GvcKFCQA188byHQa6YXJgq+VQ7jZ/3a7SVRIfKfTrzRr9C0ub5tGUHNFC\n/895nxi9I7+2mgUmeicjnRGKSSqDR6vicNlXYQarioFJI6dvcH8bOVHUKBghMSAR\nUn7WZQo+6I1d7FJN19Tl\n=5wHL\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T02:40:47Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos