ox event only when the HTTP\nidempotency middleware had already put its transaction on the context. A\nfailed reservation save or publish from any other caller left reserved\nquantity on the stock units with no reservation.\n\nMove the saves inside the atomically() scope. Tests: a scope-tracking unit\ntest without middleware, and a testcontainers Postgres test that fails the\npublish and asserts the stock unit''s reserved quantity and the reservation\nrows roll back. Update the use-cases and sequence-diagrams pages.","tree":{"sha":"c420004720b393f887cb42c0c440a3c46962cea0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/inventory-storage/git/trees/c420004720b393f887cb42c0c440a3c46962cea0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/inventory-storage/git/commits/5f88dd5ef8e373a46c04094284207b1aa633e20e","verification":{"payload":"tree c420004720b393f887cb42c0c440a3c46962cea0\nparent 6db10c7c0e4e299e7ee1db52f8d7dbda6106c236\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1791285878 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791285878 -0300\n\nfix: resolve findings from the 2026-10-05 docs audit (#140)\n\n* docs(domain): point version-field comments at ADR 0019\n\nThe version field on Reservation, StockUnit and Bin is optimistic\nconcurrency metadata (ADR 0019). The comments cited ADR 0018, which is the\nIdempotency-Key middleware.\n\n* fix(reserve-stock): save touched stock units inside the use case''s UnitOfWork\n\nThe StockUnit saves ran before the use case''s own UnitOfWork opened and\nwere atomic with the reservation row and the outbox event only when the HTTP\nidempotency middleware had already put its transaction on the context. A\nfailed reservation save or publish from any other caller left reserved\nquantity on the stock units with no reservation.\n\nMove the saves inside the atomically() scope. Tests: a scope-tracking unit\ntest without middleware, and a testcontainers Postgres test that fails the\npublish and asserts the stock unit''s reserved quantity and the reservation\nrows roll back. Update the use-cases and sequence-diagrams pages.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxNp3CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAs04QAIFK8Teh2NsBY+cEpjTVc4Gl\n0ob5HAs0UcwTPEvWmGR5Vl29ezEfRjqnB2J4bljVt/vIPGN+3DhT7lPgtrQ/5OQg\ng1bqQaBZW7gFaQzveBP0L6cpJPPAEPqMeOSNCY2Rx7XxYwJ/Uti1xvF6f/a928MS\nClGgHJwIcpvjoXv9/T8aHAltQVqkSPOpoVUDQG5KGfQ0K/GsFiUfPlSwIpcHgyoB\n+mENPSW9Ri9VXrkTWOuKU1T7oM3F479cs60gBLOXT/B7WMt5kPPbnhFjyFLnWdyk\nz0Q5mISWBpNKHrK+8MmxePmj91EiD1b8alPFY/YbdlvORfF5Zv5WKGWVOrpNYtfQ\nmh6/nMfoApx2qJ5QDCikO2AV66R0KV8OL0zrq+EbbuUk4Pw9LNkTIKXPXy3LVa2/\nYd9BZc2a9xlWt76uAezdpGaUyQZjAG+cfboLugaqfKsCJ6+fOlhux1aPX82b8Mra\nSoEO1qoGPScvP+raKOy+oC2oqHlM4Pexxexzg2+4Zl475F1Jkop8KAghL+Hf0Z8J\nyKtYeQIUkwo4+a1xfz/PCegQeFcrS6WAfM8RJjRTRj0+zW0r0YbQ3sf344SXaEAe\nhUIh9JqW0oUwX72w99rYmZg8W+Az3lgH87y2Benc55qi5fPn17xjQPALC8kHcj0y\nDduWLgxH2F8fQJ5psPrF\n=9tSe\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T11:24:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/IQVO/inventory-storage