,{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4073304?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claudioed","id":4073304,"login":"claudioed","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzMzMDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/inventory-storage/commits/2bbea9d40785ace991d0b538c56f2665a718d5e7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T01:09:57Z","email":"claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T01:09:57Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Tier-1 audit fixes: Postgres tests on testcontainers, sensor, rehydrate errors (#136)\n\n* test: run env-gated Postgres integration tests on testcontainers\n\nReplace DATABASE_URL/ANALYTICS_DATABASE_URL + t.Skip gates with throwaway Postgres containers (postgresURL/outboxDB/ocDB helpers, TestMain container for analyticsstore). Drop the now-unused Postgres service and DATABASE_URL from the CI integration job (job name unchanged) and update Makefile/README.\n\nAudit F1/F2/F3 item A.\n\n* test(architecture): sensor that Postgres integration tests use testcontainers\n\nTestPostgresIntegrationTestsUseTestcontainers mirrors the Kafka rule: no DATABASE_URL/ANALYTICS_DATABASE_URL reads, no env-tied t.Skip, and Postgres-touching files must import the testcontainers postgres module (directly or via a sibling _test.go helper). TestPostgresIntegrationDetector proves it fails on bad fixtures. Audit item B.\n\n* fix(postgres): fail rehydration on invalid rows instead of zero-value VOs\n\nstock_repo scanStockUnit, location_repo FindByID and reservation_repo FindByID/FindByDemandRef/loadAllocations discarded NewSKU/NewBinId/NewQuantity errors, so a corrupt row became a zero-value VO inside an aggregate. They now go through rehydrate* helpers that return wrapped errors (rehydrate sku \"\": ...). Unit tests per helper plus a testcontainers test seeding an empty-SKU stock unit and reservation. Audit item C.\n\nAllocation bin_id stays an unvalidated conversion: it is nullable for legacy rows (0008 backfill).","tree":{"sha":"7a607f30614818ce494ee3716ed5da740358bc89","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/inventory-storage/git/trees/7a607f30614818ce494ee3716ed5da740358bc89"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/inventory-storage/git/commits/2bbea9d40785ace991d0b538c56f2665a718d5e7","verification":{"payload":"tree 7a607f30614818ce494ee3716ed5da740358bc89\nparent d62b9dedc9e9c80d96a0c2d6aabafebdb6bb69af\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1791248997 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791248997 -0300\n\nTier-1 audit fixes: Postgres tests on testcontainers, sensor, rehydrate errors (#136)\n\n* test: run env-gated Postgres integration tests on testcontainers\n\nReplace DATABASE_URL/ANALYTICS_DATABASE_URL + t.Skip gates with throwaway Postgres containers (postgresURL/outboxDB/ocDB helpers, TestMain container for analyticsstore). Drop the now-unused Postgres service and DATABASE_URL from the CI integration job (job name unchanged) and update Makefile/README.\n\nAudit F1/F2/F3 item A.\n\n* test(architecture): sensor that Postgres integration tests use testcontainers\n\nTestPostgresIntegrationTestsUseTestcontainers mirrors the Kafka rule: no DATABASE_URL/ANALYTICS_DATABASE_URL reads, no env-tied t.Skip, and Postgres-touching files must import the testcontainers postgres module (directly or via a sibling _test.go helper). TestPostgresIntegrationDetector proves it fails on bad fixtures. Audit item B.\n\n* fix(postgres): fail rehydration on invalid rows instead of zero-value VOs\n\nstock_repo scanStockUnit, location_repo FindByID and reservation_repo FindByID/FindByDemandRef/loadAllocations discarded NewSKU/NewBinId/NewQuantity errors, so a corrupt row became a zero-value VO inside an aggregate. They now go through rehydrate* helpers that return wrapped errors (rehydrate sku \"\": ...). Unit tests per helper plus a testcontainers test seeding an empty-SKU stock unit and reservation. Audit item C.\n\nAllocation bin_id stays an unvalidated conversion: it is nullable for legacy rows (0008 backfill).","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxEplCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAwb0QAIp7tHld9CWxMPaNa5QhWlv+\n0wpEBPXVgzLPgZZ0WdmczOTN+SAPAw01PbhSzop7xNfnVatuIkKBlogv+lXaQuuw\ntYOyaZG65yLmJwuo9p5IqSIS4eCd50by5XudIrOopM2FjQXn6TKGQIOX+caKe772\nEKhqt6YpnqNWjcgDl10bFERLhpoj347CN4nazSYWY4mU9Cp3IYRjL2bWbTWntZDN\nFT0AqI8SIK6Z/mpdEqGOM0rq7uIx9IRwA3nJO4tQjD6br8j7U6MSchw28J/9Qyi8\n2nvBjikYNZwd/BQpx/pPBGL9U/dyz6mMA2v2FouJUuDKc2Q0gk1WpsXd59ISYAVo\nGvxXGazKXdT/aT3J+PQXrhio17HCHs98S//107K5AMIf686qxtUgst4Sx6lMU+wY\n9d6hU11KrFWpwiDRkTsvCHpK39PjNzonxhz3iJlZN2Z4vQwxdfhwOrLVMIHc0p4S\nDcC9zXorh+hadTMElKbQlndbbw1nr3GvIqrH3zcyKoKB8pUyyWSL9/+3e2w5G9vb\nvUC7VlW6BO1JVqtRMDKL1GGFFZ9Mb6z4WwIoFO6JtyefwfWDnkiIT4fZByM1/jt/\nCDaf4S9BkNIcL2pTr2az00JMu/oH2/zp4aDjO/fMXa/e/8ATMs6XqPrPNceiS9Pl\n3MOJPVxNF1bS6Nv5qTgx\n=U2SP\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T01:09:57Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/u