ed personal account to the IQVO org.\nGITHUB_TOKEN can only write packages under the repository owner''s\nnamespace, so docker-publish/release jobs pushing to\nghcr.io/claudioed/* fail with permission_denied after the move.\n\n- ci.yml: ghcr.io/claudioed -> ghcr.io/iqvo (docker push, cosign\n  sign/attest, SBOM, helm chart OCI push, release notes)\n- ci.yml: warehouse-ui-kit checkout now points at IQVO/warehouse-ui-kit\n- charts/*/values.yaml: default image.repository owner claudioed -> iqvo","tree":{"sha":"f01320f93c115f5a438ceeb88720b0f585a8ce6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/inventory-storage/git/trees/f01320f93c115f5a438ceeb88720b0f585a8ce6d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/inventory-storage/git/commits/7083955342e9ccd0b3f27880bf5a1517e171bace","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4073304?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claudioed","id":4073304,"login":"claudioed","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzMzMDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/IQVO/inventory-storage/commit/7083955342e9ccd0b3f27880bf5a1517e171bace","node_id":"C_kwDOUAjBuNoAKDcwODM5NTUzNDJlOWNjZDBiM2YyNzg4MGJmNWExNTE3ZTE3MWJhY2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/IQVO/inventory-storage/commit/eb069bce5ab1ea73ddc7a6b9ff4b9d618a277471","sha":"eb069bce5ab1ea73ddc7a6b9ff4b9d618a277471","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/inventory-storage/commits/eb069bce5ab1ea73ddc7a6b9ff4b9d618a277471"}],"sha":"7083955342e9ccd0b3f27880bf5a1517e171bace","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/inventory-storage/commits/7083955342e9ccd0b3f27880bf5a1517e171bace"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4073304?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claudioed","id":4073304,"login":"claudioed","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzMzMDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/inventory-storage/commits/d4b513e268ddd0f0a68de76684ad4232bab06578/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T16:16:45Z","email":"claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T16:16:45Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: refresh project documentation against develop (#120) (#121)\n\n* docs: refresh project documentation against develop\n\nFleet org rename (claudioed -> IQVO, 2026-10-03):\n- README.md, docs/docusaurus.config.ts, SECURITY.md,\n  docs/docs/ecosystem/integration.md, docs/docs/api-reference/events.md,\n  .claude/skills/how-to-add-a-frontend-remote.md: update GitHub org\n  references (Pages URL, editUrl, navbar/footer links, security advisory\n  URL, self-repo/sibling-repo links) from claudioed to IQVO. ADR bodies are\n  left untouched (immutable; they cite historical PR/commit URLs that were\n  genuinely under the claudioed org at the time).\n\nADR index drift:\n- docs/docs/adr/about.md and docs/sidebars.ts were missing ADR-0019\n  (optimistic concurrency), ADR-0020 (resilience), ADR-0022 (HPA/pgxpool\n  tuning) and ADR-0023 (migrations direct Postgres connection) in one or\n  both places, even though the ADR files themselves exist on develop and\n  are Accepted. Added the missing rows/sidebar entries so the published\n  index matches the 25 real ADR files.\n\nFact fixes grounded in code:\n- .claude/rules/integration-events.md claimed apis/asyncapi.yaml documents\n  an \"11-event catalog\". Counted the actual message types in\n  apis/asyncapi.yaml: 10. The 11th domain event (ProductClassified) is\n  domain-only and intentionally not in the AsyncAPI catalog (already\n  correctly stated on docs/docs/api-reference/events.md). Fixed the count\n  and reworded to point at the correct source of truth.\n- docs/docs/overview/architecture.md''s CI quality-gate table was missing 4\n  real jobs defined in .github/workflows/ci.yml: `complexity` (gocyclo/\n  gocognit/cyclop/funlen/nestif lint), `contract` (Schemathesis against\n  apis/openapi.yaml), `evals-tests` (MCP eval gate as its own named check)\n  and `release` (main-only semver tag + GitHub release). Added rows for\n  all four with a one-line description grounded in the workflow file.\n\nVerification performed in a fresh worktree (../.worktrees/inventory-storage-docs-refresh-1003):\n- cd docs && npm ci && npm run typecheck && npm run build: all green.\n- Reproduced the docs-api-drift CI job exactly (npm run clean-api-docs\n  inventory && npm run gen-api-docs inventory) and confirmed\n  `git diff --exit-code -- docs/api-reference/rest` is clean (no drift).\n- docs/tsconfig.json already carries the TS7/baseUrl workaround; left as-is.\n  grep -c \"rspack/binding-linux-x64-gnu\" docs/package-lock.json == 3\n  (healthy); lockfile left untouched. No @faker-js/faker override present.\n- git status after regen shows only the intended doc files changed.\n\nOut of scope, reported not fixed (see PR description):\n- .github/workflows/ci.yml still checks out `claudioed/warehouse-ui-kit`\n  and pushes images to `ghcr.io/claudioed/inventory-storage` — stale org\n  references in a file this task is not allowed to touch.\n- CLAUDE.md / AGENTS.md are write-protected; a refreshed draft (ADR range\n  0001..0025, missing MIGRATIONS_DATABASE_URL/OUTBOX_RELAY_INTERVAL env\n  vars) is at\n  /Users/claudioed/.hermes/cache/scratch/docs-drafts/inventory-storage/CLAUDE.md.draft\n  for the parent session to apply.\n\n* docs: refresh CLAUDE.md ADR range and env vars\n\nFix stale ADR range 0001..0024 to 0001..0025 and add the missing\nMIGRATIONS_DATABASE_URL / OUTBOX_RELAY_INTERVAL env vars to the Code\nStandards list, matching current main.go and migrations.","tree":{"sha":"3fda2e4f7ab1340a4e004fb479a64fcff8c4b660","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/inventory-storage/git/trees/3fda2e4f7ab1340a4e004fb479a64fcff8c4b660"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/inventory-storage/git/commits/d4b513e268ddd0f0a68de76684ad4232bab06578","verification":{"payload":"tree 3fda2e4f7ab1340a4e004fb479a64fcff8c4b660\nparent 4d71aeb3fb367965eb0a90691aab60afe8646680\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1791044205 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791044205 -0300\n\ndocs: refresh project documentation against develop (#120) (#121)\n\n* docs: refresh project documentation against develop\n\nFleet org rename (claudioed -> IQVO, 2026-10-03):\n- README.md, docs/docusaurus.config.ts, SECURITY.md